<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JHN" style="id">- Mwela Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">YOWANA</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ngani Jammbone Malinga Pujijandikwe na a Yowana</para>
  <para style="toc2">Yowana</para>
  <para style="toc3">YWN</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ngani ja Mmbone Malinga Pujijandikwe na a</para>
  <para style="mt1">Yowana</para>
  <para style="imt">Shilongolelo</para>
  <para style="ip">Ngani ja Mmbone malinga pujijandikwe na a Yowana ni shitabhu shimo munkumbi gwa itabhu nsheshe ya Malagano ga Ambi shitaya ga ndamo ja a Yeshu Kilishitu. Yowe puishemwa “Injili” malombolelo gakwe “Ngani ja Mmbone.”</para>
  <para style="ip">Puijandikwe bhakaweje a Yeshu na a Matei na a Maliko na a Luka na a Yowana.</para>
  <para style="ip">Shitabhu sha Ngani ja Mmbone malinga pushijandikwe na a Yowana shinaganishiwa kuti pushijandikwe na antume a Yowana tome na shaka sha 90 AD. Nkali shitabhusho shikalanguya kuti a Yowana ni bhajandishe, ikabhe shishishite jandikwa shinalandana na bhaluwa ja Ntai na ja Bhili na ja Tatu ja a Yowana. Guna bhajandikanga bha bhukala pubhaganishiyenje kuti a Yowana kubhatamaga ku Epesho, kwa nneyo nnaino puimanyika kuti shitabhusho kushijandikwe ku Epesho.</para>
  <para style="ip">A Yowana bhashibhalanga gwangali ng'iyo shibhatumbilile nshitabhumo kupinga shibhashonjebho, bhakulupalilanje kuti a Yeshu ni a Kilishitu, Mwana jwa a Nnungu bhali bhabhakoto (20:31). Kwakulupalila genego shitukole gumi kwa lina lyabho.</para>
  <para style="ip">Shitabhu shashinkujandikwa kubhashomanga bhowe, Bhayaudi na bhangabha Bhayaudi. Ngani ja Mmbone ja a Yowana guna jinakanana na itabhu ina itatu ya Ngani ja Mmbone. Ibhatumbilile taya ga ilapo ibhatendile a Yeshu na bhangapunda jandika ga ndango. Malinga ubhatisho gwa a Yeshu na ga lingwa kwabho kuanga yangajandikwa mwene nshitabhu sha Ngani ja Mmbonemo.</para>
  <para style="iot">Ipali Mwenemo</para>
  <para style="io">1. A Yowana bhanatandubha Ngani ja Mmbone nnango gwa 1:1-18.</para>
  <para style="io">2. Gubhajandishe ga ilapo ishoko ibhatendile a Yeshu (1:19, 12:50).</para>
  <para style="io">3. Kabhili bhashitaya indu yaigwinji yakoposhele nndamo ja a Yeshu yalongweye kuwa na yuka kwabho (13:1, 20:31).</para>
  <para style="io">4. A Yowana bhanamaliya Ngani ja Mmbone nnango gwa ja 21 kwa lugula mobha a Yeshu gubhaakoposhelenje bhandunji bhakayusheje kopoka kubhawilenje. Tandubhila penepo gubhatumbilile jandika shitabhu shabho.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JHN 1"/>
  <para style="s">Lilobhe Ashinkubha Mundu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 1:1"/>Kundandubhoko, ashinkupagwa Lilobhe, Lilobhejo paaliji pamo na a Nnungu, shibhaliji a Nnungu na jwalakwe Lilobhe paaliji nneyo peyo. <verse eid="JHN 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 1:2"/>Lilobheju paaliji pamo na a Nnungu kuuumila kundandubho. <verse eid="JHN 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 1:3"/>Indu yowe puipengenywe kupitila Jwenejo, shakwa shindu shipengenywe gwangali jwenejo. <verse eid="JHN 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 1:4"/>Jwenejo shiumilo sha gumi na pugwaliji shilangaya kubhandu. <verse eid="JHN 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 1:5"/>Shilangayasho shinalangaya pa lubhindu, wala lubhindu lwangakombola kuima shilangaya.<verse eid="JHN 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 1:6"/>Gwakoposhele mundu jumo atumilwe na a Nnungu, lina lyakwe a Yowana, <verse eid="JHN 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 1:7"/>jwenejo ashinkuika kukong'ondela ga shilangayasho. Nkupinga kwa ntenga gwakwe bhandu bhowe bhakulupalilanje. <verse eid="JHN 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 1:8"/>A Yowana bhayene nngabha shene shilangayasho, ikabhe bhashinkuika kukong'ondela ga jwene aliji shilangayasho. <verse eid="JHN 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 1:9"/>Jweneju ni shilangaya shiyene akwiya pa shilambolyo, kukwamulishilanga bhandu bhowe.<verse eid="JHN 1:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 1:10"/>Shilangayajo paaliji pashilambolyo, kupitila jwenejo shilambolyo gushipengenywe, ikabheje bhandu bha pa shilambolyo bhangammanyanga. <verse eid="JHN 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 1:11"/>Aishe kubhandu bhakwe, ikabheje bhandu bhakwe bhangamposhelanga. <verse eid="JHN 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 1:12"/>Ikabheje bhowe bhamposhelenje nikunkulupalila, gwabhatendilenje kubha bhana bha a Nnungu, <verse eid="JHN 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 1:13"/>bhabhelekwenje nngabha kwa komboywa na mundu, wala mashili ga shiilu wala kwaapinga mundu, ikabhe kwaapinga a Nnungu.<verse eid="JHN 1:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 1:14"/>Lilobhe gwatendeshe kubha mundu nigwatemi kunngwetu. Na uwe gutuubhweni ukonjelo gwakwe, ukonjelo guka Mwana jwa jika akoposhela kwa Atati, agumbele nema na kweli.<verse eid="JHN 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 1:15"/>A Yowana bhabhatisha bhayene gubhaabhalanjilenje bhandu kwa lilobhe lya utiya bhalinkuti, “Jweneju junantayaga kuti, ‘Akwiya nnyuma jangu jwankulungwa kumbunda nne, pabha aapali nne nganabhe pagwa.’ ”<verse eid="JHN 1:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 1:16"/>Kwa ligongo lya punda nema jabho, uwe tubhowe tupatile mboka ja punda. <verse eid="JHN 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 1:17"/>Pabha Shalia pujiishe kupitila a Musha, nema na kweli puiishe kupitila a Yeshu Kilishitu. <verse eid="JHN 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 1:18"/>Jwakwa mundu jojowe abhabhweni a Nnungu, ikabhe Mwana jwa jikape jwa a Nnungu, ali pamo na Atati, jwenejo atulangwiye shibhali a Nnungu.<verse eid="JHN 1:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">A Yowana Bhakuti Nngabha a Kilishitu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Matei 3:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Maliko 1:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-18">Luka 3:1-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 1:19"/>Gweguno ni ukong'ondelo gwa a Yowana ku bhakulungwanji bha Bhayaudi bha ku Yelushalemu, pubhaatumilenje bhakulungwanji bha bhishila na Bhalawi, bhakaabhuyanje a Yowana, “Mmwe agani?”<verse eid="JHN 1:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 1:20"/>A Yowana bhangakana kwaajangulanga, gubhaabhalanjilenje gwangali nng'iyo, “Nne nngabha a Kilishitu.”<verse eid="JHN 1:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 1:21"/>Penepo gubhaabhushiyenje, “Bhai, Mmwe agani? Bhuli, mmwe a Eliya?” A Yowana gubhajangwile, “Nng'oope, nne nngabha bhene.” Gubhabhushiyenje, “Mmwe ankulondola bha a Nnungu bhala?” A Yowana gubhaajangwilenje, “Nng'oope.”<verse eid="JHN 1:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 1:22"/>Bhalabhonji gubhaabhushiyenje, “Bhai, mmwe agani? Nkwitaya bhuli mmayene? Ntubhalanjile, nkupinga tukaabhalanjilanje bhatutumilenje kukummuya bhala.”<verse eid="JHN 1:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 1:23"/>A Yowana gubhaajangwilenje, malinga ankulondola bha a Nnungu a Ishaya shibhalugwile. “Nne ni lilobhe lika mundu lipilikanika kuanga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 1:23">Mwaalashiyanje Bhakulungwa mpanda gwabho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 1:23">‘Nngoloyanje mushibhapite.’ ”<verse eid="JHN 1:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 1:24"/>Bhene bhandunji bhatumilwenje na Mapalishayo bhala, <verse eid="JHN 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 1:25"/>gubhaabhushiyenje a Yowana, “Monaga mmwe nngabha a Kilishitu na nngabha a Eliya na wala nngabha ankulondola bha a Nnungu bhala, pakuti nnabhatisha?”<verse eid="JHN 1:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 1:26"/>A Yowana gubhaajangwilenje, “Nne ngunabhatisha kwa mashi, ikabheje bhapali bhamo munkumbi gwenunji bhunkanabhe kwaamanyanga. <figure style="fig" alt="Sandals" file="NT-05 Sandals.jpg" size="col" ref="1:26">Mundu Aligopola Mbundo ya Ilatu</figure> <verse eid="JHN 1:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 1:27"/>Bhene bhunalugwile bhanakwiya nnyuma jangu, nne nangatopela kubha ntumishi jwabho nkali jwa gopola mbundo ya ilatu yabho.”<verse eid="JHN 1:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 1:28"/>Genego kugatendeshe ku Bhetania, kung'ambo lushi lwa Yolodani kubhabhatishaga a Yowana.<verse eid="JHN 1:28"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mwana Ngondolo jwa a Nnungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 1:29"/>Malabhi gakwe, a Yowana gubhaabhweni a Yeshu bhalinkwajiila, gubhashite, “Nnole, bhenebha Mwana Ngondolo jwa a Nnungu, bhaajigala yambi ya bhandu bha pashilambolyo! <verse eid="JHN 1:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 1:30"/>Bhenebha bhunakungulushilaga nilinkuti, ‘Nnyuma jangu bhanakwiya bhandu bhamo bhali bhakulungwa kumbunda nne, pabha bhaapali nne nganabhe pagwa!’ <verse eid="JHN 1:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 1:31"/>Nne namwene ngaamanyiji, ikabheje njikwiya bhatisha kwa mashi nkupinga bhandu bha Ishilaeli bhaamanyanje.”<verse eid="JHN 1:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 1:32"/>A Yowana gubhakong'ondele bhalinkuti, “Nashinkumona Mbumu jwa a Nnungu alituluka mbuti nnjubha, kukoposhela kunnungu nikwaatula. <verse eid="JHN 1:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 1:33"/>Nne nganaamanye, ikabheje bhene bhandumile kubhatisha kwa mashi bhala bhanugulile, ‘Mundu jushimummone alikuntula Mbumu jwa Ukonjelo, jwenejo shaabhatishe kwa Mbumu jwa Ukonjelo.’ <verse eid="JHN 1:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 1:34"/>Nne nigabhweni na ngunakong'ondela kuti bhenebha Bhanabhabho a Nnugu.”<verse eid="JHN 1:34"/></para>
  <para style="s">Bhaajiganywa bha Ndandubho bha a Yeshu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 1:35"/>Malabhi gakwe, a Yowana pubhaaliji na bhaajiganywa bhabho bhabhili. <verse eid="JHN 1:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 1:36"/>Bhakaabhoneje a Yeshu bhalipita, gubhashite, “Nnolanje! Mwana Ngondolo jwa a Nnungu.”<verse eid="JHN 1:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 1:37"/>Bhaajiganywa bhabhili bha a Yowana bhala, bhakapilikananjeje gene malobhego, gubhaakagwilenje a Yeshu. <verse eid="JHN 1:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 1:38"/>Bhai, a Yeshu gubhatendebhwishe gubhaabhweninji bhaajiganywa bha a Yowana bhalikwakagulanga, gubhaabhushiyenje, “Nkuloleyanga nndi?” Bhalabhonji gubhaajangwilenje, “Alabhi, kunkutama kwei?” A Labhi, malombolelo gakwe Bhaajiganya.<verse eid="JHN 1:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 1:39"/>A Yeshu gubhabhaalanjilenje, “Nnjiyangananje shimpabhonanje.” Bhaajiganywa bhala gubhaakagwilenje gubhapabhweninji pubhatamaga, puyaliji shaa kumi ja ligulo na gubhatemi nabhonji lyene lyubhalyo.<verse eid="JHN 1:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 1:40"/>Jumo jwa bhene bhaajiganywa bhabhili bhaapilikenenje a Yowana bhalibheleketa nikwakagula a Yeshu, pubhashemwaga a Ndeleya, apwabho a Shimoni Petili. <verse eid="JHN 1:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 1:41"/>A Ndeleya gubhatandwibhe kwaaloleya akulu bhabho a Shimoni, gubhaalugulile, “Twaabhweni a Mashiya” malombolelo gakwe a Kilishitu Bhaatapula. <verse eid="JHN 1:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 1:42"/>Kungai gubhaapeleshe kwa a Yeshu. Na bhalabho a Yeshu gubhaalolile nigubhashite, “Mmwe a Shimoni bhana bhabho a Yowana. Nnaino shinshemwe a Kepa.” Malombolelo gakwe Petili, yani, “Liganga.”<verse eid="JHN 1:42"/></para>
  <para style="s">A Yeshu Bhanakwaashemanga a Pilipi na a Natanaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 1:43"/>Malabhi gakwe a Yeshu gubhapinjile kwenda ku Galilaya. Bhai, gubhaabhweni a Pilipi gubhaabhalanjile, “Nngagule.” <verse eid="JHN 1:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 1:44"/>A Pilipi pubhaliji bhandu bha ku Bhetishaida shilambo shibhatamaga a Ndeleya na a Petili. <verse eid="JHN 1:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 1:45"/>A Pilipi bhakaabhoneje a Natanaeli nigubhaabhalanjile, “Twaabhweni bhene bhajandikwe muitabhu ya shalia ya a Musha na ya ashinkulondola bha a Nnungu, a Yeshu bhana bhabho a Yoshepu bha ku Nashaleti.”<verse eid="JHN 1:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 1:46"/>A Natanaeli gubhaabhushiye a Pilipi, “Bhuli, inakomboleka shindu shoshowe sha mmbone kukopoka ku Nashaleti?” A Pilipi gubhaabhalanjile, “Nnjiye kunnole.” <verse eid="JHN 1:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 1:47"/>A Yeshu bhakaabhoneje a Natanaeli bhalikwajiila, gubhashite, “Nnolanje, bhenebha Bhaishilaeli bha kweli, bhangali ya nyata muntima gwabho.”<verse eid="JHN 1:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 1:48"/>A Natanaeli gubhaabhushiye, “Mmwe pummanyi nne shanabhuli?” A Yeshu gubhajangwile, “Nammweni nni paina nkongo pala, nkali nkanabhe shemwa na a Pilipi.”<verse eid="JHN 1:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 1:49"/>Penepo a Natanaeli gubhaalugulile, “Mmajiganya, mmwe Bhanabhabho a Nnungu. Mmwe a Mpalume bha Ishilaeli!”<verse eid="JHN 1:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 1:50"/>A Yeshu gubhaabhalanjile, “Bhuli, nnakulupalila pabha njikummalanjila kuti namweni nni paina nkongo pala? Shinngabhone gamakulungwa kupunda genega.” <verse eid="JHN 1:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 1:51"/>A Yeshu gubhapundile kubheleketa, “Kweli kweli ngunakummalanjilanga, shinkubhonanje kunnungu kuliuguka na ashimalaika bha a Nnungu bhalikwelanga na tuluka kwangu nne Mwana juka Mundu.”<verse eid="JHN 1:51"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JHN 2"/>
  <para style="s">A Yeshu ku Ndowa ja ku Kana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 2:1"/>Pantondo gwakwe jashinkupagwa ndowa kunjini ku Kana, shilambo sha Galilaya na anyinabhabho a Yeshu bhaapali, <verse eid="JHN 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 2:2"/>a Yeshu na bhaajiganywa bhabho nabhalabhonji bhashinkushemwanga ku ndowajo. <verse eid="JHN 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 2:3"/>Divai ja ndowa jikamaleje, anyinabhabho a Yeshu gubhaabhalanjile, “Bhangalinginji divai!”<verse eid="JHN 2:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 2:4"/>A Yeshu gubhaajangwile, “Mama, uwe shetu nndi? Malanga gangu gakanabheika.”<verse eid="JHN 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 2:5"/>Anyinabhabho gubhaabhalanjilenje bhatumishi, “Lyolyowe lishibhannugulilanje, ntendanje.”<verse eid="JHN 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 2:6"/>Penepo gashinkupagwa matende shita ga maganga, litende limo lya gumbala lulo pabhili eu patatu. Gashinkubhikwa penepo kwa nkubho gwa Bhayaudi gwa tawasha. <verse eid="JHN 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 2:7"/>A Yeshu gubhaalugulilenje, “Nngumbayanje mashi mmatendemo.” Nabhalabhonji gubhagumbeyenje tetete. <verse eid="JHN 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 2:8"/>Kungai gubhaalugulilenje bhatumishi, “Nnaino ntekanje nkaapanganje bhakulungwa bha kalamu.”<verse eid="JHN 2:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 2:9"/>Bhakulungwa bha kalamu bhakapayeje divai jaliji mashi jila, bhangakumanya kujakoposhele, ikabheje bhatumishi bhateshilenje mashi bhamumanyinji. Bhakulungwa bha kalamu bhala gubhanshemile nkulomba, <verse eid="JHN 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 2:10"/>gubhannugulile, “Bhandu bhowe bhanatandubhanga kutekanya divai ja mmbone, bhapapilangaga kwa kaje nitekanyaga jangali jammbone. Ikabheje mmwe nshigoya divai jammbone mpaka nnaino!”<verse eid="JHN 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 2:11"/>Sheneshi shilangulo sha ndandubho shibhatendile a Yeshu ku Kana ja Galilaya, gubhalangwiye ukonjelo gwapuya gwabho, bhaajiganywa bhabho gubhaakulupalilenje.<verse eid="JHN 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 2:12"/>Gakapiteje genego, a Yeshu na anyinabhabho na ashaapwabho na bhaajiganywa bhabho, gubhaelelenje kwenda ku Kapalanaumu gubhatemingenenje kweneko mobha gashoko.<verse eid="JHN 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">A Yeshu ku Liekalu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:12-13">Matei 21:12-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:15-17">Maliko 11:15-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45-46">Luka 19:45-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 2:13"/>Shikukuu sha Bhayaudi sha Pashaka shikabhandishileje, na bhalabho a Yeshu gubhajombweshe kwenda ku Yelushalemu. <verse eid="JHN 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 2:14"/><figure style="fig" alt="Money Changer" file="NT-10 Money Changer.jpg" size="col" ref="2:14">Mundu Atenda Upindi gwa Tindinganya Ela</figure> v 14 Bhai, gubhaaimenenje bhandu ku Liekalu bhaliushanga ng'ombe na ngondolo na ngunda, bhananji bhatemingenenje na mesha yabhonji bhalitindiganyanga mmbiya. <verse eid="JHN 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 2:15"/>Gubhaeleye nshapilo, gubhaabhinjilenje bhandu bhowe bhakopokanje palanga ku Liekalu na ngondolo na ng'ombe yabhonji, akuno bhalipalaganya mmbiya na pindingula mesha ya bhatindiganya mmbiya, <verse eid="JHN 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 2:16"/>gubhaabhalanjilenje bhaushangaga ngunda bhala, “Nshoyanje apano yene indui. Nnatendanje nyumba ja Atati pa ushiya indu!” <verse eid="JHN 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 2:17"/>Bhaajiganywa bhabho gubhakumbushilenje kuti Majandiko ga Ukonjelo ganalugula, “Lilaka lya pinga nyumba jenu jitame ukoto, shilimboteshe.”<verse eid="JHN 2:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 2:18"/>Ashikalongolele bha Bhayaudi gubhaabhushiyenje a Yeshu, “Shintende shilangulo shashi kutulanguya kuti nnapinjikwa kutenda genega?” <verse eid="JHN 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 2:19"/>A Yeshu gubhaalugulilenje, “Mbomolanje Liekaluli, nne shinilishenje kwa mobha gatatu.” <verse eid="JHN 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 2:20"/>Bhai, Bhayaudi gubhaabhushiyenje, “Liekaluli pulyashenjilwe yaka makumi nsheshe na shita. Mmwe shanabhuli shinkombole kushenga kwa mobha gatatu?”<verse eid="JHN 2:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 2:21"/>Ikabheje Liekalu libhakungulushilaga a Yeshu, ni shiilu shabho bhayene. <verse eid="JHN 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 2:22"/>Bhai, a Yeshu bhakayuyweje, bhaajiganywa bhabho gubhakumbushilenje kuti bhatashiye gene malobhego, gubhagakulupalilenje Majandiko ga Ukonjelo na malobhe gubhatashiye a Yeshu gala.<verse eid="JHN 2:22"/></para>
  <para style="s">A Yeshu Bhanakujimanya Mitima ja Bhowe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 2:23"/>A Yeshu pubhaaliji ku Yelushalemu kushikukuu sha Pashaka, bhandu bhabhagwinji bhakaibhonanjeje ilangulo ibhaitendile gubhaakulupalilenje. <verse eid="JHN 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 2:24"/>Ikabheje a Yeshu bhangakulupalila, pabha bhajimanyi mitima jabhonji. <verse eid="JHN 2:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 2:25"/>Na bhakapingaga mundu akomelesheye shindu shoshowe ga bhandunji, pabha bhajimanyi mitima jabhonji.<verse eid="JHN 2:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JHN 3"/>
  <para style="s">A Yeshu Bhanakunguluka na a Nikodemo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 3:1"/>Bhashinkupagwa bhakulungwa bhamo bha ashikalongolele bha lukumbi lwa Bhayaudi, bha munkumbi gwa shikundi sha dini ja Bhayaudi shishemwa Mapalishayo, lina lyabho a Nikodemo. <verse eid="JHN 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 3:2"/>Lyubha limo shilo bhashinkwaajendela a Yeshu, gubhaalugulile, “Mmaajiganya, tummanyi kuti mmwe mmaajiganya ntumilwe na a Nnungu, pabha jwakwa mundu akombola kutenda yene ilangulo inkutendai, a Nnungu bhakabhe pamo naka jwenejo.”<verse eid="JHN 3:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 3:3"/>A Yeshu gubhaajangwile, “Kweli ngunakummalanjila, mundu akabhelekwe gwabhili, akagubhona Upalume gwa a Nnungu.”<verse eid="JHN 3:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 3:4"/>A Nikodemo gubhaabhushiye, “Mundu jwa nkulungwa pa bhelekwa gwabhili shanabhuli? Shakombole bhuli kujinjila nnipitiu lya akwabhe nibhelekwa gwabhili!”<verse eid="JHN 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 3:5"/>A Yeshu gubhaajangwile, “Kweli ngunakummalanjila, mundu akabhelekwe kwa mashi na kwa Mbumu jwa a Nnungu, akakombola kujinjila mu Upalume gwa a Nnungu. <verse eid="JHN 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 3:6"/>Shibhelekwe kwa shiilu ni shiilu na shibhelekwe kwa Mbumu ni mbumu. <verse eid="JHN 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 3:7"/>Nnaimonje pabha njibheleketa kuti, nnapinjikwanga mmelekwanje gwabhili. <verse eid="JHN 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 3:8"/>Mbungo jinapuga niloya kujipinga, mpugo gwakwe gunapilikanika, ikabheje kukamanyika kuukoposhela wala kuukwenda. Nneyo peyo puili kuka mundu abhelekwa kwa Mbumu jwa a Nnungu.”<verse eid="JHN 3:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 3:9"/>A Nikodemo gubhaabhushiye, “Genega shigakomboleshe shanabhuli?”<verse eid="JHN 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 3:10"/>A Yeshu gubhaajangwile, “Mmwe mmaajiganya bha pa Ishilaeli, bhuli, nnagamanye genega? <verse eid="JHN 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 3:11"/>Kweli ngunakummalanjila, uwe tunabheleketa itukwimanya nikong'ondela ituibhweni, ikabheje mmanganya nkaakundanga ntenga gwetu. <verse eid="JHN 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 3:12"/>Monaga nkaakulupalipanga indu ya pa shilambolyo inimmalanjilenje, shinkulupalilanje bhuli nimmalanjilangaga indu ya kunnungu? <verse eid="JHN 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 3:13"/>Jwakwa jojowe apite kunnungu, ikabhe nne Mwana juka Mundu ngopweshe kunnungu.<verse eid="JHN 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 3:14"/>“Malinga a Musha shibhannjinwile kunani nnuishi lijoka jwa alaywa na shabha kuanga kula, nneyo peyo inapinjikwa nne Mwana juka Mundu nyinulwe kunani, <verse eid="JHN 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 3:15"/>nkupinga jojowe shakulupalile akole gumi gwa pitipiti.”<verse eid="JHN 3:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">A Nnungu Bhanakushipinga Shilambolyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 3:16"/>Pabha a Nnungu bhashinkwaapinganga bhandu pa shilambolyo, mpaka gubhampeleshe mwanagwabho jwa jika, nkupinga jojowe shankulupalile anaobhe, ikabhe akole gumi gwa pitipiti. <verse eid="JHN 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 3:17"/>Pabha a Nnungu bhangampeleka mwanagwabho kushilambolyo nkupinga aukumule bhandu, ikabhe kwabhatapulanje.<verse eid="JHN 3:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 3:18"/>“Akunkulupalila Mwana jwa a Nnungu akaukumulwa, ikabheje akakunkulupalila jwenejo aukumwilwe, pabha jwangankulupalila Mwana jwa jika jwa a Nnungu. <verse eid="JHN 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 3:19"/>Bhashiukumulwanga pabha, shilangaya shiishe pa shilambolyo, ikabheje bhandunji gubhapinjilenje lubhindu kupunda shilangaya, kwa ligongo lya itendi yabhonji yangali ya mmbone. <verse eid="JHN 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 3:20"/>Mundu jojowe atenda yambi shinakunshima shilangaya, na akabhandishila ku shilangaya, pabha akaapinga itendi yakwe ya yambi imanyishe. <verse eid="JHN 3:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 3:21"/>Ikabheje atenda itendi ya mmbone anakwiya ku shilangaya, nkupinga imanyishe kuti itendi yakwe ni yakomboywa na a Nnungu.”<verse eid="JHN 3:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">A Yowana Bhabhatisha Bhanakong'ondela ga a Yeshu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 3:22"/>Gakapiteje genego, a Yeshu na bhaajiganywa bhabho gubhapitengenenje mmbali ja ku Yudea, gubhatemi kweneko bhalibhatisha bhandu. <verse eid="JHN 3:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 3:23"/>Na bhalabho a Yowana kubhaaliji ku Ainoni, tome na ku Shalemu bhalibhatisha bhandu, pabha kweneko gashinkupagwa mashi gamagwinji. Bhandu gubhaajendelenje, na bhalabho gubhaabhatishenje. <verse eid="JHN 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 3:24"/>Gene mobhago a Yowana pubhaliji bhakanabhe kamulwa nitabhwa.<verse eid="JHN 3:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 3:25"/>Jishinkukoposhela mitau ja bhaajiganywa bha a Yowana na bhayaudi bhamo ga nkubho gwa Shiyaudi gwa tawasha. <verse eid="JHN 3:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 3:26"/>Bhai bhaajiganywa bhala gubhaajendelenje a Yowana nikwaalugulila, “Mmaajiganya, mundu aaliji na mmwe kung'ambu lushi lwa Yolodani jumwakong'ondele ga ngani jakwe jula, na jwalakwe nnaino anabhatisha na bhandu bhabhagwinji bhanakunnjendelanga.”<verse eid="JHN 3:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 3:27"/>A Yowana gubhajangwile, “Mundu nngakola shoshowe akapegwe na a Nnungu kukoposhela kunnungu. <verse eid="JHN 3:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 3:28"/>Numbe mwaashayene nnikong'ondelanga kuti nantashiyenje kuti, ‘Nne nngabha a Kilishitu Bhagombola, ikabhe njitumwa nkupinga naalongolele!’ <verse eid="JHN 3:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 3:29"/>Jwenejo malinga nkulomba, na nne malinga mmbwiga mwine nkulomba, ajima nkulindilila nkulomba aishe, anakwiinonyela kwa kaje paapilikana lilobhe lika nkulomba alikwiiya. Bhai, kwa nneyo kwiinonyela kwangu kutimilile kwa pilikana genego. <verse eid="JHN 3:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 3:30"/>Inapinjikwa bhenebho bhapunde kukuywa, nne mujile nnyuma.”<verse eid="JHN 3:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jwene Aishe Kopoka Kunnungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 3:31"/>“Jwene aishe koposhela kunani, ni jwankulungwa kupunda yowe, ikabheje jwa pashilambolyo ni jwa pashilambolyope na gabheleketa ni ga indu ya pashilambolyo. Ikabheje akwiya kukoposhela kunnungu ni jwankulungwa kupunda yowe. <verse eid="JHN 3:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 3:32"/>Jwenejo yataya yaibhweni na kwipilikana ila, ikabheje jwakwa mundu akunda ntenga gwakwe. <verse eid="JHN 3:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 3:33"/>Ikabheje mundu jo jowe akunda ntenga guka jwenejo, anakong'ondela kuti a Nnungu ni bhakweli. <verse eid="JHN 3:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 3:34"/>Jwene atumilwe na a Nnungu anabheleketa malobhe ga a Nnungu, pabha a Nnungu bhanakumpa mundu Mbumu jwabho gwangali shipimilo. <verse eid="JHN 3:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 3:35"/>A Nnungu bhanakumpinga Mwana na bhashikunkamuya yowe mmakono gakwe. <verse eid="JHN 3:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 3:36"/>Akunkulupalila mwana akwete gumi gwa pitipiti, akana kunkulupalila mwana, akakola gumi gwa pitipiti, ikabhe nnjimwa ja a Nnungu jintamile.”<verse eid="JHN 3:36"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JHN 4"/>
  <para style="s">A Yeshu na Bhakongwe Bhashamaliya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 4:1"/>Ashimapalishayo gubhapilikenenje kuti a Yeshu bhanapata na bhatisha bhaajiganywa bhabhagwinji kupunda a Yowana. <verse eid="JHN 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 4:2"/>Ikabheje a Yeshu bhayene bhangabhatisha mundu ikabhe bhabhatishangaga bhaajiganywa bhabho. <verse eid="JHN 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 4:3"/>Bhai, a Yeshu bhakagamanyeje genego, gubhajabhwile ku Yudea kubhuja ku Galilaya, <verse eid="JHN 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 4:4"/>gwene mwanjago bhashinkupinjikwa bhapite ja ku Shamalia.<verse eid="JHN 4:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 4:5"/>Bhai, gubhaishe ku Shikali shilambo shimo sha ku Shamalia, tome na nngunda gwa a Yoshepu gubhapegwilwe na ainabhabho a Yakobho bhukala. <verse eid="JHN 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 4:6"/>Penepo lishinkupagwa liiko lya a Yakobho, puyaliji malanga ga shaa shita ja mui, pabha a Yeshu bhashinkutotoshela ga mwanja gula, gubhatemi panyenje liiko.<verse eid="JHN 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 4:7"/>Bhai, gubhaishe bhakongwe bhamo bha Shishamalia kuuteka mashi. A Yeshu gubhaalugulile, “None mashi gang'wa.” <verse eid="JHN 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 4:8"/>Gene malangago bhaajiganywa bhabho kubhapitengenenje kunjini kuuma shalya.<verse eid="JHN 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 4:9"/>Bhakongwe bhala gubhaabhalanjile a Yeshu, “Mmwe Mmayaudi na nne Bhakongwe Bhashamalia! Nkukombola bhuli kunyuga mashi gang'wa?” Bhashinkubheleketa nneyo pabha Bhayaudi na Bhashamalia bhakaanganilana.<verse eid="JHN 4:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 4:10"/>A Yeshu gubhaajangwile, “Nkashimanyi shibhapinga kumpa a Nnungu, numbe gani akummalanjila, none mashi ga ng'wa, nkannjujile jwenejo akampele mashi gataga gumi.”<verse eid="JHN 4:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 4:11"/>Bhakongwe bhala gubhashite, “Mmakulungwa, mmwe mwangali nngabho na liikoli lishitaliya, kumpatile kwei mashi gataga gumigo? <verse eid="JHN 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 4:12"/>Igala mmwe mmakulungwa kupunda ambuje a Yakobho? Bhenebho ni bhatupele uwe lyene liikoli, bhayene na ashibhana bhabho na bhannyama bhabho bhang'welenje mashi ga lyene liikoli.”<verse eid="JHN 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 4:13"/>A Yeshu gubhajangwile, “Jojowe shang'we mashi ga lyene liikoli shakole njota kabhili. <verse eid="JHN 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 4:14"/>Ikabheje shang'we mashi gushinimpe nnego akakola njota kabhili. Mashi gushinimpe nnego shigaalaye nkati jakwe shinyenyei sha mashi gataga gumi gwa pitipiti.”<verse eid="JHN 4:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 4:15"/>Bhakongwe bhala gubhaalugulile, “Mmakulungwa, none mashigo ngunakole njota kabhili, ngunaishe kabhili apano kuteka mashi.”<verse eid="JHN 4:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 4:16"/>A Yeshu gubhaalugulile, “Nnjende nkaasheme ambujebhenu, nng'ishe nabho apano.”<verse eid="JHN 4:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 4:17"/>Bhakongwe bhala gubhajangwile, “Nangali ambujebhangu.” A Yeshu gubhaalugulile, “Ntashiye ukoto, kuti mwangali ambujebhenu. <verse eid="JHN 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 4:18"/>Pabha mwalombilwe paano na bhunkutama nabho nnainobho nngabha ambuje bhenu bha alali. Penepo guntashiyega ga kweli.”<verse eid="JHN 4:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 4:19"/>Bhakongwe bhala gubhaabhalanjile, “Mmakulungwa, nne pungubhona kuti mmwe ankulondola bha a Nnungu. <verse eid="JHN 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 4:20"/>Bhanangulungwa bhetu bha Shishamaliya pubhaajujilangaga a Nnungu pa ashi shitumbishi, ikabheje Mmayaudi mmwe nkutinji ku Yelushalemu kula nikutupinjikwa kujujila Nnungu.”<verse eid="JHN 4:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 4:21"/>A Yeshu gubhaalugulile, “awile, nngulupalile nne, mobha ganakwiya nkaajuganga Atati pa shene shitumbishi, wala ku Yelushalemu kula. <verse eid="JHN 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 4:22"/>Mmanganyanji Bhashamaliya nkakwaammanyanga bhunkwaajuganga, ikabheje Tubhayaudi uwe twaamanyi bhutukwaajuga, pabha ntapulo gwa a Nnungu shuguishe kupitila ku Bhayaudi. <verse eid="JHN 4:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 4:23"/>Ikabheje malanga shigaishe, numbe gaishe, gatenda bhakwaatindibhalilanga bha kweli, shibhaatindibhalilanje Atati kwa mashili gaka Mbumu na kwa kweli. Pabha Atati bhanakwaapinganga bhandunji bhaajuganga shana nneyo. <verse eid="JHN 4:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 4:24"/>A Nnungu ni Mbumu, na bhandu bhakwajuganga bhenebho, bhanapinjikwanga bhaajuganje kwa komboywa naka Mbumu na kweli.”<verse eid="JHN 4:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 4:25"/>Bhakongwe bhala gubhaalugulile, “Nimumanyi kuti bhanakwiya bhaagwilwe na a Nnungu bhaashemwa a Kilishitu Bhaatapula. Bhenebho bhaikaga, shibhatubhalanjile indu yowe.”<verse eid="JHN 4:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 4:26"/>A Yeshu gubhaabhalanjile, “Nne ngukunguluka na mmwe ni bhayene.”<verse eid="JHN 4:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 4:27"/>Penepo bhaajiganywa bhabho gubhabhujilengenenje, gubhakanganigwenje ga kwaakongana a Yeshu bhalikunguluka na bhakongwe. Ikabheje jwakwa abhabhushiye, “Nkupinga nndi?” Eu, “Kwa nndi nnakunguluka na bhakongwe?”<verse eid="JHN 4:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 4:28"/>Bhene bhakongwebho gubhaleshile lulo lwabho popo gubhapite kunjini nikwabhalanjilanga bhandunji, <verse eid="JHN 4:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 4:29"/>“Twendangane nkaalolanje bhandu bhamalanjile indu yangu yowe indendile! Bhuli, nngatendeka bhenebho kubha a Kilishitu Bhaagombola?” <verse eid="JHN 4:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 4:30"/>Bhai bhandunji kukopoka kunjini kula gubhaajendelenje a Yeshu.<verse eid="JHN 4:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 4:31"/>Gene malanga pego bhaajiganywa bhabho gubhaashondelesheyenje a Yeshu bhalinkutinji, “Shonde Mmaajiganya, nnye shalya.”<verse eid="JHN 4:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 4:32"/>Ikabheje a Yeshu gubhaalugulilenje, “Nne ngwete shalya shinkakushimanyanga.”<verse eid="JHN 4:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 4:33"/>Bhaajiganywa bhabho gubhabhuyenenje, “Apali mundu abhapele shalya?”<verse eid="JHN 4:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 4:34"/>A Yeshu gubhaalugulilenje, “Shalya shangu ni kutenda ibhapinga bhandumile bhala na maliya liengo lyabho. <verse eid="JHN 4:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 4:35"/>Mmanganyanji nkabheleketanga kuti, ‘Jiigele miei nsheshepe, gaishe mobha ga neng'ena?’ Ikabheje nne nguti, nnolanje bhandunjibha, ni malinga yalya mmigunda, iishile pa una. <verse eid="JHN 4:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 4:36"/>Nkuuna analipwa, na analopolela mauno pamo nkupinga gabhe na gumi gwa pitipiti, nkupinga nkupanda na nkuuna bhowe bhainonyelanje. <verse eid="JHN 4:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 4:37"/>Kwa nneyo ashi shibheleketo sha kuti, ‘Jumo anapanda na juna anauna.’ Ni sha kweli. <verse eid="JHN 4:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 4:38"/>Nne njikunntumanga nkaunanje mauno gunkanakamulilanga liengo lya lima, bhakamwilenje liengo likulungwa bhananji, ikabheje inkwiipatanga mmanganyanji, ni kwa ligongo lya liengo lyabhonji.”<verse eid="JHN 4:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 4:39"/>Bhashamalia bhabhagwinji bha shene shilambo shila gubhaakulupalilenje a Yeshu kwa ligongo lya malobhe gubhabhelekete bhakongwe bhala kuti, “Bhashinugulila indu yowe indendile.” <verse eid="JHN 4:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 4:40"/>Bhashamalia gubhaajendelenje a Yeshu nikwashondelesheya bhatame nabhonji, gubhatemi kweneko mobha gabhili.<verse eid="JHN 4:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 4:41"/>Bhandu bhabhagwinji kaje gubhaakulupalilenje a Yeshu kwa ligongo lya malobhe gabho. <verse eid="JHN 4:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 4:42"/>Gubhaalugulilenje bhakongwe bhala, “Nnaino uwe tunakulupalila nngabha kwa ligongo lya malobhe genupe, ikabheje tupilikene twaashayene na tumumanyi kuti bhenebha bhapinga tapula shilambolyo.”<verse eid="JHN 4:42"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mwana jwa Bhakulungwa bha Manjola Analamywa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 4:43"/>Gakapiteje mobha gabhili a Yeshu gubhajabhwile kweneko, gubhapite ku Galilaya. <verse eid="JHN 4:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 4:44"/>Pabha bhayene bhalugwile gwangali nng'iyo kuti, “Nkulondola jwa a Nnungu akaishimika pa shilambo shakwe.” <verse eid="JHN 4:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 4:45"/>Bhai bhakaisheje ku Galilaya, Bhagalilaya bhabhagwinji gubhaaposhelenje. Pabha pubhapitengenenje ku Yelushalemu kushikukuu sha Pashaka, kweneko bhagabhweninji gowe gubhatendile a Yeshu.<verse eid="JHN 4:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 4:46"/>A Yeshu gubhaishe kabhili kushilambo sha ku Kana kunkowa gwa ku Galilaya, kubhatendile mashi kubha divai. Ku Kapalanaumu bhashinkupagwa bhakulungwa bhamo bha manjola bhakwete mwana nwele ku Kapelenaumu. <verse eid="JHN 4:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 4:47"/>Bhai, bhakulungwa bha manjola bhala bhakapilikaneje a Yeshu bhashiika ku Galilaya kukoposhela ku Yudea, gubhaajendele nikwaajuga bhajende ku Kapalanaumu bhakannamye mwana gwabho aliji nnwele jwa nnumbangu. <verse eid="JHN 4:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 4:48"/>A Yeshu gubhaalugulile, “Nkaibhonanje ilangulo na ilapo nkakulupalilanga!”<verse eid="JHN 4:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 4:49"/>Bhakulungwa bha manjola bhala a gubhaalugulile a Yeshu, “Mmakulungwa, shonde twende mwanangu akanabhewa.”<verse eid="JHN 4:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 4:50"/>A Yeshu gubhaalugulile, “Njende, mwana gwenu alamile.” Bhandu bhala gubhakulupalile malobhe ga a Yeshu, gubhajabhwile. <verse eid="JHN 4:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 4:51"/>Bhali mumpanda gwa kwenda kungwabho, gubhaimikene na bhatumishi bhabho, gubhaalugulilenje, “Mmakulungwa, mwanagwenu alamile”.<verse eid="JHN 4:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 4:52"/>Na bhalabho gubhabhushiyenje, “Malanga gani mwana palamile” Gubhaalugulilenje, “Liyo shaa shaba ja mui, shilwele pushinneshile.” <verse eid="JHN 4:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 4:53"/>Ainamundu bhala gubhakumbushile kuti pugaliji malanga gogo pego pubhalugulilwe na a Yeshu kuti, “Mwana gwenu alamile.” Penepo bhenebho na ashaalongo ajabho bhowe gubhaakulupalilenje.<verse eid="JHN 4:53"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 4:54"/>Sheneshi pushaliji shilangulo sha bhili shibhatendile a Yeshu bhalibhuja ku Yudea kwenda ku Galilaya.<verse eid="JHN 4:54"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JHN 5"/>
  <para style="s">A Yeshu Bhanakunnamya Mundu jwa Poloka pa Litanda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 5:1"/>Gakapiteje genego shashinkupagwa shikukuu sha Bhayaudi, na bhalabho a Yeshu gubhapite ku Yelushalemu. <verse eid="JHN 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 5:2"/>Kwene ku Yelushalemu, tome na nnango gushemwa, Nnango gwa Ngondolo, lyashinkupagwa litanda lya mashi liishemwa Bhetishata kwa Shiebhulania, na lyashinkukola mmbuto nng'ano. <verse eid="JHN 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 5:3"/>Nnyenje mmatimbwimo bhashinkupagwanga bhalwelenji bhabhagwinji bhatemingenenje, ashinangalole na ashinangwabha na bhapolokanga ibhalo, bhalinginji nkulindilila mashi gakologanywe. <verse eid="JHN 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 5:4"/>Pabha malaika jwa kunnungu atendaga tuluka nitimbulikanya mashi. Nnwele jojowe shalongolele tumbushila mmashi mula, shalame shilwele shoshowe shakwete. <verse eid="JHN 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 5:5"/>Bhai, penepo ashinkupagwa nnwele jumo alwalile yaka makumi gatatu na yaka nane. <verse eid="JHN 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 5:6"/>Numbe a Yeshu bhakammoneje jwenejo ali agonile penepo, gubhang'amwile kuti jwenejo patemi penepo mobha gamagwinji, gubhammushiye, “Bhuli ulipinga kulama?”<verse eid="JHN 5:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 5:7"/>Na jwalakwe gwajangwile, “Mmakulungwa, nne nangali mundu jwandumbushiya mmashimu pugatimbulikanywa. Kila pungulinga tumbushila, mundu juna anakoposhela nimbitila.” <verse eid="JHN 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 5:8"/>A Yeshu gubhammalanjile, “Jinuka utole likai lyako ujende.” <verse eid="JHN 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 5:9"/>Shangupe mundu jula gwalamile, gwatolile likai lyakwe, gwajabhwile. Lyeneli pulyatendeshe Lyubha lya Pumulila. <verse eid="JHN 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 5:10"/>Kwa nneyo Bhayaudi bhananji gubhannugulilenje mundu alamiywe jula, “Lelo Lyubha lya Pumulila, ikaapinjikwa kujigala likai.”<verse eid="JHN 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 5:11"/>Ikabheje jwenejo gwabhabhalanjilenje, “Bhene bhandu bhanamiyebho nibhanugulile, ‘Jigala likai lyako, ujende.’ ”<verse eid="JHN 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 5:12"/>Bhalabhonji gubhaammushiyenje, “Jwene mundu akulugulile, ‘Jigala likai lyako, ujendejo,’ gani?”<verse eid="JHN 5:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 5:13"/>Ikabheje jwenejo jwangammanya annamiye, pabha a Yeshu bhajabhwile penepo, numbe pashinkugumbala lugwinjili lwa bhandu.<verse eid="JHN 5:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 5:14"/>Bhai kungai a Yeshu gubhaimene naka mundu jubhannamiye jula ku Likanisha, gubhannugulile, “Nnaino ulamile, unatende yambi kabhili, linakuukoposhela lya punda jogoya.”<verse eid="JHN 5:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 5:15"/>Bhene bhandubho gubhapite gubhaalugulilenje bhakulungwa bha Bhayaudi kuti, bhanamiye bhala a Yeshu.<verse eid="JHN 5:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 5:16"/>Pabha a Yeshu bhashinkutenda genego Lyubha lya Pumulila, Bhayaudi gubhatandwibhenje kwaashima. <verse eid="JHN 5:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 5:17"/>Bhai a Yeshu gubhaalugulilenje, “Atati bhanakamula maengo mobha gowe, nkali nne ngunakamula maengo nneyo peyo.”<verse eid="JHN 5:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 5:18"/>Kwa gene malobhego, bhakulungwanji bha Bhayaudi gubhapundilenje kuloleya shanabhuli shibhaabhulaganje a Yeshu, nngabha ga nngakunda shalia ja Lyubha lya Pumulilape, ikabhe ga bheleketa kuti a Nnungu Ainabhabho, kwa nneyo bhanakwiilinganya na a Nnungu.<verse eid="JHN 5:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mashili gaka Mwana jwa a Nnungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 5:19"/>A Yeshu gubhaalugulilenje, “Kweli kweli ngunakunnugulilanga, Nne namwana gwabho ngakombola tenda shindu sha jikape, ngunatenda shingushibhona Atati bhalitenda. Pabha shibhaatenda Atati, Nne shindende shosho pesho <verse eid="JHN 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 5:20"/>Pabha Atati bhanakumpinga mwana gwabho na bhanakunnanguya kila shindu shibhatenda bhayene na kabhili shibhannanguye indu yaikulungwa kupunda yenei na mmanganya shinkanganigwanje. <verse eid="JHN 5:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 5:21"/>Malinga Atati shibhakwayuyanga bhawilenje nikwapanganga gumi, nneyo peyo na Nne Mwana gwabho ngunakwapanganga gumi bhungupinga kwaapanganga. <verse eid="JHN 5:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 5:22"/>Atati bhakakunng'ukumula mundu jojowe, liengo lyowe lya ukumula bhambele Nne namwanagwabho, <verse eid="JHN 5:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 5:23"/>nkupinga bhandu bhowe bhang'isimiyanje malinga shibhakwaisimiyanga Atati. Bhakang'ishimyanga Nne bhakakwaishimiyanga Atati bhandumile.<verse eid="JHN 5:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 5:24"/>“Kweli ngunakummalanjilanga, apilikana lilobhe lyangu na kwakulupalila bhandumile bhala, akwete gumi gwa pitipiti. Ngu akaukumulwa, ikabhe atapwilwe kushiwo na apegwilwe gumi. <verse eid="JHN 5:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 5:25"/>Kweli ngunakunnugulilanga, mobha ganakwiya, numbe gaishe, bhawilenje shibhapilikananje lilobhe lyangu, na shibhapilikananjebho, shibhalamanje. <verse eid="JHN 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 5:26"/>Malinga Atati shibhali shiumilo sha gumi, nneyo peyo bhandendile nne Namwana gwabho kubha shiumilo sha gumi. <verse eid="JHN 5:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 5:27"/>Kabhili bhashimba mashili ga ukumula pabha nne Mwana juka Mundu. <verse eid="JHN 5:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 5:28"/>Nnakanganigwanje kwa lyeneli, pabha mobha ganakwiya bhowe bhalinginji mmakabhuli shibhapilikananje lilobhe lyangu. <verse eid="JHN 5:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 5:29"/>Na bhalabhonji shibhayukanje, bhatendilenje ya uguja shibhayukanje na lama na bhatendilenje yangali ya mmbone shibhayukanje na ukumulwa.”<verse eid="JHN 5:29"/></para>
  <para style="s">Bhaakong'ondela bha a Yeshu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 5:30"/>“Nne ngaatenda shindu kwa mashili gangu namwene. Nne ngunaukumula malinga shingupilikana kopoka kwa Atati, nne ukumu jangu ja aki. Nne ngaapinga tenda shingupinga namwene, ikabhe shibhaapinga bhandumile bhala.<verse eid="JHN 5:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 5:31"/>“Niikong'ondelaga namwene, ukong'ondelogo jwakwa shakunde kuti gwa kweli. <verse eid="JHN 5:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 5:32"/>Ikabheje bhapalinji bhananji bhaakong'ondelanga gangu nne, munkumbi gwabhonjimo bhapali a Yowana. Na nne nimumanyi kuti yowe ibhakong'ondele gangu nne, ni ya kweli. <verse eid="JHN 5:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 5:33"/>Mmanganyanji nshikwaatumanga bhantenga kwa a Yowana, na bhalabho gubhakong'ondele ga kweli. <verse eid="JHN 5:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 5:34"/>Nne ngalolela kukong'ondelwa na bhandunji, ikabheje ngunabheleketa genega nkupinga ntapulwanje. <verse eid="JHN 5:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 5:35"/>A Yowana pubhaliji malinga shenje shikolela nilangaya, na mmanganya mwainonyelenje shilangayasho kwa mobha gashoko.”<verse eid="JHN 5:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 5:36"/>“Ikabheje nne ngwete ukong'ondelo gwangu namwene numbe gwankulungwa kupunda gwa a Yowana. Pabha maengo gungutenda, ni gubhambele Atati nigatende. Numbe genego ganangong'ondela kuti njitumwa na Atati. <verse eid="JHN 5:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 5:37"/>Nabhalabho Atati bhandumile bhanangong'ondela. Mmanganya nkanabhe pilikananga lilobhe lyabho, wala kwaabhona kumeyo, <verse eid="JHN 5:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 5:38"/>na ntenga gwabho gukatama mmitima jenunji, pabha mwangankulupalilanga jubhantumile jula. <verse eid="JHN 5:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 5:39"/>Mmanganya nnaatonelanga Majandiko ga Ukonjelo nniganishiyanga kuti mwenemo, shimpatanje gumi gwa pitipiti, mbena Majandiko gogo ganangong'ondela nne! <verse eid="JHN 5:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 5:40"/>Nkali nneyo, mmanganya nkapinganga kunyiila nne nkupinga mpatanje gumi.<verse eid="JHN 5:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 5:41"/>“Nne ngaloleya kuiniywa na bhandunji. <verse eid="JHN 5:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 5:42"/>Ikabheje nimumanyi kuti mmanganyanji, kwaapinga a Nnungu kwakwa mmitima jenunji. <verse eid="JHN 5:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 5:43"/>Nne pung'ishe kwa mashili ga Atati, ikabheje nkamboshelanga. Ikabhe mundu juna aikaga kwa mashili gakwe nyene, shimumposhelanje. <verse eid="JHN 5:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 5:44"/>Mmanganyanji nnapinganga kulumbililwa na bhandu ajenunji, na nkaapinganga kulumbililwa na Bhenebho bhali jikape a Nnungu, igala shinkulupalilanje bhuli? <verse eid="JHN 5:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 5:45"/>Nnaganishiyanje kuti nne shininnugulanje kwa Atati. A Musha bhunkwaakulupalilangabho shibhannugulanje. <verse eid="JHN 5:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 5:46"/>Monaga kweli mwaakulupalilenje a Musha, nkangulupalilenje na nne. Pabha a Musha bhashinkujandika gangu nne. <verse eid="JHN 5:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 5:47"/>Ikabheje nkakulupalilanje gubhajandishe gala, shinkulupalilanje bhuli, malobhe gungubheleketa nne?”<verse eid="JHN 5:47"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JHN 6"/>
  <para style="s">A Yeshu Bhanakwaapanganga Shalya Bhandu Elupu Nng'ano</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Matei 14:13-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Maliko 6:30-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Luka 9:10-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 6:1"/>Gakapiteje genego, a Yeshu gubhajombweshe litanda lya Galilaya eu guna lishemwa litanda lya Tibheliya. <verse eid="JHN 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 6:2"/>Lugwinjili lwa bhandu gulwaakagwile, pabha bhashikwiibhonanga ilangulo ibhatendaga ya kwaalamyanga bhalwelenji. <verse eid="JHN 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 6:3"/>A Yeshu gubhakwelile pa shitumbi, gubhatemi na bhaajiganywa bhabho. <verse eid="JHN 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 6:4"/>Na shikukuu sha Bhayaudi shishemwa Pashaka shashinkubhandishila. <verse eid="JHN 6:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 6:5"/>Bhai, a Yeshu bhakaloleje nikulubhona lugwinjili lwa bhandu lulikwajiila, gubhaalugulile a Pilipi, “Tukaume kwei mikate bhandunjibha bhalyanganje?” <verse eid="JHN 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 6:6"/>Bhashinkubheleketa genego nkwaalinga a Pilipi, pabha bhayene bhashimanyi shishibhatende.<verse eid="JHN 6:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 6:7"/>A Pilipi gubhaajangwile, “Nkali mikate ja mmbiya yaigwinji, nngajenela kwa bhandunjibha nkali kila mundu apate shipande shishokope!”<verse eid="JHN 6:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 6:8"/>Jumo munkumbi gwa bhaajiganywa bhabho ashemwaga a Ndeleya, mpwabho a Shimoni guna pubhashemwaga a Petili, akwaalugulilaga, <verse eid="JHN 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 6:9"/>“Apano apali mwana jumo akwete mikate nng'ano ja mbungalai na yamaki ibhili, ikabheje yenei shiipwae nndi na lugwinjili lwa bhandunjilu?”<verse eid="JHN 6:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 6:10"/>A Yeshu gubhashite, “Mwaatendanje bhandunji bhatamangane pai.” Pashinkupagwa manyai gamagwinji penepo. Bhai, bhandu gubhatemingenenje. Bhanabhalume jika pubhalinginji elupu nng'ano. <verse eid="JHN 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 6:11"/>A Yeshu gubhatolile mikate jila, gubhatendile eja kwa a Nnungu, gujigebhenywe ku bhandunji bhatemingenenje bhala, nneyo peyo gubhatendile kwa yamaki ila, kila mundu gwapatile mwapinjile. <verse eid="JHN 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 6:12"/>Bhandu bhakajukutanjeje, a Yeshu gubhaalugulilenje bhaajiganywa bhabho, “Nkundikanyanje makombo galepeshe gala ganaobhe.” <verse eid="JHN 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 6:13"/>Bhai, gubhakundikenyenje ipande ya mikate ibhalepelenje bhandu bhalyangangaga bhala, gubhagumbeyenje ikapu likumi limo na ibhili.<verse eid="JHN 6:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 6:14"/>Bhandu bhakashibhonanjeje shene shilangulo shibhatendile a Yeshu, gubhashitenje, “Kweli bhenebha ankulondola bha a Nnungu bhakwiya kushilambolyo.” <verse eid="JHN 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 6:15"/>A Yeshu gubhamumanyi kuti bhandunji bhanapinganga kwaakamula nkupinga bhaatendanje a mpalume bhabhonji, gubhajabhwile kabhili, gubhapite jikape kushitumbi.<verse eid="JHN 6:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">A Yeshu Bhanaowa Pantundu Mashi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:22-33">Matei 14:22-33</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:45-52">Maliko 6:45-52</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 6:16"/>Likaisheje ligulo bhaajiganywa bhabho gubhaelelenje mpaka kulitanda, <verse eid="JHN 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 6:17"/>gubhakwelilenje mmashua, nigubhatandubhenje kujomboka kwenda ku Kapalanaumu. Gene malangago kuli lubhindu, na a Yeshu bhaliji bhakanabhe ika kulitanda. <verse eid="JHN 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 6:18"/>Kwa ligongo lya mbungo japugaga, mabhimbili gugatandwibhe nnitanda. <verse eid="JHN 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 6:19"/>Bhaajiganywa bhala bhali bhapitengenenje kwaataliya mbuti maili gatatu eu nsheshe, gubhaabhweninji a Yeshu bhali bhabhandishile mashua bhaliowa pantundu mashi, gubhajogwepenje kwa kaje. <verse eid="JHN 6:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 6:20"/>A Yeshu gubhaalugulilenje, “Nnajogopanje, ni nne!” <verse eid="JHN 6:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 6:21"/>Bhai gubhakundilenje kwaajigala mmashua mula, kashokope gubhaikengenenje kung'ambu kubhajendanganaga kula.<verse eid="JHN 6:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Bhandunji Bhanakwaaloleyanga a Yeshu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 6:22"/>Pa lyamba lyakwe lugwinjili lwa bhandu bhalepekenje kung'ambo jina ja litanda, gubhang'amwilenje kuti gupali ntumbwi gumope pepala na a Yeshu bhangajinjila muntumbwi pamo na bhaajiganywa bhabho, ikabhe bhaajiganywa bhala pubhapitengenenje jikape. <verse eid="JHN 6:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 6:23"/>Mitumbwi jina gujiishe kukopoka ku Tibheliya kubhalilenje bhandu mikate jila, a Yeshu bhakatendeje eja kwa Bhakuungwa a Nnungu. <verse eid="JHN 6:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 6:24"/>Bhai, bhandunji bhala bhakang'amulanjeje kuti a Yeshu na bhaajiganywa bhabho bhakwapinji pepala, gubhakwelilenje muntumbwi gubhapitengenenje ku Kapalanaumu kukwaaloleya.<verse eid="JHN 6:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">A Yeshu Shalya sha Gumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 6:25"/>Bhandunji bhala bhakaaimananjeje a Yeshu kung'ambo jabhili ja litanda gubhaabhushiyenje, “Mmaajiganya, nng'ishe shakani kwekuno?”<verse eid="JHN 6:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 6:26"/>A Yeshu gubhaajangwilenje, “Kweli ngunakummalanjilanga, nnanoleyanga nngabha kwa ligongo lya kugamanya malombolelo ga ilangulo, ikabhe pabha mwashinkulyanganga mikate nijukuta. <verse eid="JHN 6:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 6:27"/>Nnaabhushilanje shalya shiangabhanika, nng'abhushilanje shalya shikaangabhanika shilonjeya nipeleshela gumi gwa pitipiti. Nne Mwana juka Mundu jubhankong'ondele Atati, shampanganje shene shalyasho.”<verse eid="JHN 6:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 6:28"/>Bhalabhonji gubhaabhushiyenje, “Tutende bhuli nkupinga tukombole kutenda maengo ga a Nnungu?”<verse eid="JHN 6:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 6:29"/>A Yeshu gubhaajangwilenje, “Liengo libhaapinga a Nnungu ntendanje ni kuti, munkulupalilanje jubhantumile jula.”<verse eid="JHN 6:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 6:30"/>Penepo gubhabhaalanjilenje, “Shintende shilangulo shashi tushibhone nkupinga tunkulupalile? Shintende shindu shashi? <verse eid="JHN 6:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 6:31"/>Bhanangulungwa bhetu bhalilenje mana nng'anga mula, malinga shigaalugula Majandiko ga Ukonjelo, ‘Bhashinkwaaliyanga shalya sha kopoka kunnungu.’ ”<verse eid="JHN 6:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 6:32"/>A Yeshu gubhaalugulilenje, “Kweli ngunakunnugulilanga, a Musha bhangampanganga shalya kopoka kunnungu, ikabheje Atati nibhakumpanganga shalya sha kweli kopoka kunnungu. <verse eid="JHN 6:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 6:33"/>Pabha shalya sha a Nnungu ni jwene atuluka kopoka kwa a Nnungu nikwapanganga gumi bhandu pashilambolyo.”<verse eid="JHN 6:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 6:34"/>Bhai, gubhaalugulilenje, “Mmakulungwa, ntupe uwe shene shalyasho mobha gowe.”<verse eid="JHN 6:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 6:35"/>A Yeshu gubhaalugulilenje, “Nne ni shalya shipeleshela gumi. Anyiila nne wala akakola shibhanga, na angulupalila nne, wala akakola njota. <verse eid="JHN 6:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 6:36"/>Ikabheje malinga shinammalanjilenje kuti mmweninjii ikabhe mwangangulupalilanga. <verse eid="JHN 6:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 6:37"/>Bhowe bhungupegwa na Atati shibhang'ishilanje, jojowe shanyiile nne, wala ngamminjila palanga. <verse eid="JHN 6:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 6:38"/>Pabha njituluka kopoka kunnungu, nngabha kuutenda ingupinga nne, ikabhe kuutenda ibhapinga bhandumile bhala. <verse eid="JHN 6:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 6:39"/>Na bhandumile bhala shibhapinga ni kuti, ngunanng'obhiye nkali jumo jwabhonji bhubhambele bhala, ikabhe naayuyanje bhowe lyubha lya mpelo. <verse eid="JHN 6:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 6:40"/>Pabha shibhapinga Atati ni kuti, mundu jojowe akunnola Mwana nikunkulupalila, akole gumi gwa pitipiti, numbe nne shininnyuye lyubha lya mpelo.”<verse eid="JHN 6:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 6:41"/>Bhai, Bhayaudi gubhatandwibhenje kwainginishila, pabha bhashinkubheleketa kuti, “Nne shalya shitulwishe kopoka kunnungu.” <verse eid="JHN 6:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 6:42"/>Gubhashitenje, “Bhuli, aju nngabha Yeshu mwana gwabho a Yoshepu? Twaamanyi ainagwe na akwabhe! Bhai abheleketa bhuli kuti ashituluka kopoka kunnungu?”<verse eid="JHN 6:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 6:43"/>A Yeshu gubhaalugulilenje, “Nnekanje kutaukangana mwaashayenenji. <verse eid="JHN 6:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 6:44"/>Jwakwa mundu shang'ishile nne, akashemwe na Atati bhandumile, nne shininyuye jwene mundujo lyubha lya mpelo. <verse eid="JHN 6:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 6:45"/>Ashinkulondola bha a Nnungu bhajandikenje Mmajandiko ga Ukonjelo kuti, ‘Bhandu bhowe shibhajiganywanje na a Nnungu.’ Mundu jojowe akwaapilikana Atati nikwiijiganya ga bhenebho, ananyiila nne. <verse eid="JHN 6:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 6:46"/>Penepo nngabha kuti apali mundu abhabhweni Atati, ikabhe jwene akoposhele kwa a Nnungu, jwenejo ni abhabhweni Atati. <verse eid="JHN 6:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 6:47"/>Kweli, ngunakunnugulilanga, akulupalila anapata gumi gwa pitipiti. <verse eid="JHN 6:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 6:48"/>Nne ni shalya shipeleshela gumi. <verse eid="JHN 6:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 6:49"/>Bhanangulungwa bhenunji bhalilenje mana nng'anga, ikabheje bhawilenje. <verse eid="JHN 6:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 6:50"/>Ikabheje sheshino ni shalya shituluka kopoka kunnungu, nkupinga jojowe shaalye anawe.”<verse eid="JHN 6:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 6:51"/>“Nne ni shalya sha gumi shitulwishe kopoka kunnungu. Mundu jojowe alyaga shene shalyashi shalame pitipiti. Na shalya shishinimpanganje ni shiilu shangu shingushishoya ligongo lya gumi gwa bhandu pashilambolyo.”<verse eid="JHN 6:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 6:52"/>Penepo Bhayaudi gubhatandwibhenje kupwatanga ashaayenenji bhalinkutinji, “Bhaakombola bhuli bhenebha kutupa shiilu shabho tulye?”<verse eid="JHN 6:52"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 6:53"/>A Yeshu gubhaalugulilenje, “Kweli ngunakummalanjilanga, nkalyanganje shiilu shangu nne Mwana juka Mundu, na papila minyai jangu, nkakolanga gumi nkati jenunji. <verse eid="JHN 6:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 6:54"/>Alya shiilu shangu na papila minyai jangu, akwete gumi gwa pitipiti, na nne shininnyuye lyubha lya mpelo. <verse eid="JHN 6:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 6:55"/>Pabha shiilu shangu ni shalya sha kweli, na minyai jangu, ni sha papila sha kweli. <verse eid="JHN 6:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 6:56"/>Alya shiilu shangu na papila minyai jangu, analundana na nne, numbe nne ngunalundana naka jwenejo. <verse eid="JHN 6:56"/><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 6:57"/>Atati bhakwete gumi bhashinkunduma, numbe nne ngunalama kwa ligongo lyabho, nneyo peyo apingalya shiilu shangu, shalame kwa ligongo lyangu. <verse eid="JHN 6:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 6:58"/>Bhai, ashino ni shalya shitulwishe kopoka kunnungu, nngabha malinga mana jibhalilenje bhanangulungwa bhenunji nng'anga, ikabheje nkali nneyo bhawilenje. Ikabhe shaalye shene shalya shino, shakole gumi gwa pitipiti.”<verse eid="JHN 6:58"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 6:59"/>A Yeshu pubhabhelekete genego bhalijiganya nshinagogi, ku Kapalanaumu.<verse eid="JHN 6:59"/></para>
  <para style="s">Bhaajiganywa Bhabhagwinji Bhanakwaalekanga a Yeshu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="JHN 6:60"/>Bhai, bhabhagwinji bha bhaajiganywa bhabho bhakapilikananjeje genego gubhashitenje, “Aga malobhe ga ukomu, gani shakombole kugapilikanishiya?” <verse eid="JHN 6:60"/><verse number="61" style="v" sid="JHN 6:61"/>A Yeshu gubhamumanyi gwangali kubhalanjilwa naka mundu kuti bhaajiganywa bhabho bhanainginikanga ligongo lya gene malobhego, gubhaabhushiyenje, “Bhuli lyeneli linakumpanganga lipamba? <verse eid="JHN 6:61"/><verse number="62" style="v" sid="JHN 6:62"/>Bhai shiibhe bhuli, pushimummonanje Mwana juka Mundu aliikwela kubhuja kwakoposhele? <verse eid="JHN 6:62"/><verse number="63" style="v" sid="JHN 6:63"/>Mbumu jwa a Nnungu ni apeleshela gumi, shiilu jikape nngakombola shindu. Malobhe gunimmalanjilenje ni Mbumu na gumi. <verse eid="JHN 6:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="JHN 6:64"/>Nkali nneyo, bhapalinji bhananji bhakaakulupalilanga.” A Yeshu bhashinkubheleketa nneyo pabha bhamumanyi kuumila bhukala ashigani bhakaakulupalilanga na jwene apinga kwaatendebhuka. <verse eid="JHN 6:64"/><verse number="65" style="v" sid="JHN 6:65"/>Kungai gubhashite, “Kwa lyene ligongoli, nammalanjilenje kuti, jwakwapi akombola kung'ishila akajaliwe na Atati.”<verse eid="JHN 6:65"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="JHN 6:66"/>Ligongo lya genego, bhaakulupalila bhabho bhabhagwinji gubhaaleshilenje, ninngaakagulanga kabhili. <verse eid="JHN 6:66"/><verse number="67" style="v" sid="JHN 6:67"/>Bhai, a Yeshu gubhaabhushiyenje likumi limo na bhabhili bhala, “Bhuli, na mmanganyanji nkupinga jabhulangana?” <verse eid="JHN 6:67"/><verse number="68" style="v" sid="JHN 6:68"/>A Shimoni Petili gubhaajangwile, “Mmakulungwa, tujende kukeni? Mmwe ni nkwete malobhe ga gumi gwa pitipiti. <verse eid="JHN 6:68"/><verse number="69" style="v" sid="JHN 6:69"/>Uwe tukulupalile na tumumanyi kuti mmwe ni Mundu jwa ukonjelo jwa a Nnungu.”<verse eid="JHN 6:69"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="JHN 6:70"/>A Yeshu gubhaalugulilenje, “Bhuli, nanganng'agulanga mmanganya likumi limo na bhabhili? Nkali nneyo, jumo munkumbi gwenunji ni Lishetani!” <verse eid="JHN 6:70"/><verse number="71" style="v" sid="JHN 6:71"/>A Yeshu bhashinkubheleketa genego kwa ligongo lya a Yuda, bhana bhabho a Shimoni Ishikaliote, pabha bhenebho bhapinga kwaatendebhuka, nkali na bhalabho bhaliji munkumbi gwa likumi limo na bhabhili bhala.<verse eid="JHN 6:71"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JHN 7"/>
  <para style="s">A Yeshu na Ashaapwabho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 7:1"/>Gakapiteje genego, a Yeshu bhatendaga owa mmbali ya ku Galilaya. Bhangapinga kuowela nkowa gwa ku Yudea kwa ligongo lya ashikalongolele bha Bhayaudi bhapingangaga kwaabhulaganga. <verse eid="JHN 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 7:2"/>Shikukuu sha Bhayaudi, shishemwa shikukuu sha ibhanda shishinkubhandishila. <verse eid="JHN 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 7:3"/>Bhai ashaapwabho gubhaalugulilenje, “Nnjabhule apano nnjende ku Yudea bhaajiganywa bhenu bhagabhonanje maengo gunkutenda. <verse eid="JHN 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 7:4"/>Mundu apinga manyika na bhandunji, akaatenda indu kwa nng'iyo. Ibhaga nkutenda genega, bhai, mwiilanguye ku shilambolyo.” <verse eid="JHN 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 7:5"/>Nkali ashaapwabho bhangaakulupalilanga.<verse eid="JHN 7:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 7:6"/>Bhai, a Yeshu gubhaalugulilenje, “Malanga gangu gapwaa gakanabhe ika. Ikabheje kwenu mmanganya malanga gowe ganakumpwaanga. <verse eid="JHN 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 7:7"/>Bhandunji pa shilambolyo bhakakunshimanga mmanganya, ikabheje bhanashimwanga na nne pabha ngunakong'ondela kuti itendi yabhonji yangali ya mmbone. <verse eid="JHN 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 7:8"/>Mmanganya nnjendangananje kushikukuuko. Nne ngajenda, pabha malanga gangu gapwaa gakanabheika.” <verse eid="JHN 7:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 7:9"/>Bhakabheleketeje genego gubhaigele ku Galilaya.<verse eid="JHN 7:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">A Yeshu Kushikukuu sha Ibhanda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 7:10"/>Ashaapwabho bhakajendanganaje kushikukuu, nabhalabho a Yeshu gubhapite, ikabheje bhangajenda kwa bhonekana kulugwinjili ikabhe kwa nng'iyo. <verse eid="JHN 7:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 7:11"/>Ashikalongolele bha Bhayaudi bhatendaga kwaaloleyanga kushikukuuko, gubhashitenje, “Kubhali kwei?”<verse eid="JHN 7:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 7:12"/>Gashinkupagwa manong'ono gamagwinji nnugwinjili lwa bhandu ga bhenebho. Bhananji gubhashitenje, “Pubhalipa bhanguja.” Bhananji gubhashitenje, “Nng'oo! Bhanapuganya bhandu.” <verse eid="JHN 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 7:13"/>Nkali nneyo, jwakwa mundu alinjile kubheleketa ngani jabho palugwinjili nkwaajogopanga ashikalongolele bha Bhayaudi.<verse eid="JHN 7:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 7:14"/>Ikaishileje pakati shikukuu, a Yeshu nabhalabho gubhapite ku likanisha gubhatandwibhe kujiganya. <verse eid="JHN 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 7:15"/>Bhai, Bhayaudi gubhakanganigwenje nibheleketa, “Abha bhandubha bhapatile bhuli alu lundalu nabhalabho bhangashoma shule?”<verse eid="JHN 7:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 7:16"/>Bhai a Yeshu gubhaajangwilenje, “Majiganyo gungujiganya nngabha gangu, ikabhe gabho bhandumile bhala. <verse eid="JHN 7:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 7:17"/>Mundu apinga kutenda gubhapinga a Nnungu, shamumanye monaga majiganyo gangu gano gakopoka kwa a Nnungu, eu ngunakwiibheleketela namwenepe. <verse eid="JHN 7:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 7:18"/>Jwene akwiibheleketela nnyene, analoleya ukonjelo gwakwe nnyene, ikabheje aloleya ukonjelo gwabho bhantumile bhala, jwenejo jwa kulupalilwa na muntima gwakwe yakwapi yangali ya mmbone. <verse eid="JHN 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 7:19"/>Bhuli, a Musha bhangampanganga shalia? Nkali nneyo, jwakwa nkali jumo munkumbi gwenunji akamula shalia. Kwa nndi mpinga mulaganga?”<verse eid="JHN 7:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 7:20"/>Bhandunji bhala gubhaajangwilenje, “Mmwe nshikola maoka! Gani apinga kummulaga?”<verse eid="JHN 7:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 7:21"/>A Yeshu gubhaajangwilenje, “Shipali shindu shimo shindendile, shinkanganigwenje. <verse eid="JHN 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 7:22"/>A Musha bhampelenje nkubho gwa jaluka. Nngabha kuti gwene nkubhogo kugwakopweshe kwa a Musha, ikabhe kwa ashambuje. Na nnaino mmanganyanji nkali Lyubha lya Pumulila, nnakuntaganga mundu unyago. <verse eid="JHN 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 7:23"/>Bhai ibhaga, nkali Lyubha lya Pumulila mundu anajaluka nkupinga shalia ja a Musha jinaleshwe, pakuti nnandumbalilanga kwa ligongo lya kunnamya mundu Lyubha lya Pumulila? <verse eid="JHN 7:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 7:24"/>Nnaukumulanje indu kwa lola sha palangape, nshoyanje ukumu ja aki.”<verse eid="JHN 7:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Bhuli Bhenebha a Kilishitu?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 7:25"/>Bhandu bhananji bha ku Yelushalemu gubhashitenje, “Bhuli, bhenebha nngabha bhubhaakwaloleyanga bhaabhulaganje bhala? <verse eid="JHN 7:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 7:26"/>Nnolanje nnaino! Bhanabheleketa palugwinjili, na wala bhakakwaabhalanjilanga shindu. Bhuli ipingaga ashikalongolele bhang'amwilenje kuti kweli bhenebha a Kilishitu? <verse eid="JHN 7:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 7:27"/>Ikabheje tukumanyi abha bhandubha kubhakoposhele, a Kilishitu pushibhaishe jwakwa mundu shakumanye kubhakoposhele!”<verse eid="JHN 7:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 7:28"/>Bhai, a Yeshu pubhaliji nkujiganya Nniekalu gubhautiye lilobhe, “Elo mmanyinji nne, na kungoposhele nkumanyinji! Nkali nneyo, nangaika kwa mashili gangu namwene, ikabhe bhandumile bhala bha kweli, mmanganyanji nkakwaamanyanga. <verse eid="JHN 7:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 7:29"/>Ikabheje nne naamanyi pabha kungoposhele kunngwabho, bhenebho ni bhandumile.”<verse eid="JHN 7:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 7:30"/>Bhai, bhandunji gubhapinjilenje kwaakamula, ikabheje jwakwapi mundu alinjile kwaakamula, pabha malanga gabho ga kamulwa galiji gakanabheika. <verse eid="JHN 7:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 7:31"/>Bhandunji bhabhagwinji nnugwinjili mula gubhaakulupalilenje, nigubhashitenje, “Igala, pushibhaishe a Kilishitu shibhatende ilangulo yaikulungwa kupunda ibhatendile bhenebhai?”<verse eid="JHN 7:31"/></para>
  <para style="s">Bhalinda Bhanatumwanga Kwaakamula a Yeshu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 7:32"/>Ashimapalishayo gubhaapilikenenje bhandunji bhalinong'onanga nkwainginika a Yeshu. Bhai, Ashimapalishayo na bhakulungwanji bhaabhishila gubhaatumilenje bhalinda bhaakakamulanje. <verse eid="JHN 7:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 7:33"/>A Yeshu gubhashite, “Puni pamo na mmanganyanji mobha gashoko, kungai shinyende kubhandumile bhala. <verse eid="JHN 7:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 7:34"/>Nkupinganoleyanga, ikabheje nkamonanga, pabha pene pushimbagwe nne pala, nkakombolanga kuika.”<verse eid="JHN 7:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 7:35"/>Ashikalongolele bha Bhayaudi gubhabhuyenenje ashaayenenji, “Abha bhandubha kubhapinga kwenda kwei kwaatenda uwe tunaapate? Eti bhapinga kwaajendelanga Bhayaudi bhapwilinganishilenje ku Bhagiliki bhakaajiganyanje Bhagiliki? <verse eid="JHN 7:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 7:36"/>Malombolelo gakwe nndi malobhe gubhabheleketega. ‘Nkupinga noleyanga ikabheje nkamonanga, na pushimbagwe nne mmanganyanji nkakombolanga kuika?’ ”<verse eid="JHN 7:36"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nushi ya Mashi ga Gumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 7:37"/>Lyubha lya mpelo gwa shikukuusho pulyaaliji lyubha likulu. A Yeshu gubhajimi, gubhashite kwa lilobhe lya utiya, “Akwete nnjota ajiye kwangune apapile. <verse eid="JHN 7:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 7:38"/>Malinga shigataya Majandiko ga Ukonjelo. ‘Angulupalila nne, nushi ya mashi ga gumi shibhutushe kopoka muntima gwakwe!’ ” <verse eid="JHN 7:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 7:39"/>Bhashinkubheleketa genego kwa ligongo lya Mbumu jwa Ukonjelo jushibhamposhelanje bhaakulupalilenjebho. Gene malangago Mbumu jwa Ukonjelo paaliji akanabhe ika, pabha a Yeshu bhaliji bhakanabhe kuywa.<verse eid="JHN 7:39"/></para>
  <para style="s">Malekano ga Bhandunji kwa Ligongo lya a Yeshu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 7:40"/>Bhandu bhananji nnugwinjili mula gubhapilikenenje gene malobhego, gubhashitenje, “Kweli bhene bhandubha ankulondola bha a Nnungu bhakwiya bhala!”<verse eid="JHN 7:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 7:41"/>Bhananji gubhashitenje, “Abha a Kilishitu!” Ikabheje bhananji gubhashitenje, “Bhuli, inakomboleka a Kilishitu kukopoka ku Galilaya? <verse eid="JHN 7:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 7:42"/>Gakuti bhuli Majandiko ga Ukonjelo? Gakuti. ‘A Kilishitu shibhakoposhele nshipinga sha a Daudi, shibhabhelekwe ku Bheteleemu, shilambo sha a Daudi!’ ” <verse eid="JHN 7:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 7:43"/>Bhai, gugakoposhele malekano munkumbi gwa bhandunji mula kwa ligongo lya a Yeshu. <verse eid="JHN 7:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 7:44"/>Bhandu bhananji gubhapinjilenje kwaakamula ikabheje jwakwa alinjile kwaaamula.<verse eid="JHN 7:44"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ashikalongolele bha Bhayaudi Bhangalinji Ngulupai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 7:45"/>Kungai bhalinda bhala gubhabhujilenje kubhakulungwanji bha bhakulungwanji bhaabhishila na Mapalishayo, nabhalabhonji gubhaabhushiyenje, “Kwa nndi mwangajia nabhonji?”<verse eid="JHN 7:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 7:46"/>Bhalinda gubhaajangwilenje, “Wala jwakwa mundu akombwele bheleketa malinga shibhaabheleketa bhene bhandu bhala!”<verse eid="JHN 7:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 7:47"/>Ashimapalishayo gubhaabhushiyenje, “Bhuli, nkali mmanganyanji ntembilwenje? <verse eid="JHN 7:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 7:48"/>Bhuli, mumweninji nkali jumo jwa ashikalongolele bha bhandu, eu jumo jwa Mapalishayo abhakulupalile? <verse eid="JHN 7:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 7:49"/>Ikabheje alu lugwinjililu bhakakujigamanya shalia ja a Musha, bhashiloshwanga na a Nnungu!”<verse eid="JHN 7:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 7:50"/>Bhamo bha munkumbi gwa Mapalishayo, a Nikodemo, bhaajendele a Yeshu mobha gapitile, gubhaalugulilenje, <verse eid="JHN 7:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 7:51"/>“Bhuli, shalia jetu jinakunng'ukumula mundu gwangatandubha kumpilikanishiya nikugamanya gatendile?”<verse eid="JHN 7:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 7:52"/>Bhalabhonji gubhaajangwilenje, “Bhuli na mmwe kunkopweshe ku Galilaya? Ayaga, nkalole Mmajandiko ga Ukonjelo, na mmwe shimumanye kuti ku Galilaya kukakopoka Nkulondola jwa a Nnungu!” <verse eid="JHN 7:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 7:53"/>Bhai kila mundu gwapite kunngwakwe.<verse eid="JHN 7:53"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JHN 8"/>
  <para style="s">Bhakongwe Bhakamwilwe Utwai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 8:1"/>Ikabheje a Yeshu gubhapite kushitumbi sha Misheituni. <verse eid="JHN 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 8:2"/>Malabhi gakwe lyambape gubhapite kabhili ku likanisha. Bhandu bhowe gubhaajendelenje, nigubhatemi kwaajiganyanga. <verse eid="JHN 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 8:3"/>Bhai, bhaajiganya bha shalia na Mapalishayo gubhaapeleshelenje bhakongwe bhamo bhaimanilwe nkulabhalabha. Gubhaajimikenje mmujo jabho. <verse eid="JHN 8:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 8:4"/>Gubhaabhushiyenje a Yeshu, “Mmajiganya! Bhene bhakongwebha bhashiimanilwa nkulabhalabha. <verse eid="JHN 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 8:5"/>Kupitila shalia, a Musha bhatulajile kuti, bhakongwe malinga bhenebha bhakomwe maganga mpaka bhawe. Bhai, mmwe nkuti bhuli?” <verse eid="JHN 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 8:6"/>Bhashinkubheleketanga nneyo nkwaatejela, nkupinga bhapatanje shiumilo sha kwaalugula. Ikabheje a Yeshu gubhakotime pai, nijandika na shikowe nnitaka.<verse eid="JHN 8:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 8:7"/>Bhakapundanjeje kwaabhuya, a Yeshu gubhajinwishe, gubhaalugulilenje, “Mundu jwangali shambi munkumbi gwenunji, abhe jwantai kuleshela liganga.” <verse eid="JHN 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 8:8"/>Kungai gubhakotime kabhili, bhalijandika nnitaka. <verse eid="JHN 8:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 8:9"/>Bhakapilikananjeje nneyo, gubhatandwibhenje kujabhula jumojumo, kutandubhila bhanangulungwa. A Yeshu gubhaigele jikape, na bhakongwe bhala bhajimi pala pepala. <verse eid="JHN 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 8:10"/>A Yeshu bhakajinusheje gubhaabhushiye bhakongwe bhala, “Kubhalinginji kwei bhakunshitakiyanga bhala? Bhuli, jwakwa nkali jumo akunng'ukumula?”<verse eid="JHN 8:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 8:11"/>Bhakongwe bhala gubhajangwile, “Mmakulungwa, jwakwa nkali jumo!” A Yeshu nabhalabho gubhaalugulile, “Nkali nne nganng'ukumula. Mwijendele, tandubhila nnaino nnatende yambi kabhili.”<verse eid="JHN 8:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">A Yeshu Shilangaya sha Shilambolyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 8:12"/>A Yeshu gubhakungulwishe na bhandunji bhala kabhili, bhalinkuti, “Nne shilangaya sha shilambolyo. Angagula nne, wala akaowa nnubhindu, ikabheje shakole shilangaya sha gumi.”<verse eid="JHN 8:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 8:13"/>Bhai Ashimapalishayo gubhalugwilenje, “Mmwe nnakwikong'ondela mmayene, kwa nneyo ukong'ondelo gwenu nngabha gwa kweli.”<verse eid="JHN 8:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 8:14"/>A Yeshu gubhaajangwilenje, “Nkali monaga ngunakwikong'ondela namwene, ukong'ondelo gwangu gwa kweli, pabha nne nikumanyi kungoposhele na kungwenda. Ikabheje mmanganyanji nkakukumanyanga kungoposhele wala kungwenda. <verse eid="JHN 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 8:15"/>Mmanganyanji nnaukumulanga kwa ng'aniyo ya shigundu. Ikabheje nne ngakunng'ukumula mundu. <verse eid="JHN 8:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 8:16"/>Nkali ng'ukumulaga, ukumu jangu ja kweli, pabha nne puni nngabha jikape, Atati bhandumile pubhali na nne. <verse eid="JHN 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 8:17"/>Shalia jenunji jangajandika Mmajandiko ga Ukonjelo kuti, ukong'ondelo gwa bhandu bhabhili ni gwa kweli. <verse eid="JHN 8:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 8:18"/>Nne ngunakwikong'ondela namwene, na bhalabho Atati bhandumile bhanangong'ondela nneyo peyo.”<verse eid="JHN 8:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 8:19"/>Penepo gubhaabhushiyenje, “Ainabhenu kubhali kwei?” A Yeshu gubhajangwile, “Mmanganyanji nkaamanyanga nne, wala Atati nkakwaamanyanga. Kaliji nkamanyinji nne, nkali Atati nkaamanyinji.”<verse eid="JHN 8:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 8:20"/>A Yeshu pubhabhelekete genego bhalijiganya ku likanisha, tome na pushaaliji shibhiko. Jwakwa mundu abhakamwile, pabha malanga gabho galiji gakanabhe ika. Kungwenda Mmanganya Nkakombolanga Kuika.<verse eid="JHN 8:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">A Yeshu Bhanalondola ga Shiwo Shabho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 8:21"/>A Yeshu gubhaalugulilenje kabhili, “Nne ngunakwiijabhulila na mmanganya shinnoleyanje, ikabheje shinng'wanganje na yambi yenunji. Kungwenda nne, mmanganyanji nkakombolanga kuika.”<verse eid="JHN 8:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 8:22"/>Bhai Bhayaudi gubhabheleketenje, “Bhuli bhapinga kwiibhulaga? Pabha bhakuti, ‘Kungwenda mmanganyanji nkakombolanga kuika?’ ”<verse eid="JHN 8:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 8:23"/>A Yeshu gubhaalugulilenje, “Mmanganyanji mmapai pano, nne kungoposhele kunani, mmanganyanji mmapashilambolyo pano, nne nngabha jwa pashilambolyo pano. <verse eid="JHN 8:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 8:24"/>Lyeneli ni ligongo lya kummalanjilanga kuti shinng'wanganje na yambi yenunji monaga nkakulupalilanje kuti ‘Nne ni Nne,’ kweli shinng'wanganje na yambi yenunji.”<verse eid="JHN 8:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 8:25"/>Na bhalabhonji gubhaabhushiyenje, “Mmwe agani?” A Yeshu gubhaajangwilenje, “Ninnugulilenje kuumila kundandubho! <verse eid="JHN 8:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 8:26"/>Ngwete gamagwinji ga bheleketa na kung'ukumulanga, ikabheje bhandumile bhala bha kweli, nne ngunakwaabhalanjilanga bhandunji bha pa shilambolyo indu imbilikene kopoka kwa bhenebho.”<verse eid="JHN 8:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 8:27"/>Wala bhangang'amulanga kuti a Yeshu bhabheleketaga ga Atati bha kunnungu. <verse eid="JHN 8:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 8:28"/>Bhai, a Yeshu gubhaalugulilenje, “Pushimunnjinulanje Mwana juka Mundu kunani, penepo shimmumanyanje kuti ‘Nne ni Nne,’ Na shoshowe shingutenda nngabha shangu namwene, ikabhe gungubheleketa gubhanyigenye Atatipe. <verse eid="JHN 8:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 8:29"/>Bhandumile bhala pubhali pamo na nne, bhanganeka jikape, pabha mobha gowe ingutenda ikwaanonyela ila.”<verse eid="JHN 8:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 8:30"/>Pubhabheleketaga genego, bhandu bhabhagwinji gubhaakulupalilenje.<verse eid="JHN 8:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kweli Shijimpanganje Ungwana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 8:31"/>Bhai a Yeshu gubhaabhalanjilenje Bhayaudi bhaakulupalilangaga bhala, “Monaga nkamulangaga majiganyo gangu shimmanganje bhaajiganywa bhangu bha kweli. <verse eid="JHN 8:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 8:32"/>Numbe shinnjimanyanje kweli, na kwelijo shijimmikanje muungwana.”<verse eid="JHN 8:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 8:33"/>Na bhalabhonji gubhaajangwilenje, “Uwe lubheleko lwa a Bhulaimu, wala tukanabhebha bhatumwa bhaka mundu jojowe jula. Nkulombola nndi punkulugula, ‘Shimmanganje mmangwana?’ ” <verse eid="JHN 8:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 8:34"/>A Yeshu gubhaajangwilenje, “Kweli ngunakummalanjilanga, mundu jojowe atenda yambi, ntumwa jwa yambi. <verse eid="JHN 8:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 8:35"/>Mobha gowe ntumwa akaabhalanganishiywa nnikaja, ikabheje mwana anatama nnikaja mobha gowe. <verse eid="JHN 8:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 8:36"/>Ibhaga mwana shammpanganje ungwana, shimmanganje bhangwana bha kweli. <verse eid="JHN 8:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 8:37"/>Nimumanyi kuti mmanganyanji lubheleko lwa a Bhulaimu. Nkali nneyo, nnatumbililanga kumulaga kwa ligongo lyangagapinga majiganyo gangu. <verse eid="JHN 8:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 8:38"/>Nne ingubheleketa iniibhweni kwa Atati ila, ikabheje mmanganyanji inkutendanga immalanjilwenje na anakulubhenunji.”<verse eid="JHN 8:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 8:39"/>Gubhajangwilenje, “Uwe lubheleko lwa a Bhulaimu!” A Yeshu gubhaabhalanjilenje, “Kaliji mmanganyanji nkalinginji lubheleko lwa a Bhulaimu, nkatendilenje ibhatendaga a Bhulaimu. <verse eid="JHN 8:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 8:40"/>Nne nimmalanjilenje ga kweli jimbipilikene kwa a Nnungu, nkali nneyo, mmanganya nnatumbililanga kumulaga. A Bhulaimu bhangatenda nneyo! <verse eid="JHN 8:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 8:41"/>Mmanganya nnatendanga ibhaatenda ainabhenunji.” Penepo gubhaalugulilenje, “Uwe nngabha lubheleko lwa mmaukutu! Tukwete Atati bhamope, yani a Nnungu.”<verse eid="JHN 8:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 8:42"/>A Yeshu gubhaabhalanjilenje, “Kaliji a Nnungu bhakaliji Ainabhenunji nkambinjilenje nne, pabha kungoposhele kwa a Nnungu, na nnaino ng'ishe apano. Nangaika kwa mashili gangu namwene, ikabhe ga bhandumile bhala. <verse eid="JHN 8:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 8:43"/>Kwa nndi nkaelewanga ingubheleketa ino? Pabha nkapinganga kupilikanishiya malobhe gangu. <verse eid="JHN 8:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 8:44"/>Mmanganyanji bha lubheleko luka Lishetani na inkupinganga kutenda ya shilokoli shika nng'inagwenunji. Jwenejo paaliji nkubhulaga kuumila kundandubho, wala akapingaga ya kweli, pabha jwangali kweli muntima gwakwe. Yaabheleketa ya unami, gabheleketa gali muntima gwakwe, pabha jwenejo nnami na nng'inamundu jwa unami. <verse eid="JHN 8:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 8:45"/>Nne kwa ligongo lya bheleketa ga kweli, mmanganyanji nkaangulupalilanga. <verse eid="JHN 8:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 8:46"/>Gani munkumbi gwenunji akong'ondela kuti nne njikola yambi? Bhai ibhaga ingubheleketa ya kweli, kwa nndi nkangulupalilanga? <verse eid="JHN 8:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 8:47"/>Jwene ali jwa a Nnungu alipilikana malobhe ga a Nnungu. Ikabheje mmanganyanji nkapilikananga pabha nngabha mmandunji bha a Nnungu.”<verse eid="JHN 8:47"/></para>
  <para style="s">A Yeshu Bhaapali a Bhulaimu Bhakanabhe Bhelekwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 8:48"/>Bhayaudi gubhaajangwilenje, “Bhuli, twangabheleketa kweli kuti mmwe Mmashamalia, numbe nshikola maoka?” <verse eid="JHN 8:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 8:49"/>A Yeshu gubhajangwile, “Nne nangali maoka, ikabheje ngunakwaishimiya Atati na mmanganyanji nkang'ishimiyanga. <verse eid="JHN 8:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 8:50"/>Nne ngaaloleya ukonjelo gwangu namwene, ikabheje bhapali bhamo bhakuuloleya, numbe bhaukumula. <verse eid="JHN 8:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 8:51"/>Kweli ngunakummalanjilanga, akunda malobhe gangu akawa.”<verse eid="JHN 8:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 8:52"/>Bhai, Bhayaudi gubhaajangwilenje, “Nnaino tung'amwile kuti mwe nkwete maoka! A Bhulaimu bhawile, nkali ashinkulondola bha a Nnungu bhawilenje, mmwe nkuti, ‘Akagulila malobhe gangu akawa!’ <verse eid="JHN 8:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 8:53"/>Bhuli mmwe nkwiitenda mmakulungwa kupunda ambuje a Bhulaimu bhawile? Nkali ashinkulondola bha a Nnungu bhawilenje. Mmwe nkwiitenda agani?” <verse eid="JHN 8:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 8:54"/>A Yeshu gubhajangwile, “Niikuyaga namwene, ukonjelo gwangu nngabha shindu. Atati bhunkwaalugulanga mmanganyanji kuti ainabhenunji ni bhaanguya. <verse eid="JHN 8:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 8:55"/>Mmanganyanji nkakwaamanyanga, ikabheje nne naamanyi. Meleketaga kuti ngakwaamanya, shinambile malinga mmanganyanji. Nne naamanyi numbe ngunakamula lilobhe lyabho. <verse eid="JHN 8:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 8:56"/>Ainabhenunji a Bhulaimu, bhashinkuangalila bhalibhone lyubha lyangu, numbe bhalibhweni, gubhainonyele.”<verse eid="JHN 8:56"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 8:57"/>Bhai, Bhayaudi gubhaalugulilenje, “Mmwe nkanabhe ishila yaka makumi nng'ano, mmwe mwaabhweni a Bhulaimu?” <verse eid="JHN 8:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 8:58"/>A Yeshu gubhaalugulilenje, “Kweli ngunakummalanjilanga, nne naapali, a Bhulaimu bhakanabhe pagwa.”<verse eid="JHN 8:58"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 8:59"/>Penepo gubhalokwetenje maganga nkupinga kwaakoma, ikabheje a Yeshu gubhaijubhile, gubhashoshile ku likanisha.<verse eid="JHN 8:59"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JHN 9"/>
  <para style="s">A Yeshu Bhanakunnamya Nangalole jwa Shibhelekwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 9:1"/>A Yeshu bhali nkupita gubhammweni mundu jumo, nangalole jwa shibhelekwa. <verse eid="JHN 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 9:2"/>Bhai, bhaajiganywa bhabho gubhaabhushiyenje, “Mmaajiganya! Gani atendile yambi, jwene munduju eu bhankwetenje mpaka abhelekwe nangalole?”<verse eid="JHN 9:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 9:3"/>A Yeshu gubhajangwile, “Lyeneli lyangakoposhela kwa ligongo lya yambi yakwe, wala yambi ya bhankwetenje, ikabhe ashibhelekwa na unangalole nkupinga mashili ga a Nnungu gabhoneshe. <verse eid="JHN 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 9:4"/>Pabha kukanabhe pilila, tunapinjikwa kutenda maengo ga bhandumile bhala, kupililaga mundu akakombola kutenda liengo. <verse eid="JHN 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 9:5"/>Mobha guni pashilambolyo, nne shilangaya sha shilambolyo.”<verse eid="JHN 9:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 9:6"/>Bhakabheleketeje genego, gubhaunile mata pai, gubhaeleye litope na mata gala, gubhampashile mmeyo nangalole jula, <verse eid="JHN 9:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 9:7"/>gubhannugulile, “Jenda ukanabhe kulitanda lya Shiloamu.” Malombolelo ga Shiloamu, “Atumilwe.” Bhai, nangalole jula gwapite kunabha, kungai gwabhujile alilola.<verse eid="JHN 9:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 9:8"/>Bhai, ashaatami ajakwe na bhammanyangaga kuti paliji nangalole nkujuga, gubhashitenje, “Bhuli, jweneju nngabha nkulaga atamaga na juga jula?” <verse eid="JHN 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 9:9"/>Bhananji gubhashitenje, “Ni juju.” Bhananji gubhashitenje, “Ng'oo! Ikabhe ashilandanape.” Ikabheje aliji nangalole jula nigwashite, “Ni nne!”<verse eid="JHN 9:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 9:10"/>Bhai, gubhammushiyenje, “Shanabhuli meyo gako pugashite lola?” <verse eid="JHN 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 9:11"/>Jwalakwe gwabhajangwilenje, “Bhandu bhaashemwa a Yeshu bhala bhashinkualaya litope, gubhambashile mmeyo ninugulila. ‘Jenda ukanabhe kulitanda lya Shiloamu.’ Bhai, gumbite nabha, nigunolile.” <verse eid="JHN 9:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 9:12"/>Gubhammushiyenje, “Bhenebho kubhali kwei?” Jwalakwe gwabhajangwilenje, “Nne ngakukumanya!”<verse eid="JHN 9:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mapalishayo Bhanabhushishiyanga ga Lamywa Nangalole</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 9:13"/>Kungai mundu aliji nangalole jula gubhampelekenje kwa Ashimapalishayo. <verse eid="JHN 9:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 9:14"/>Lyene lyubha libhaeleye litope a Yeshu nikunnamiya mundu nangalolejo, pulyaaliji Lyubha lya Pumulila. <verse eid="JHN 9:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 9:15"/>Bhai, Ashimapalishayo gubhammushiyenje jwene mundujo, “Shanabhuli pukombwele kulola?” Jwalakwe gwabhalugulilenje, “Bhashinkumbaka litope mmeyo, gunabhile nnaino ngulilola.”<verse eid="JHN 9:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 9:16"/>Ashimapalishayo bhananji gubhashitenje, “Bhene bhandubho bhangakoposhela kwa a Nnugu, pabha bhakaakagula shalia ja Lyubha lya Pumulila.” Ikabheje bhananji gubhashitenje, “Mundu akwete yambi akombola bhuli kutenda ilangulo ya nnei?” Gugakoposhele malekano munkumbi gwabhonji. <verse eid="JHN 9:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 9:17"/>Gubhammushiyenje kabhili mundu aliji nangalole jula, “Pabha bhenebho bhashikulamya meyo, ukwaataya bhuli?” Jwalakwe gwabhalugulilenje, “Bhenebho ankulondola bha a Nnungu!”<verse eid="JHN 9:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 9:18"/>Ashikalongolele bha Bhayaudi bhangakulupalilanga kuti jwene mundujo bhukala paliji nangalole na nnaino analola, mpaka pubhaashemilenje bhankwetenje. <verse eid="JHN 9:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 9:19"/>Bhai, gubhaabhushiyenje, “Bhuli, jweneju ni mwana jwenunji junkutinji pabhelekwe ali nangalole? Shanabhuli nnaino pakombwele kulola?”<verse eid="JHN 9:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 9:20"/>Bhankwetenje gubhajangwilenje, “Uwe tummanyi aju mwana gwetu na pabhelekwe ali nangalole. <verse eid="JHN 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 9:21"/>Ikabheje shanabhuli palolile, tukakumumanya na nkali annamiye meyojo, uwe tukakummanya. Mummuyanje nnyene, jwenejo jwankulungwa, shataye.” <verse eid="JHN 9:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 9:22"/>Bhankwetenje bhashinkubheleketanga nneyo kwa ligongo lya kwaajogopanga ashikalongolele bha Bhayaudi, pabha ashikalongolelebho bhashinkulagananga kuti mundu jojowe shakunde kuti a Yeshu ni a Kilishitu abhingwe nshinagogi. <verse eid="JHN 9:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 9:23"/>Lyenelyo ni ligongo lya bhankwetenje kubheleta kuti, “Jwenejo jwankulungwa, mummuyanje nnyene.”<verse eid="JHN 9:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 9:24"/>Bhai, gubhanshemilenje kabhili aliji nangalole jula, gubhannugulilenje, “Ubhelekete ya kweli gwaape ukonjelo a Nnungu! Uwe tumumanyi kuti abha bhandubha bhakwete yambi.” <verse eid="JHN 9:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 9:25"/>Jwenejo gwajangwile, “Monaga bhakwete yambi, nne ngaamanya. Ikabheje nishimanyi shindu shimo kuti, naliji nangalole na nnaino ngunalola.”<verse eid="JHN 9:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 9:26"/>Bhai, gubhammushiyenje, “Bhakutendele nndi? Bhakulamiye shanabhuli meyo gako?” <verse eid="JHN 9:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 9:27"/>Jwene mundujo gwabhajangwilenje, “Nimmalanjilenje, mmanganyanji mwangapilikanishiyanga, kwa nndi nnapinganga kupilikana kabhili? Bhuli na mmanganyanji nnapinganga kubha bhaajiganywa bhabho?” <verse eid="JHN 9:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 9:28"/>Bhai gubhantukenenje, bhalinkutinji, “Ugwe ni nkujiganywa jwabho, uwe tubhaajiganywa bha a Musha. <verse eid="JHN 9:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 9:29"/>Uwe tumumanyi kuti a Nnungu bhashinkubheleketa na a Musha, ikabheje bhene bhandubha tukakukumanya kubhakoposhele!”<verse eid="JHN 9:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 9:30"/>Jwalakwe gwabhajangwilenje, “Sheneshi sha kanganigwa! Mmanganyanji nkakukumanyanga kubhakoposhele, ikabheje bhashinamiya meyo gangu! <verse eid="JHN 9:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 9:31"/>Tumumanyi kuti a Nnungu bhakakwapilikanishiyanga bhandunji bhakwetenje yambi, ikabhe jojowe akwaakunda na tenda gubhapinga. <verse eid="JHN 9:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 9:32"/>Kuumila bhukala pa shilambolyo ikanabhe pilikanika kuti mundu ashilamya meyo gaka nangalole jwa shibhelekwa. <verse eid="JHN 9:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 9:33"/>Monaga bhene bhandubha bhangakoposhela kwa a Nnungu, bhakanakombole kutenda shoshowe!”<verse eid="JHN 9:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 9:34"/>Gubhajangwilenje, “Ugwe ushibhelekwa na lelelwa muyambi jika, utujiganye uwe?” Bhai, gubhankanilenje kushinagogi.<verse eid="JHN 9:34"/></para>
  <para style="s">Unangalole gwa Muntima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 9:35"/>A Yeshu gubhapilikene kuti bhashikunkananga nshinagogi. Bhai, bhakammoneje gubhammushiye, “Bhuli, ugwe ulikunkulupalila Mwana juka Mundu?”<verse eid="JHN 9:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 9:36"/>Jwene mundujo gwajangwile, “Mmakulungwa, nnugulile jwenejo ni gani, ninkulupalile.”<verse eid="JHN 9:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 9:37"/>A Yeshu gubhammalanjile, “Mumweni, akunguluka na mmwejo.”<verse eid="JHN 9:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 9:38"/>Bhai, jwene mundujo gwashite, “Mmakulungwa ngulikulupalila!” Gwabhatindibhalile.<verse eid="JHN 9:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 9:39"/>A Yeshu gubhashite, “Nne njiika kushilambolyo kuukumula, nkupinga bhakaalolanga bhalolanje, na bhaalolanga bhabhanganje ashinangalole.”<verse eid="JHN 9:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 9:40"/>Ashimapalishayo bhananji bhalinginji pamo na bhenebho gubhapilikenenje gene malobhego, gubhaabhushiyenje, “Bhuli, nkali uwe ashinangalole?”<verse eid="JHN 9:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 9:41"/>A Yeshu gubhaajangwilenje, “Monaga nkalinginji ashinangalole, nkanakolanjeje yambi, ikabheje nnaino nkutinji. ‘Uwe tulilola,’ bhai launo nkwetenje yambi.<verse eid="JHN 9:41"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JHN 10"/>
  <para style="s">Nshunga jwa Mmbone</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 10:1"/>“Kweli ngunakummalanjilanga, jojowe akajinjila nshitundu sha ngondolo kupitila pannango, ikabhe nipeleta panape, jwenejo nngwii na nkupokonyola. <verse eid="JHN 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 10:2"/>Ikabheje apitila pa nnango, jwenejo nshunga jwa ngondolo. <verse eid="JHN 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 10:3"/>Nkulinda nnango gwa shitundu, anakunng'ugulila nshunga na ngondolo inapilikana lilobhe lyakwe, na anakwiishema ngondolo yakwe kwa mena gabhonji, nikwilongoya palanga. <verse eid="JHN 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 10:4"/>Aikopoyaga palanga anakwilongolela mmujo, numbe ngondolo ilikunkagula, pabha bhanakulimanyanga lilobhe lyakwe. <verse eid="JHN 10:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 10:5"/>Ngondolo nngankagula nnjeni, ikabhe shiimmutushe, pabha ikakulimanya lilobhe lyakwe.”<verse eid="JHN 10:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 10:6"/>A Yeshu bhashinkwabhalanjilanga lwene lutangolu, ikabheje bhangashimanyanga shibhalugulilwenje.<verse eid="JHN 10:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">A Yeshu Bhashunga bha Mmbone</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 10:7"/>Bhai a Yeshu, gubhashite kabhili, “Kweli ngunakummalanjilanga, nne nnango gwa ngondolo. <verse eid="JHN 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 10:8"/>Bhowenji bhalongolelenje nganabheika nne, bhagwii na bhaapokonyola na yalakwe ngondolo yangaapilikanilanga. <verse eid="JHN 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 10:9"/>Nne nnango. Ajinjila kupitila nne shatapulwe na shajinjile nikopoka na shaapate shalya. <verse eid="JHN 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 10:10"/>Nngwii anakwiya nkupinga, kujibha, kubhulaga na kuangabhanya. Nne njikwiya nkupinga nkolanje gumi, numbe gumi gwa punda.<verse eid="JHN 10:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 10:11"/>“Nne nshunga jwa mmbone. Nshunga jwa mmbone akajogopa shoya gumi gwakwe kwa ligongo lya ngondolo yakwe. <verse eid="JHN 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 10:12"/>Mundu jwa nshaala, wala nngabha nshunga, na wala ngondolo nngabha yakwe, ammonagape liogo alikwiiya, anakwiileka ngondolo nibhutuka, penepo liogo anakwiikamula na ina inapwilinganya. <verse eid="JHN 10:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 10:13"/>Anabhutuka pabha jwenejo mundu jwa nshaalape akajali ga ngondolo pabha nngabha yakwe. <verse eid="JHN 10:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 10:14"/>Nne nshunga jwa mmbone. Bhalinginji bhangu naamanyinji, na bhalabhonji bhalinginji bhangu bhamanyinji, <verse eid="JHN 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 10:15"/>malinga Atati shibhamanya nne, na nne shingwamanya Atati. Nne ngunakwishoya gumi gwangu kwa ligongo lyabhonji. <verse eid="JHN 10:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 10:16"/>Ngwete ngondolo ina nngabha ya shishino shitundu shino. Ngunapinjikwa ng'ishenayo nkali yeneyo, na yalakwe shiipilikane lilobhe lyangu, kungai shiibhe likundi limo na nshunga jumo.<verse eid="JHN 10:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 10:17"/>“Kwa nneyo Atati bhanambinga, pabha ngunakuushoya gumi gwangu nkupinga umujile kabhili. <verse eid="JHN 10:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 10:18"/>Jwakwa mundu jwa mbokonyola gumi gwangu, ngunakuushoya kwa engwa namwene. Ngwete mashili ga kuushoya na mashili ga kuutola kabhili. Nneyo ni shibhang'amulishe Atati ndende.”<verse eid="JHN 10:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 10:19"/>Gugakoposhele kabhili malekano munkumbi gwa Bhayaudi kwa ligongo lya gene malobhego. <verse eid="JHN 10:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 10:20"/>Bhabhagwinji gubhashitenje, “Bhashikola maoka, numbe bhalwele shalubha! Kwa nndi kwaapilikanishiya?”<verse eid="JHN 10:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 10:21"/>Bhananji gubhashitenje, “Aga nngabha malobhe gaka mundu akwete maoka. Bhuli, lioka linakombola kulamya meyo gaka nangalole?”<verse eid="JHN 10:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">A Yeshu Bhanakanwa na Bhayaudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 10:22"/>Bhai ku Yelushalemu shashinkupagwa shikukuu sha kumbushila kulimbula likanisha. Gene mobhago pugaliji ga shipwepwe. <verse eid="JHN 10:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 10:23"/>Na bhalabho a Yeshu bhatendaga owa ku likanisha nnukumbi lwa a Shelemani. <verse eid="JHN 10:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 10:24"/>Bhai, Bhayaudi gubhaatimbililenje, gubhaabhushiyenje, “Shinnjiabhuye mitima mpaka shakani? Monaga mmwe a Kilishitu, bhai ntubhalanjile.”<verse eid="JHN 10:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 10:25"/>A Yeshu gubhaajangwilenje, “Nimmalanjilenje, ikabheje nkaakulupalilanga. Maengo gungukamula kwa lina lya Atati ganangong'ondela. <verse eid="JHN 10:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 10:26"/>Ikabheje mmanganyanji nkaakulupalilanga, pabha mmanganyanji nngabha ngondolo yangu. <verse eid="JHN 10:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 10:27"/>Ngondolo yangu inapilikana lilobhe lyangu, nne ngulikwiimanya, na yalakwe inaangagula. <verse eid="JHN 10:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 10:28"/>Numbe nne ngunakwaapanganga gumi gwa pitipiti, wala bhakaobhanga na wala jwakwa mundu shakombole kwapokonyolanga mmakono gangu. <verse eid="JHN 10:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 10:29"/>Atati bhambele yene ngondoloyo ni bhakulungwa kupunda bhowe, wala jwakwa shakombole kwaashoyanga mmakono ga Atati. <verse eid="JHN 10:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 10:30"/>Nne na Atati, tubhamope.”<verse eid="JHN 10:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 10:31"/>Bhai Bhayaudi gubhalokwetenje maganga nkupinga bhaakomanje. <verse eid="JHN 10:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 10:32"/>A Yeshu gubhaabhalugulilenje, “Ninnangwiyenje maengo ga mmbone gamagwinji kopoka kwa Atati. Gei gundendile gatenda nngomanje maganga?” <verse eid="JHN 10:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 10:33"/>Bhayaudi gubhaajangwilenje, “Tukakunkoma maganga kwa ligongo lya maengo ga mmbone, ikabhe kwa ligongo lya kwatukana a Nnungu! Pabha mmwe nnakwiitenda a Nnungu mbena mmandupe.”<verse eid="JHN 10:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 10:34"/>A Yeshu gubhaajangwilenje, “Bhuli shalia jenunji jangajandika Mmajandiko ga Ukonjelo kuti a Nnungu bhaashite, ‘Nne njite, mmanganyanji ashi nnungu’? <verse eid="JHN 10:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 10:35"/>A Nnungu bhashinkwaashemanga ashinnungu bhapegwilenje lilobhe lya a Nnungu, na uwe tumumanyi kuti Majandiko ga Ukonjelo ganabheleta kweli mobha gowe. <verse eid="JHN 10:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 10:36"/>Jwene aagwilwe na Atati nikuntuma kushilambolyo, nkummalanjilanga kuti bhuli, ‘Unatukana,’ pabha njibheleketa, ‘Nne Mwana jwa a Nnungu?’ <verse eid="JHN 10:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 10:37"/>Monaga ngakamula maengo ga Atati, nnangulupalilanje. <verse eid="JHN 10:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 10:38"/>Ikabheje monaga ngunakamula genego, nkali ibhaga nkangulupalilanga, nkulupalilanje kapela maengo pego, mmumanyanje na kung'amula kuti Atati mubhali nkati jangu, na nne nkati jabho.”<verse eid="JHN 10:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 10:39"/>Gubhalinjilenje kwaakamula kabhili, ikabheje gubhakolobhweshe mmakono gabhonji.<verse eid="JHN 10:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 10:40"/>A Yeshu gubhapite kung'ambo lushi lwa Yolodani, kubhabhatishaga a Yowana bhukala, gubhatemi kweneko. <verse eid="JHN 10:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 10:41"/>Bhandu bhabhagwinji gubhaajendelenje gubhashitenje, “A Yowana bhangatenda ilangulo yoyowe. Ikabheje gowe gubhatashiye a Yowana ga bhene bhandubha, pugaliji ga kweli.” <verse eid="JHN 10:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 10:42"/>Penepo bhandu bhabhagwinji gubhaakulupalilenje a Yeshu.<verse eid="JHN 10:42"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JHN 11"/>
  <para style="s">Kuwa kwa a Lashalo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 11:1"/>Bhai bhandu bhamo bhashemwaga a Lashalo bhatendaga lwala, kubhatamaga ku Bhetania, shilambo shibhatamanganaga a Malia na a Malata, ashaalumbu bhabho. <verse eid="JHN 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 11:2"/>A Malia ni bhene bhaapashile mauta Bhakulungwa nikwaunguta na umbo yabho, alumbu bhabho ni a Lashalo bhaaliji bhalwele. <verse eid="JHN 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 11:3"/>Bhai, ashalumbu bhabho gubhaapeleshelenje ntenga a Yeshu bhalinkutinji, “Mmakulungwa, ambwiga ajenu bhalwele!”<verse eid="JHN 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 11:4"/>A Yeshu bhakapilikaneje nneyo, gubhashite, “Shene shilweleshi nngabha sha bhulaga, ikabhe kwa ligongo lya kwaakuya a Nnungu, nkupinga Mwana jwa a Nnungu akuywe kwa shenesho.”<verse eid="JHN 11:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 11:5"/>A Yeshu bhashinkwaapinganga a Malata na akulu bhabho na alumbu bhabhonji a Lashalo. <verse eid="JHN 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 11:6"/>Bhai a Yeshu bhakapilikaneje ntenga gwa kuti a Lashalo bhalwele, gubhapundile tama pala mobha gana gabhili. <verse eid="JHN 11:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 11:7"/>Kungai gubhaalugulilenje bhaajiganywa bhabho, “Twendangananje kabhili ku Yudea!”<verse eid="JHN 11:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 11:8"/>Bhaajiganywa gubhaalugulilenje, “Mmaajiganya! Mobha gashokope gapitile Bhayaudi bhapingaga kunkomanga maganga, igala nkupinga kwenda koko kabhili?” <verse eid="JHN 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 11:9"/>A Yeshu gubhajangwile, “Bhuli malanga ga mui nngabha pugali mashaa kumi na gabhili? Bhai, mundu aowaga mui akakubhala, pabha alikushibhona shilangaya sha shilambolyoshi. <verse eid="JHN 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 11:10"/>Ikabheje mundu aowaga nnubhindu anakubhala pabha shakwa shilangaya.” <verse eid="JHN 11:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 11:11"/>A Yeshu bhakamaliyeje bheleketa gene malobhego, gubhaalugulilenje, “Ambwiga ajetu a Lashalo bhashigona, ikabheje nne shingaajumuye.”<verse eid="JHN 11:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 11:12"/>Bhai, bhaajiganywa bhabho gubhaalugulilenje, “Mmakulungwa, ibhaga bhashigona, shibhalame.” <verse eid="JHN 11:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 11:13"/>Bhanganyanjibho pubhaganishiyangaga kuti bhanataya ga gona lugono, mbena ibhatayaga kuwa kwa a Lashalo.<verse eid="JHN 11:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 11:14"/>Bhai, a Yeshu gubhaabhalanjilenje gwangali nng'iyo, “A Lashalo bhashiwa, <verse eid="JHN 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 11:15"/>ikabheje nne ngunakwiinonyela kwa ligongo lyenunji, pabha ngapaaliji kweneko nkupinga nkulupalilanje. Aya twendangananje kubhali.”<verse eid="JHN 11:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 11:16"/>A Tomashi bhashemwaga Bhammba gubhaalugulilenje bhaajiganywa ajabhonji, “Na uwe twendangane, tukawe pamo na bhenebho!”<verse eid="JHN 11:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">A Yeshu ni Gumi na Bhaayuya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 11:17"/>A Yeshu bhakaisheje kweneko gubhaaimene a Lashali bhali nnikabhuli mobha nsheshe. <verse eid="JHN 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 11:18"/>Shilambo sha Bhetania pushaliji tome na ku Yelushalemu, kutaliya kwa maili ibhili nnei. <verse eid="JHN 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 11:19"/>Bhayaudi bhabhagwinji bhashinkuikangana kwa a Malata na a Malia kukwaangalayanga ga wilwa na alumbu bhabhonji.<verse eid="JHN 11:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 11:20"/>Bhai, a Malata bhakapilikaneje kuti a Yeshu bhanakwiya, gubhapite kukwaaposhela, ikabheje a Malia gubhaigele pamui. <verse eid="JHN 11:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 11:21"/>A Malata gubhaabhalanjile a Yeshu, “Mmakulungwa, nkapali apano, apwetu ngubhakawileje! <verse eid="JHN 11:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 11:22"/>Ikabheje nimumanyi shoshowe shishimwaajuje a Nnungu, shibhampe.”<verse eid="JHN 11:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 11:23"/>A Yeshu gubhaalugulile, “Apwenu shibhayushe.” <verse eid="JHN 11:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 11:24"/>A Malata gubhaajangwile, “Nimumanyi shibhayushe lyubha lya mpelo.” <verse eid="JHN 11:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 11:25"/>A Yeshu gubhaabhalanjile, “Nne ni nguyuya na peleshela gumi. Angulupalila nne nkali awe, shalame, <verse eid="JHN 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 11:26"/>na jojowe ali jwankoto ningulupalila, wala akawa. Bhuli nnikulupalila gegano?”<verse eid="JHN 11:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 11:27"/>A Malita gubhaalugulile, “Elo Mmakulungwa! Nne ngulupalile kuti mmwe a Kilishitu, Bhana bhabho a Nnungu, bhene bhakwiya pa shilambolyo.”<verse eid="JHN 11:27"/></para>
  <para style="s">A Yeshu Bhanaguta Minyoi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 11:28"/>Bhakamaliyeje kubheleketa genego, a Malata gubhapite kukwaashema a Malia, apwabho, gubhaabhalanjile kuntemela, “Bhaajiganya bhaishe bhanakunshema.” <verse eid="JHN 11:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 11:29"/>Bhenebho bhakapilikaneje nneyo, shangu gubhajinwishe, gubhaajendele a Yeshu. <verse eid="JHN 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 11:30"/>A Yeshu bhaaliji bhakanabhe jinjila nshijiji, ikabhe pubhaliji pubhaakongene a Malata kukwaaposhela pala. <verse eid="JHN 11:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 11:31"/>Bhai, Bhayaudi bhalinginji pamui pamo na a Malia bhalikwaangalayanga bhakaabhonanjeje bhalijabhula shangu nikopoka palanga, gubhaakagwilenje. Pubhaganishiyenje bhanakwenda guta kulikabhuli.<verse eid="JHN 11:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 11:32"/>Bhai, a Malia bhakaisheje pubhaaliji a Yeshu nikwaabhona, gubhatemi ulungolungo, gubhaabhalanjile, “Mmakulungwa kaliji nkapali apano, nnumbwangu akanawe!” <verse eid="JHN 11:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 11:33"/>A Yeshu bhakaabhoneje bhaniguta, na nkali Bhayaudi bhalinginji pamo na bhenebho bhaligutanga, guyaapoteshe muntima. <verse eid="JHN 11:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 11:34"/>Kungai gubhaabhushiyenje, “Kumwaabhishilenje kwei?” Gubhabhaalanjilenje, “Mmakulungwa, nnjiye kunnole.”<verse eid="JHN 11:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 11:35"/>A Yeshu gubhagutile kwa minyoi. <verse eid="JHN 11:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 11:36"/>Bhai, Bhayaudi gubhashitenje, “Nnolanje shibhaashite kwaapinga!” <verse eid="JHN 11:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 11:37"/>Ikabheje bhananji gubhashitenje, “Bhuli, bhenebha bhannamiye nangalole, bhangakombola kwaatenda a Lashalo bhanawe?”<verse eid="JHN 11:37"/></para>
  <para style="s">A Yeshu Bhanakwaayuya a Lashali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 11:38"/>Bhai, a Yeshu guyaapoteshe kabhili muntima, gubhaishe kulikabhuli. Likabhuli liyene pulyaaliji lishembo, na lyashinkuibhwa na liganga likulungwa. <verse eid="JHN 11:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 11:39"/>A Yeshu gubhashite, “Nshoyanje ligangalyo!” A Malata, alumbubhabho bhawile bhala, gubhaalugulile, “Mmakulungwa, bhananunga, pabha bhatemi mobha nsheshe nnikabhuli!”<verse eid="JHN 11:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 11:40"/>A Yeshu gubhaalugulile, “Bhuli, nangammalanjila kuti nkulupalilangaga shinngubhone ukonjelo gwa a Nnungu?” <verse eid="JHN 11:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 11:41"/>Bhai, gubhashoshiyenje liganga lila. A Yeshu gubhalolile kunani kunnungu, gubhashite, “Ngunatenda eja Atati, pabha nnambilikanishiya. <verse eid="JHN 11:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 11:42"/>Nimumanyi kuti nnambilikanishiya mobha gowe. Ikabheje njibheleketa genego kwa ligongo lya bhandunji bhalinginji apanobha, nkupinga bhakulupalilanje kuti mmwe ni nndumile.” <verse eid="JHN 11:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 11:43"/>Bhakamaliyeje bheleketa genego, gubhashemile kwa lilobhe lya utiya, “A Lashalo! Nkoposhe palanga!” <verse eid="JHN 11:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 11:44"/>Bhawile bhala gubhakopweshe palanga, akuno bhali bhatabhilwe shanda mmakongono na mmakono na kumeyo kuunishilwe. A Yeshu gubhaalugulilenje, “Mwaagopolanje, mwaalekanje bhaijendele.”<verse eid="JHN 11:44"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mpango gwa kwaabhulaga a Yeshu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Matei 26:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:1-2">Maliko 14:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:1-2">Luka 22:1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 11:45"/>Bhai, Bhayaudi bhabhagwinji bhaikengenenje kwa a Malia bhakashibhonanjeje shitendi shibhatendile a Yeshu, gubhaakulupalilenje. <verse eid="JHN 11:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 11:46"/>Ikabheje bhananji gubhapitengenenje kwa Ashimapalishayo kukwabhalanjilanga ga shene shibhatendile a Yeshu shila. <figure style="fig" alt="Priest" file="NT-18 Priest.jpg" size="col" ref="11:47">Bhaabhishila bha Shiyaudi</figure> <verse eid="JHN 11:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 11:47"/>Kwa nneyo bhakulungwanji bhaabhishila na Ashimapalishayo gubhatemingenenje lukumbi, gubhashitenje, “Tutende nndi? Pabha abha bhandubha bhanatenda ilangulo yaigwinji. <verse eid="JHN 11:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 11:48"/>Twaalekaga nnei pei, bhandu bhowe shibhaakulupalilanje, na Bhaloma shibhajiye angabhanyanga liekalu lyetu na shilambo shetu!”<verse eid="JHN 11:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 11:49"/>Penepo bhandu bhamo munkumbi gwabhonji bhashemwaga a Kayapa, bhaliji bhakulungwa bhaabhishila shene shakasho, gubhaalugulilenje, “Mmanganya nkakushimanyanga shindu shoshowe! <verse eid="JHN 11:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 11:50"/>Bhuli, nkaganishiyanga kuti mbaya awe mundu jumo kwa ligongo lya bhandunji, ngalingana angabhanywa shilambo showe?” <verse eid="JHN 11:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 11:51"/>Bhenebho bhangabheleketa nneyo kwaapinga bhayene, ikabhe bhenebho pubhaaliji bhakulungwa bhaabhishila shene shakasho, kwa nneyo bhashinkulondola kuti a Yeshu shibhawe kwa ligongo lya shilambo shabhonji, <verse eid="JHN 11:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 11:52"/>Wala nngabha kwa ligongo lyabhonjipe, ikabhe na kwaabhikanga pamo bhana bha a Nnungu bhapwilingenenje, nkupinga bhabhanganje pamo.<verse eid="JHN 11:52"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 11:53"/>Bhai, kuumila lyene lyubhalyo ashikalongolele bha Bhayaudi gubhaloleyenje shanabhuli pushibhaabhulaganje a Yeshu. <verse eid="JHN 11:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 11:54"/>Kwa nneyo a Yeshu bhangaowa kabhili kulugwinjili lwa Bhayaudi, ikabhe gubhashoshile penepo, gubhapite tome na kuanga, shilambo shishemwa Epulaimu. Kweneko gubhatemi pamo na bhaajiganywa bhabho.<verse eid="JHN 11:54"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 11:55"/>Shikukuu sha Bhayaudi shishemwa Pashaka shashinkubhandishila, bhandunji bhabhagwinji bhashinkwendangananga ku Yelushalemu kukwitakaya shikanabhe ika shikukuujo. <verse eid="JHN 11:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 11:56"/>Bhai, pubhalinginji nkwaaloleya a Yeshu. Bhakaimananjeje pamo nnikanisha, gubhabhuyenenje, “Nkubhonanga bhuli? Igala bhakaika kushikukuu kuno?” <verse eid="JHN 11:56"/><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 11:57"/>Bhakulungwanji bhaabhishila na Ashimapalishayo bhashinkuamulishanga kuti mundu akumanyaga kubhali a Yeshu, abhabhalanjilanje nkupinga bhaakamulanje.<verse eid="JHN 11:57"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JHN 12"/>
  <para style="s">A Yeshu Bhanapakaywa Mauta</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:6-13">Matei 26:6-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:3-9">Maliko 14:3-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 12:1"/>Mobha shita jikanabhe ika Pashaka, a Yeshu gubhaishe ku Bhetania kubhatamaga a Lashalo bhayushiywe bhakaweje bhala. <verse eid="JHN 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 12:2"/>Kweneko bhashinkushemelwa shalya, kwa nneyo a Malata bhatendaga kolokoya shalya. A Lashalo pubhaliji munkumbi gwa bhatemingenenje nkulya pamo na a Yeshu. <verse eid="JHN 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 12:3"/>Bhai, a Malia gubhatolile nushu lita ja mauta ga nunjila ga mmbiya yaigwinji, gubhaapekeye a Yeshu mmakongono nikwaunguta na umbo yabho. Nyumba jowe jikununjilaga mauta. <verse eid="JHN 12:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 12:4"/>Bhai, a Yuda Ishikaliote, bha munkumbi gwa bhaajiganywa bhabho, numbe ni bhapinga kwaatendebhuka a Yeshu, gubhashite, <verse eid="JHN 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 12:5"/>“Kwa nndi mautaga gangaushwa kwa mmbiya dinali mamiya gatatu, nipegwa bhaalaga?” <verse eid="JHN 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 12:6"/>Bhashinkubheleketa nneyo, nngabha kuti bhatendaga kwaabhonelanga shiya bhaalaga, ikabhe pubhaliji bhaagoya mpatila gwa mmbiya, na pabha pubhaliji bhagwii, na bhatendaga jibha mmbiya mumpatila mula.<verse eid="JHN 12:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 12:7"/>Ikabheje a Yeshu gubhashite, “Mwaalekanje bhakongwebha, bhambashe kwa ligongo lya lyubha lya mashiko gangu. <verse eid="JHN 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 12:8"/>Bhaalaga bhapalinji na mmanganya mobha gowe, ikabheje nkabhanganga na nne mobha gowe.”<verse eid="JHN 12:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mpango gwa Kwaabhulaga a Lashalo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 12:9"/>Bhayaudi bhabhagwinji gubhapilikenenje kuti a Yeshu kubhali ku Bhetania. Bhai gubhapitengenenje kweneko, nngabha ga kwaabhona a Yeshupe ikabhe bhaabhonanje a Lashalo bhayushiywe na a Yeshu. <verse eid="JHN 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 12:10"/>Bhakulungwanji bhaabhishila gubhalegenenje kwaabhulaga a Lashalo nneyo peyo, <verse eid="JHN 12:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 12:11"/>pabha kwa ligongo lya a Lashalo, Bhayaudi bhabhagwinji bhashinkwaalekanga ashikalongolele bhabhonji, nikwaakulupalila a Yeshu.<verse eid="JHN 12:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kuangalilwa kwa a Yeshu Bhalijinjila ku Yelushalemu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Matei 21:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Maliko 11:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Luka 19:28-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 12:12"/>Malabhi gakwe, likundi likulungwa lya bhandunji bhaikengenenje kushikukuu, gubhapilikenenje kuti a Yeshu mubhali mumpanda kwiya ku Yelushalemu. <verse eid="JHN 12:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 12:13"/>Bhai, gubhatemilenje maagala ga mitende, gubhapite kwaaposhelanga bhalijobhelanga, bhalinkutinji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:13">“Bhainiywe a Nnungu! Na bhene bhakwiya kwa lina lya Bhakulungwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:13">Bhapegwe mboka bhakulungwa bha Ishilaeli.”<verse eid="JHN 12:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 12:14"/>A Yeshu gubhantolile mwana jwa mbunda jumo gubhatemi pantundu jakwe, malinga shigataya Majandiko ga Ukonjelo,<verse eid="JHN 12:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 12:15"/>“Unajogope shilambo sha Shayuni!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:15">Nnole, a Mpalume bhenu bhanakwiya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:15">Bhashikwela mwana jwa mbunda!”<verse eid="JHN 12:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 12:16"/>Gene malangago bhaajiganywa bhabho bhakagamanyangaga gatendekagago, ikabheje a Yeshu bhakaweje na yuka, penepo gubhakumbushilenje kuti bhashinkujandishilwa genego, na bhandunji gubhaatendelenje nneyo peyo.<verse eid="JHN 12:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 12:17"/>Likundi lya bhandunji bhapalinji pamo na a Yeshu lyubha libhaayushiye a Lashalo, gubhapundilenje kwaakong'ondela. <verse eid="JHN 12:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 12:18"/>Kwa nneyo lugwinjili lwa bhandunji lula gubhaaposhelenje, pabha bhowe bhapilikenenje kuti a Yeshu bhashitenda shene shilangulosho. <verse eid="JHN 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 12:19"/>Bhai, Ashimapalishayo gubhabhalanjilenenje, “Nnilolanga? Tukakombola tenda shoshowe! Nnolanje bhandu bhowe bhanakwaakagulanga.”<verse eid="JHN 12:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Bhagiliki Bhanapinganga Kwaabhona a Yeshu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 12:20"/>Munkumbi gwa bhandunji bhaikengenenje ku Yelushalemu kukwaatindibhalila a Nnungu kushikukuusho, bhashinkupagwanga na Bhagiliki. <verse eid="JHN 12:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 12:21"/>Bhanganyabho gubhaajendelenje a Pilipi, bha ku Bhetishaida ja ku Galilaya, gubhashitenje, “Mmakulungwa, tunapinga kwaabhona a Yeshu.”<verse eid="JHN 12:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 12:22"/>Bhai, a Pilipi gubhapite kwabhalanjila a Ndeleya, kungai bhowe bhaanabhili gubhapite kwaabhalanjilanga a Yeshu. <verse eid="JHN 12:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 12:23"/>A Yeshu gubhaajangwilenje, “Malanga ga kuywa Mwana juka Mundu gaishe! <verse eid="JHN 12:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 12:24"/>Kweli ngunakummalanjilanga, mmbeju ja ngano jikakulilwe nnitaka niwa shijilepeshe nneyo peyo. Ikabheje jibholaga, bhai shijimele niogola iyepo yaigwinji. <verse eid="JHN 12:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 12:25"/>Mundu aabhushila gumi gwakwe shaguobhye, ikabheje mundu akaabhushila gumi gwakwe pa shilambolyo pano, anakuugoya mpaka pata gumi gwa pitipiti. <verse eid="JHN 12:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 12:26"/>Mundu angamulila maengo, anapinjikwa angagule, popowe pushimme nne pala, ni pushaabhe ntumishi jwangu. Mundu jojowe angamulila maengo, Atati shibhanng'ishimiye.<verse eid="JHN 12:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">A Yeshu Bhanabheleketa ga Shiwo Shabho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 12:27"/>“Nnaino ntima gwangu gunamboteka, kanga melekete nndi? ‘Atati nndapule na gene malangaga?’ Ikabheje genega ni gung'ishile nkupinga mbitile gene malanga gano. <verse eid="JHN 12:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 12:28"/>Atati, nnikuye lina lyenu.” Penepo lilobhe kukoposhela kunnungu gulipilikanishe lilinkuti, “Nilikushiye na kabhili shinilikuye.”<verse eid="JHN 12:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 12:29"/>Lugwinjili lwa bhandunji bhajimingenenje penepo gubhapilikenenje lilobhelyo, gubhashitenje kuti jishibhalula nnjai, ikabhe bhananji gubhashitenje kuti, “Bhashikunguluka naka Malaika jwa a Nnungu!”<verse eid="JHN 12:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 12:30"/>Ikabheje a Yeshu gubhaalugulilenje, “Lyene lilobhelyo lyangakoposhela kwa ligongo lyangu nne, ikabhe kwa ligongo lyenu mmanganyanji. <verse eid="JHN 12:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 12:31"/>Nnaino gaishe malanga ga ukumulwa shilambolyo, na nkulungwa jwa pashilambolyo pano apinga nokolelwa palanga. <verse eid="JHN 12:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 12:32"/>Na nne pushinyinulwe kunani shilambo shinautilanje bhandu bhowe kwangu nne.” <verse eid="JHN 12:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 12:33"/>Kwa gene malobhego bhashinkulanguya shiwo shabho pushipingabha.<verse eid="JHN 12:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 12:34"/>Bhai, lugwinjili lwa bhandunji bhala gubhaajangwilenje, “Uwe shalia jetu jinakutubhalanjila kuti a Kilishitu shibhatame pitipiti. Bhai nkubheleketa bhuli, kuti Mwana juka Mundu anapinjikwa kujinulwa? Mwana juka Mundujo ni gani?”<verse eid="JHN 12:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 12:35"/>A Yeshu gubhaalugulilenje, “Shilangaya shatangu na mmanganyanji kwa mobha gashoko. Nndekoninji pabha nkwetenje shilangayasho nkupinga lubhindu lunanng'imananje, pabha aowa nnubhindu akakukumanya kwaaloya. <verse eid="JHN 12:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 12:36"/>Bhai mobha gunkwetenje shene shilangayasho, nshikulupalalilanje nkupinga mmanganje mmandunji bha shilangaya.” A Yeshu bhakamaliyeje kubheleketa genego, gubhapite kwiiya kwatalika bhanaabhonanje.<verse eid="JHN 12:36"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ungakulupalila gwa Bhayaudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 12:37"/>Nkali a Yeshu bhatendile yene ilangulo yoweyo pameyo gabhonji, bhangaakulupalilanga. <verse eid="JHN 12:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 12:38"/>Nkupinga gatimilile malobhe ga ankulondola bha a Nnungu a Ishaya kuti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:38">“Mmakulungwa, gani akulupalile ntenga gwetu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:38">Na mashili ga Bhakulungwa kugamanyishe kuka gani?”<verse eid="JHN 12:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 12:39"/>Pabha bhangakulupalilanga, a Ishaya bhabhelekete kabhili, Bhakulungwa bhakuti,<verse eid="JHN 12:39"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 12:40"/>“Bhashikukupila meyo gabhonji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:40">Bhashinonopya mitima jabhonji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:40">Bhanalolanje kwa mmeyo gabhonji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:40">Bhanamumanyanje mmitima jabhonji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:40">wala bhanandendebhushilanje,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:40">Na nne ngaalamiyenje.”<verse eid="JHN 12:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 12:41"/>A Ishaya bhashinkubheleketa gene malobhega pabha bhashinkuubhona ukonjelo gwa a Yeshu, gubhatashiye ngani jabho.<verse eid="JHN 12:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 12:42"/>Nkali nneyo ashikalongolele bhabhagwinji bha Bhayaudi gubhaakulupalilenje a Yeshu. Ikabheje kwa ligongo lya Ashimapalishayo, bhangaibhoneyanga palugwinjili nkujogopa bhanaakanwanga nshinagogi. <verse eid="JHN 12:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 12:43"/>Pabha kubhapingangaga kuiniywa na bhandunji kupunda kuiniywa na a Nnungu.<verse eid="JHN 12:43"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ukumu ga Nngakunda Malobhe ga a Yeshu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 12:44"/>A Yeshu gubhabhelekete kwa lilobhe lya utiya, “Mundu angulupalila nne, akaangulupalila nnepe, ikabhe anakwaakulupalila bhandumile bhala. <verse eid="JHN 12:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 12:45"/>Aamona nne anakwaabhona bhandumile bhala. <verse eid="JHN 12:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 12:46"/>Nne shilangaya, numbe njiika pashilambolyo nkupinga bhowe bhaangulupalilanga bhanatamangane nnubhindu. <verse eid="JHN 12:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 12:47"/>Mundu apilikana malobhe gangu na anagakamule, nne nganng'ukumula, pabha nangaika kuukumula shilambolyo ikabhe kukushitapula. <verse eid="JHN 12:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 12:48"/>Akakamula malobhe gangu akwete jwa kunng'ukumula, lilobhe limeleketelyo, shiling'ukumule lyubha lya mpelo. <verse eid="JHN 12:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 12:49"/>Nne nangabheleketa kwa mashili gangu namwene, ikabhe Atati bhandumile bhala, bhashinajila ya bheleketa na jiganya. <verse eid="JHN 12:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 12:50"/>Numbe nne nimumanyi kuti amuli yabho inapeleshela gumi gwa pitipiti. Bhai nne gungubheleketa, gubhanajile Atati melekete.”<verse eid="JHN 12:50"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JHN 13"/>
  <para style="s">A Yeshu Bhanakwaanabhiyanga Makongono Bhaajiganywa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 13:1"/>Bhai shikukuu sha Pashaka shikanabhe, a Yeshu bhamumanyi kuti malanga gabho ga jabhula pa shilambolyo kwenda kwa Atati gaishe. Bhashinkwaapinganga bhandu bhabho pa shilambolyo, numbe, bhashikwaapinganga mpaka kumpelo!<verse eid="JHN 13:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 13:2"/>Lishetani ali abhatajile a Yuda, bhana bhabho a Shimoni Ishikaliote, ntima gwa kwaatendebhuka a Yeshu, gubhatemingenenje nkulalila a Yeshu na bhaajiganywa bhabho. <verse eid="JHN 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 13:3"/>A Yeshu bhali bhamumanyi kuti bhashikamuywa indu yowe na Atati, numbe kubhakoposhele kwa a Nnungu na bhanabhuja kwenda kwa a Nnungu. <verse eid="JHN 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 13:4"/>Bhai gubhashoshile pa shalya, gubhabhishile likoti lyabho panyenje, gubhatolile litaulo, nikwiitabha nshigunu. <verse eid="JHN 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 13:5"/>Kungai gubhatajile mashi nshibhiga, gubhatandwibhe kwaanabhiyanga makongono bhaajiganywa bhabho nikwaungutanga na litaulo libhaitabhile nshigunu lila. <verse eid="JHN 13:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 13:6"/>Bhai gubhaaishile a Shimoni Petili, bhenebho gubhaalugulile a Yeshu, “Mmakulungwa, mmwe nnaanabhiya mmakongono nne?”<verse eid="JHN 13:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 13:7"/>A Yeshu gubhajangwile, “Mmwe nnaino nkakushimanya shingutenda ikabheje shinshimanye kungai.”<verse eid="JHN 13:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 13:8"/>A Petili gubhaabhalanjile, “Mmwe, wala nkanabhiya nne!” A Yeshu gubhaajangwile, “Monaga ngannabhiye, mwangali shilongani na nne.”<verse eid="JHN 13:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 13:9"/>A Shimoni Petili gubhaajangwile, “Mmakulungwa, nnabhiye nngabha makongonope, ikabhe na makono gangu nneila peila na ntwe gwangu.”<verse eid="JHN 13:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 13:10"/>A Yeshu gubhaabhalanjile, “Ajojile shiilu showe akapinjikwa kujoga kabhili, ikabhe kunabha makongonope, pabha shiilu showe shikonjile. Mmanganyanji nkonjilenje ikabhe nngabha mmowe.” <verse eid="JHN 13:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 13:11"/>A Yeshu bhashinkubheleketa “Nngabha mmowe nkonjilenje.” Pabha bhammanyi gani shabhatendebhushe.<verse eid="JHN 13:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 13:12"/>A Yeshu bhakamaliyeje kwaanabhiyanga makongono, gubhawete likoti lyabho gubhatemi kabhili, nikwaabhuyanga, “Bhuli, nngamanyinji gunintendelenjega? <verse eid="JHN 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 13:13"/>Mmanganyanji punkunjemanga Mmaajiganya na Mmakulungwa, nnibheleketanga ukoto, pabha nne puni nneyo. <verse eid="JHN 13:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 13:14"/>Bhai ibhaga nne nili Nankulungwa na Nkujiganya njikunnabhiyanga makongono, nneyo peyo na mmanganyanji nnapinjikwanga kunabhiyana makongono. <verse eid="JHN 13:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 13:15"/>Kwa nneyo njikunnanguyanga ipinjikwa, nkupinga ntendelananje nneyo malinga shinintendelenje nne. <verse eid="JHN 13:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 13:16"/>Kweli ngunakummalanjilanga, ntumwa nngabha jwankulungwa kupunda bhakulungwa bhakwe, na wala ntume nngabha nkulungwa kupunda bhantumile. <verse eid="JHN 13:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 13:17"/>Nngamanyangaga genego, shiibhe shammbone ntendangaga nneyo.<verse eid="JHN 13:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 13:18"/>“Ngaataya ga mmowe mmwe, pabha naamanyinji bhunaagwilenje. Ikabheje nkupinga gatimilile Majandiko gataya. ‘Aalile shalya shangu ashindundumalila.’ <verse eid="JHN 13:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 13:19"/>Ngunakummalanjilanga genega gakanabhe koposhela, nkupinga pushigakoposhele nkulupalilanje kuti ‘Nne ni Nne.’ <verse eid="JHN 13:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 13:20"/>Kweli ngunakummalanjilanga. Akumposhela mundu jojowe junintumile, anaamboshela nne, na amboshela nne, anakwaaposhela bhandumile bhala.”<verse eid="JHN 13:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">A Yeshu Bhanataya Kuti Bhapinga Tendebhukwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:20-25">Matei 26:20-25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:17-21">Maliko 14:17-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:21-23">Luka 22:21-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 13:21"/>A Yeshu bhakamaliyeje bheleketa genego, gubhatengwishe muntima kwa kaje, gubhakong'ondele bhalinkuti, “Kweli ngunakummalanjilanga, jumo munkumbi gwenunji apinga ndendebhuka!” <verse eid="JHN 13:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 13:22"/>Bhaajiganywa gubhalolenenje akuno bhalinginji na lipamba gani jubhakuntaya. <verse eid="JHN 13:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 13:23"/>Jumo jwa bhaajiganywa, apingwaga kaje na a Yeshu, ashinkutama tome na a Yeshu. <verse eid="JHN 13:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 13:24"/>Bhai, a Shimoni Petili gubhannangwile nkono bhalinkuti, “Mwaabhuye gani jubhakuntaya?”<verse eid="JHN 13:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 13:25"/>Bhai jwenejo gwabhatendebhushile a Yeshu nikwaabhuya, “Mmakulungwa, gani?”<verse eid="JHN 13:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 13:26"/>A Yeshu gubhajangwile, “Jwene, jushinimpambile ndonji nikumpajo.” Gubhagabhile ndonji, nipamba, gubhaapele a Yuda, bhana bhabho a Shimoni Ishikaliote. <verse eid="JHN 13:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 13:27"/>A Yuda bhakaposheleje ndonji jila, Lishetani gwabhajinjile. Bhai a Yeshu gubhaalugulile, “Shintumbilile tendasho, ntende shangu!” <verse eid="JHN 13:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 13:28"/>Wala jwakwa mundu munkumbi gwa bhatemingenenje pa shalya pala amumanyi kwa nndi bhashikwaabhalanjila nneyo. <verse eid="JHN 13:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 13:29"/>Pabha a Yuda pubhaaliji bhaagoya mpatila gwa mmbiya yabhonji, bhananji gubhaganishiyenje kuti a Yeshu bhashikwabhaalanjila bhakaume ipinjikwa nshikukuu, eu kuti bhashikwaabhalanjila bhaakapanganje bhaalaga indu.<verse eid="JHN 13:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 13:30"/>Bhai, a Yuda bhakaposheleje ndonji jila, shangu gubhakopweshe palanga. Na puyaliji shilo.<verse eid="JHN 13:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Amuli ja Ambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 13:31"/>A Yuda bhakajabhuleje, a Yeshu gubhashite, “Nnaino akuywe Mwana juka Mundu, numbe a Nnungu bhashikuywa nkati jakwe. <verse eid="JHN 13:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 13:32"/>Na ibhaga a Nnungu bhakushiywe nkati ja Bhana bhabho, numbe a Nnungu shangupe, shibhankuye Mwana nkati jabho.<verse eid="JHN 13:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 13:33"/>“Mmanganya ashibhanangu, shindame na mmanganyanji kwa malanga gashokope. Shinnoleyanje, ikabheje nnaino ngunakummalanjilanga malinga shinaabhalanjilenje Bhayaudi kuti, ‘Kungwenda mmanganyanji nkakombolanga kuika!’ <verse eid="JHN 13:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 13:34"/>Ngunakumpanganga amuli ja ambi, Mpingane, malinga shinimpinjilenje mmanganyanji. <verse eid="JHN 13:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 13:35"/>Mpinganaga, bhandu bhowe shibhamanyanje kuti mmanganya bhaajiganywa bhangu.”<verse eid="JHN 13:35"/></para>
  <para style="s">A Yeshu Bhanaabhalanga Kuti a Petili Shibhaakane</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Matei 26:31-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Maliko 14:27-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Luka 22:31-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 13:36"/>A Shimoni Petili gubhaabhushiye, “Mmakulungwa, kunkwenda kwei?” A Yeshu gubhajangwile, “Kungwenda nkakombola kungagula nnaino, ikabheje kungai shinngagule.”<verse eid="JHN 13:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 13:37"/>A Petili gubhaalugulile, “Mmakulungwa, kwa nndi ngunakombole kunkagula nnaino? Nne shing'engwe nkali kuwa kwa ligongo lyenu mmwe.”<verse eid="JHN 13:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 13:38"/>A Yeshu gubhaajangwile, “Bhuli! Kweli mmwe shinng'engwe kuwa kwa ligongo lyangu nne? Kweli ngunakunnugulila, lipongo akanabhe kongobhela shinngane patatu!”<verse eid="JHN 13:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JHN 14"/>
  <para style="s">A Yeshu Mpanda gwa Kwenda kwa Atati</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 14:1"/>A Yeshu gubhaalugulilenje, “Nnatengukanje mmitima jenunji. Nnakwaakulupalilanga a Nnungu, nngulupalilanje na nne. <verse eid="JHN 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 14:2"/>Kumui kwa Atati ipali ndamo yaigwinji, monaga nngabha nneyo, ngammalanjilenje. Nnaino ngunakwenda kukunnng'alashiyanga ndamo. <verse eid="JHN 14:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 14:3"/>Nyendaga kung'alashiyanga ndamo, shimuje kukuntolanga, nkupinga pushimme nne, na mmanganyanji mmanganje popo. <verse eid="JHN 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 14:4"/>Mmanganyanji nngumanyinji mpanda gwa kungwendako.”<verse eid="JHN 14:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 14:5"/>A Tomashi gubhabhushiye, “Mmakulungwa, tukakukumanya kunkwenda, bhai, tugumanye bhuli mpandago?” <verse eid="JHN 14:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 14:6"/>A Yeshu gubhaajangwile, “Nne ni mpanda na kweli na gumi. Jwakwa akombola kwenda kwa Atati ikabhe kupitila nne. <verse eid="JHN 14:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 14:7"/>Ibhaga nkamanyinji nne, nkaamanyinji Atati. Kuumila nnaino, mwaamanyinji, numbe mwaabhweninji.”<verse eid="JHN 14:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 14:8"/>A Pilipi gubhaalugulile, “Mmakulungwa, shiitupwae, ntulanguye Atati.” <verse eid="JHN 14:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 14:9"/>A Yeshu gubhaalugulilenje, “Mobha gowega ndemi na mmanganyanji, igala mmwe a Pilipi nkanabhemanya? Amweni nne abhabhweni Atati. Nkubheleketa bhuli, ‘Ntulanguye Atati?’ <verse eid="JHN 14:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 14:10"/>Bhuli nkaakulupalila kuti nne muni nkati ja Atati, nabhalabho Atati mubhali nkati jangu? Malobhe gungummalanjilangaga, ngaabheleketa kwa mashili gangu namwene, ikabhe Atati bhali nkati jangu, ni bhaatenda liengo lyabho. <verse eid="JHN 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 14:11"/>Nngulupalilanje kuti nne muni nkati ja Atati, na Atati mubhali nkati jangu, ibhaga ng'oo, nkulupalilanje kwa ligongo lya maengo gungutendaga. <verse eid="JHN 14:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 14:12"/>Kweli ngunakummalanjilanga, jwene angulupalila nne, na jwalakwe shaatende maengo gungukamula nne, nkali na gamakulungwa kupunda genega, pabha nne ngunakwenda kwa Atati. <verse eid="JHN 14:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 14:13"/>Shoshowe shishinnjuganje kwa lina lyangu, shenesho shindende, nkupinga Atati bhakuywe nkati jika Mwana. <verse eid="JHN 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 14:14"/>Nnyugangaga shoshowe kwa lina lyangu, shinintendelanje.”<verse eid="JHN 14:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">A Yeshu Bhanaalajila ga Mbumu jwa Ukonjelo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 14:15"/>“Mmbingangaga, shinkamulanje amuli yangu. <verse eid="JHN 14:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 14:16"/>Na nne shinaajuje Atati bhampanganje jwakunjangutilanga juna, nkupinga atame na mmanganyanji pitipiti. <verse eid="JHN 14:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 14:17"/>Jwenejo Mbumu jwa kweli. Shilambolyo nngakombola kumposhela, pabha shikakombola kummona wala kummanya. Ikabheje mmanganyanji mummanyinji pabha anaatama na mmanganyanji, na shaabhe nkati jenunji.”<verse eid="JHN 14:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 14:18"/>“Ngannekanga ushubha, shininjiilanje. <verse eid="JHN 14:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 14:19"/>Gaigele mobha gashoko, shilambolyo shikamona kabhili, ikabheje mmanganyanji shimmonanje, pabha nne najwankoto na nkali mmanganyanji shimmanganje mmabhakotonji. <verse eid="JHN 14:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 14:20"/>Pushiliishile lyene lyubhalyo, shimmanyanje kuti nne muni nkati ja Atati, na mmanganyanji munninginji nkati jangu, na nne nkati jenunji.”<verse eid="JHN 14:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 14:21"/>“Akwiiposhela amuli yangu nikwiikamula, jwenejo ni ambinga nne. Na jwalakwe ambinga nne, shaabhapinje Atati, na nne shinimpinje na shiniilanguye kuka jwene.”<verse eid="JHN 14:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 14:22"/>A Yuda, nngabha a Ishikaliote bhala, gubhaabhushiye, “Mmakulungwa, shiitendeshe bhuli mmwe kwiilanguya kwetu uwe na nngabha ku shilambolyo?”<verse eid="JHN 14:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 14:23"/>A Yeshu gubhajangwile, “Mundu ambingaga shakamule malobhe gangu, Atati shibhampinje na uwe shituishe, nitama najo. <verse eid="JHN 14:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 14:24"/>Mundu akaambinga nne akakamula malobhe gangu. Lilobhe limpilikenenje nngabha lyangu nne, ikabhe lya Atati bhandumile.<verse eid="JHN 14:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 14:25"/>“Nimmalanjilenje genego, shini launo na mmanganyanji shino, <verse eid="JHN 14:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 14:26"/>ikabheje Nkujangutila jula, Mbumu jwa Ukonjelo, shibhantume Atati kwa lina lyangu, shannjiganyanje indu yowe na kunkumbushiyanga gowe gunimmalanjilenje.”<verse eid="JHN 14:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 14:27"/>“Ngunakunneshelanga ulele, ngunakumpanganga ulele gwangu. Ngakumpanganga malinga shilambolyo shishikuti tenda. Nnainginikanje mmitima jenunji wala nnatengukanje. <verse eid="JHN 14:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 14:28"/>Mwapilikenenje punammalanjilenje. ‘Ngunakwijendela, kungai shinimmujilanje kabhili.’ Nkambinjilenje, nkainonyelenje kwa ligongo ngunakwenda kwa Atati, pabha bhenebho bhakulungwa kumbunda nne. <verse eid="JHN 14:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 14:29"/>Njikummalanjilanga genega nnaino gakanabhe koposhela, nkupinga pushigakoposhelepo nkulupalilanje. <verse eid="JHN 14:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 14:30"/>Ngabheleketa kabhili malobhe gamagwinji na mmanganyanji, pabha nkulungwa jwa shilambolyoshi anakwiya. Wala jwangali sha kombola kwangu nne, <verse eid="JHN 14:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 14:31"/>ikabheje shilambolyo shinapinjikwa shimanye kuti nne ngunakwaapinga Atati, pabha ngunatenda indu yowe malinga shibhang'amulishe Atati. Nnjimangane, tujabhule apano!”<verse eid="JHN 14:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JHN 15"/>
  <para style="s">A Yeshu Nshabhibhu gwa Kweli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 15:1"/>A Yeshu gubhapundile kubheleketa, “Nne nshabhibhu gwa kweli, bhaalima ni Atati. <verse eid="JHN 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 15:2"/>Lujambi lolowe luli nkati jangu lukaogoye iyepo, lunashelwa nishoywa, na lolowe luogola, lunaunilwa ntonga lukonje lupunde ogola. <verse eid="JHN 15:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 15:3"/>Mmanganyanji nkonjilenje kwa ligongo lya ntenga gunimmalanjilenje gula. <verse eid="JHN 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 15:4"/>Ntamangane nkati jangu, na nne nkati jenunji. Na malinga lujambi pulukaogoya iyepo jikape, lukabhe munshabhibhu, nneyo peyo na mmanganyanji nngakombola kuogoya iyepo nkatamangane nkati jangu.”<verse eid="JHN 15:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 15:5"/>“Nne nshabhibhu, mmanganyanji nyambi. Atama nkati jangu, na nne ndamaga nkati jakwe, jwenejo shaogoye iyepo yaigwinji, pabha gwangali nne nkakombolanga tenda shoshowe. <verse eid="JHN 15:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 15:6"/>Mundu jojowe akatame nkati jangu, analeshelwa palanga malinga lujambi pululeshelwa palanga ni jumula. Nilokotwa na bhandunji nileshelwa pamoto lutinishe. <verse eid="JHN 15:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 15:7"/>Ntamanganaga nkati jangu, na malobhe gangu gatamaga nkati jenunji, bhai, nnjuganje shoshowe shinkupinganga na mmanganya shimpegwanje. <verse eid="JHN 15:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 15:8"/>Shimmanganje bhaajiganywa bhangu, niogoya iepo yaigwinji na kwa nneyo Atati shibhakuywe. <verse eid="JHN 15:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 15:9"/>Nne ngunakumpinganga mmanganyanji malinga Atati shibhambinga nne. Ntamangane nkupingana na nne. <verse eid="JHN 15:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 15:10"/>Nkamulangaga amuli yangu, shintamangane nkupingana na nne, malinga nne shingamwile amuli ya Atati na tama nkupingana kwabho. <verse eid="JHN 15:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 15:11"/>Njikummalanjilanga genego nkupinga angalala kwangu kutame nilonjeya nkati jenunji, na angalala kwenunji kutimilile. <verse eid="JHN 15:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 15:12"/>Amuli jangu ni ajino, mpingane, malinga shinimpinjilenje nne. <verse eid="JHN 15:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 15:13"/>Kwakwa kupinga kupundile, kwa mundu kwiishoya gumi gwake kwa ligongo lya ashaambwiga ajakwe. <verse eid="JHN 15:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 15:14"/>Mmanganyanji ashaambwiga ajangu ntendangaga gungung'amulishanga. <verse eid="JHN 15:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 15:15"/>Nganshemanga kabhili bhatumishi, pabha ntumishi akakushimanya shibhaatenda bhakulungwa bhakwe. Ikabheje mmanganyanji njikunshemanga ashaambwiga, pabha ninng'ibhulilenje gowe gumbilikene kwa Atati. <verse eid="JHN 15:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 15:16"/>Nngabha mmanganyanji nng'agwilenje nne, ikabhe nne ning'agwilenje mmanganyanji nikuntumanga nnjendangane nkaogoyanje iepo na iepo yenunji ilonjeye, na bhalabho Atati bhampanganje shoshowe shinkwaajuganga kwa lina lyangu. <verse eid="JHN 15:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 15:17"/>Bhai, amuli jangu jingumpanganga ni ajino, mpingane.”<verse eid="JHN 15:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Shilambolyo Shikakwaapinga a Yeshu na Bhaajiganywa Bbhabho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 15:18"/>A Yeshu gubhashite, “Ibhaga shilambolyo shinshimangaga mmanganyanji, nkumbushilanje kuti, shinjimile nne shikanabhe kunshimanga mmanganyanji. <verse eid="JHN 15:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 15:19"/>Ibhaga nkalinginji bhandu bha shilambolyo, shilambolyo shikampinjilenje pabha bhandunji bhakwe. Ikabheje pabha mmanganyanji nngabha bha pa shilambolyo, ikabhe nne njikunng'agulanga kopoka kushilambolyo, kwa lyene ligongolyo shilambolyo shinakunshimanga. <verse eid="JHN 15:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 15:20"/>Nkumbushilanje gunimmalanjilenje, ntumwa nngabha jwankulungwa kupunda bhakulungwa bhakwe. Ibhaga bhashimbotekanga nne, shibhampotekanje na mmanganyanji, monaga bhakamulenje lilobhe lyangu, nneila peila shibhakamulanje na lilobhe lyenunji. <verse eid="JHN 15:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 15:21"/>Ikabheje genego gowe shibhantendelanje kwa ligongo lya lina lyangu, pabha bhakakwamanyanga bhandumile bhala. <verse eid="JHN 15:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 15:22"/>Monaga ngungaisheje nibheleketa nabhonji, bhakanakolanje yambi, ikabheje nnaino bhakakombolanga kwiembuya kuti bhangalinginji yambi. <verse eid="JHN 15:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 15:23"/>Anjima nne, anakwaashima na Atati. <verse eid="JHN 15:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 15:24"/>Monaga ngalepele tenda indu ikanabhe tendwa naka mundu juna ngubhakakwetenjeje yambi, ikabheje nnaino bhagabhweninji gundendile, na gubhanjimilenje nne na Atati. <verse eid="JHN 15:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 15:25"/>Ikabheje gatimilile malobhe ga shalia yabhonji, ‘Bhashinjimanga nne gwayoyo!’<verse eid="JHN 15:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 15:26"/>“Ikabheje pashaishe nkujangutajo, jushinintume kungwenunji kopoka kwa Atati, Mbumu jwa kweli, jwenejo shangong'ondele nne. <verse eid="JHN 15:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 15:27"/>Na mmanganyanji shinngong'ondelanje, pabha nshibhanganga na nne kuumila kundandubho.”<verse eid="JHN 15:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JHN 16"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 16:1"/>“Njikummalanjilanga genego nkupinga nnalekanje ngulupai jenunji. <verse eid="JHN 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 16:2"/>Bhandunji shibhankananje nnyumba yabhonji ya jujila Nnungu. Numbe ganakwiya mobha, kila mundu shammulaganje mmanganyanji, shaganishiye kuti anaashoya mbepei kwa a Nnungu. <verse eid="JHN 16:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 16:3"/>Shibhantendelanje genego kwa ligongo lya nngaamanya Atati, wala nne. <verse eid="JHN 16:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 16:4"/>Ikabheje njikummalanjilanga genego, nkupinga pushigaishe malanga gakwe, nkumbushilanje kuti nammalanjilenje.”</para>
  <para style="s" vid="JHN 16:4">Maengo Gaka Mbumu jwa Ukonjelo</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 16:4">“Nangammalanjilanga yene indui kuumila bhukala, pabha naliji pamo na mmanganyanji. <verse eid="JHN 16:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 16:5"/>Ikabheje nnaino ngunakwenda ku bhandumile bhala, wala jwakwa nkali jumo munkumbi gwenunji amuya, ‘Nkwenda kwei?’ <verse eid="JHN 16:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 16:6"/>Pabha njikummalanjilanga genego, nshiinjikanga mmitima jenunji. <verse eid="JHN 16:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 16:7"/>Ikabheje, kweli ngunakummalanjilanga, mbaya nne nyabhule, pabha ngajabhule Nkujanguta jula, akanjiilanga. Ikabheje, nyendaga, bhai shinintume kungwenunji. <verse eid="JHN 16:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 16:8"/>Jwenejo aikaga, shabhakong'ondelanje bhandu pa shilambolyo, ga yambi na aki na ukumu ja a Nnungu. <verse eid="JHN 16:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 16:9"/>Kwa ngani ja yambi yenunji shabhakong'ondelanje, pabha bhangangulupalilanga nne, <verse eid="JHN 16:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 16:10"/>kwa ngani ja aki shabhakong'ondelanje kuti nne ngwete aki, pabha ngunakwiijendela kwa Atati, wala nkamonanga kabhili, <verse eid="JHN 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 16:11"/>na kwa ngani ja ukumu, shabhakong'ondelanje kuti nkulungwa jwa pashilambolyo pano aukumwilwe.<verse eid="JHN 16:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 16:12"/>“Njikola gamagwinji ga kummalanjilanga, ikabheje nnaino shintopelwanje. <verse eid="JHN 16:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 16:13"/>Ikabheje pushaishe Mbumu jwa kweli, jwenejo shannongoyanje nkweli jowe, pabha akabheleketa kwa mashili gakwe nnyene, ikabhe shabhelekete gapilikene na kunnugulilanga gapinga koposhela. <verse eid="JHN 16:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 16:14"/>Jwenejo shanguye nne pabha shantashiyanje gapatile kwangu nne gala. <verse eid="JHN 16:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 16:15"/>Yowe ibhakwete Atati ni yangu, kwa nneyo nashinkubheleketa kuti, Mbumujo shantashiyanje gashaapate kwangu nne.<verse eid="JHN 16:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kuinjika Shikubhe Kuangalala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 16:16"/>“Galepeshe mobha gashoko, mmanganyanji nkamonanga na gapitaga mobha gashoko, shimmonanje kabhili!” <verse eid="JHN 16:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 16:17"/>Penepo bhaajiganywa bhabho bhananji gubhabhuyenenje, “Bhakwete malombolelo gashi pubhabheleketa, ‘Galepeshe mobha gashoko mmanganyanji nkamonanga, na gapitaga mobha gashoko shimmonanje kabhili?’ Kabhili bhakuti. ‘Pabha ngunakwenda kwa Atati!’ ” <verse eid="JHN 16:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 16:18"/>Bhai, gubhalinginji nkubhuyana, “Bhakwete malombolelo gashi kubheleketa, ‘Galepeshe mobha gashoko?’ Tukakushimanya shibhaabheleketa.”<verse eid="JHN 16:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 16:19"/>A Yeshu gubhamumanyi kuti bhanapinganga kwaabhuya, bhai gubhaalugulilenje, “Bhuli, nnabhuyananga gumelekete gakuti, ‘Galepeshe mobha gashoko mmanganyanji nkamonanga, na gapitaga mobha gashoko shimmonanje kabhili?’ <verse eid="JHN 16:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 16:20"/>Kweli ngunakummalanjilanga, mmanganyanji shinngutanje shililo, ikabheje shilambolyo shishiinonyele, shinng'injikanje, ikabheje kuinjika kwenunji shikutendebhushe kubha kwiinonyela. <verse eid="JHN 16:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 16:21"/>Bhakongwe bhalipinga kola, bhanapata mboteko pabha malanga ga kola gaishile, ikabheje bhakolaga, bhakakumbushila kabhili mboteko, kwa ligongo lya kwiinonyela kubhelekwa kwa mundu pa shilambolyo. <verse eid="JHN 16:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 16:22"/>Bhai, mmanganyanji nshiinjikanga nnaino, ikabheje shininjiilanje kabhili, numbe shimwinonyelanje mmitima jenunji, na kwene kwinonyelako jwakwa shampokonyolanje.”<verse eid="JHN 16:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 16:23"/>“Lyene lyubhalyo nkamuyanga shoshowe. Kweli ngunakummalanjilanga, shoshowe shishimwaajuganje Atati kwa lina lyangu, shibhampanganje. <verse eid="JHN 16:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 16:24"/>Mpaka nnaino nkanabhejuganga shindu kwa lina lyangu. Nnjuganje shimpegwanje nkupinga kwiinonyela kwenunji kutimilile.<verse eid="JHN 16:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Shilambolyo Nishikombwele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 16:25"/>“Njikummalanjilanga genega kwa ndango. Ikabheje malanga ganakwiya ngammalanjilanga kabhili kwa ndango, ikabhe shinimmalanjilanje ga Atati gwangali nng'iyo. <verse eid="JHN 16:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 16:26"/>Gene mobhago shinnjuganje kwa lina lyangu, wala ngakummalanjilanga kuti shininjujilanje kwa Atati, <verse eid="JHN 16:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 16:27"/>pabha bhayene Atati bhanakumpinganga, kwa ligongo lya mbinganga nne nikulupalila kuti kungoposhele kwa a Nnungu. <verse eid="JHN 16:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 16:28"/>Nne kungopweshe kwa Atati, gung'ishe kushilambolyo na nnaino ngunakushileka shilambolyo kubhuja kwa Atati.”<verse eid="JHN 16:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 16:29"/>Bhai bhaajiganywa bhabho gubhaalugulilenje, “Nnole! Nnaino nnabheleketa gwangali nng'iyo wala nkabheleketa kwa ndango. <verse eid="JHN 16:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 16:30"/>Nnaino tumumanyi kuti mmwe nnakwiimanya indu yowe, wala ikapinjikwa mundu jojowe kummuya, kwa nneyo tunaakulupalila kuti kunkoposhele kwa a Nnungu.”<verse eid="JHN 16:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 16:31"/>A Yeshu gubhaajangwilenje, “Bhuli, nnaino nnikulupalilanga? <verse eid="JHN 16:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 16:32"/>Malanga ganakwiya, numbe gaishe, mmowenji shimpwilingananje kila mundu kunngwakwe, nne shinnekanje jikape. Mbena, nne nngabha puni jikape, pabha Atati pubhali pamo na nne. <verse eid="JHN 16:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 16:33"/>Njikummalanjilanga genego nkupinga nkolanje ulele gwa lundana na nne. Pashilambolyo nkwetenje shilaje, ikabheje mwilumanje ntima, nne nishikombwele shilambolyo!”<verse eid="JHN 16:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JHN 17"/>
  <para style="s">A Yeshu Bhanakwaajujilanga Bhaajiganywa Bhabho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 17:1"/>A Yeshu bhakabheleketeje genego, gubhalolile kunani kunnungu, gubhashite, “Atati, malanga gaishe! Munkuye Mwanagwenu, nkupinga na jwalakwe Mwana ankuye. <verse eid="JHN 17:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 17:2"/>Pabha mwashinkumpa Mwanagwenu mashili kubhandu bhowe nkupinga bhowe bhumwampele abhapanganje gumi gwa pitipiti. <verse eid="JHN 17:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 17:3"/>Na gumi gwa pitipiti ni aguno, kummanya mmwe nni jikape a Nnungu bha kweli, na kwaamanya a Yeshu Kilishitu bhumwaatumile. <verse eid="JHN 17:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 17:4"/>Nne njikunkuya mmwe pa shilambolyo pano, maliye liengo limwaambele ndende lila. <verse eid="JHN 17:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 17:5"/>Atati, nnaino nnguye, kwa ukonjelo gunaakwete punaliji na mmwe shilambolyo shikanabhe panganywa gula.<verse eid="JHN 17:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 17:6"/>“Njikulitenda lina lyenu limanyishe ku bhandu bha pa shilambolyo bhummbele bhala. Pubhalinginji bhenu, gummbele nne bhabhanganje bhangu, numbe bhakundilenje lilobhe lyenu. <verse eid="JHN 17:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 17:7"/>Nnaino bhamumanyinji kuti yowe immbele, kuikopweshe kunngwenu mmwe. <verse eid="JHN 17:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 17:8"/>Nne naapelenje lilobhe limwaammbele lila, nabhalabhonji bhaliposhelenje, bhamumanyinji kuti kweli kungoposhele kunngwenu mmwe, na bhakulupalilenje kuti mmwe ninndumile.”<verse eid="JHN 17:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 17:9"/>“Nne ngunakwaajujilanga bhenebho, ngakushijujila shilambolyo, ikabhe ngunakwaajujilanga bhummbele bhala, pabha bhenu. <verse eid="JHN 17:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 17:10"/>Yowe ingwete ni yenu mmwe, na yenu ni yangu na ukonjelo gwangu ubhoneshe ku bhene bhumbele bhala. <verse eid="JHN 17:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 17:11"/>Na nnaino wala ngalonjeya pashilambolyo, ngunakwiya kunngwenu, ikabheje bhanganyabha launo pubhapalinji pashilambolyo. Atati bha ukonjelo! Kwa mashili ga lina lyenu limmbele, shonde mwaapanganje ulinda nkupinga bhabhanganje shindu shimo, malinga shituli uwe. <verse eid="JHN 17:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 17:12"/>Punaliji pamo na bhanganyabho, nne nashinkwaapanganga ulinda kwa mashili ga lina lyenu limmbele. Nne naabhishilenje muulinda, wala jwakwa nkali jumo jwabhonji apinga kuobha, ikabhe amanyishe kuti mwana jwa obha jula, nkupinga Majandiko ga Ukonjelo gamalile.”<verse eid="JHN 17:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 17:13"/>“Bhai, nnaino ngunakwiya kunngwenu, gene malobhega njibheleketa nili pa shilambolyope pano, nkupinga bhainonyelanje mmitima jabhonji kwa ligongo lyangu. <verse eid="JHN 17:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 17:14"/>Nne naapelenje lilobhe lyenu na shilambolyo gushaashimilenje, pabha bhanganyabho nngabha bha pa shilambolyo, malinga shini nne nngabha jwa pa shilambolyo. <verse eid="JHN 17:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 17:15"/>Ngaajuga kuti mwaashoyanje pa shilambolyo, ikabhe ngunaajuga mwaembuyanje na jwangali jwa mmbone jula. <verse eid="JHN 17:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 17:16"/>Bhanganyabho nngabha bha pa shilambolyo, malinga shini nne nngabha jwa pa shilambolyo. <verse eid="JHN 17:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 17:17"/>Mwaatakayanje kwa kweli jila, lilobhe lyenu ni kweli. <verse eid="JHN 17:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 17:18"/>Malinga shinndumile nne ku shilambolyo na nne nnepeyo njikwaatumanga ku shilambolyo, <verse eid="JHN 17:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 17:19"/>na kwa ligongo lya bhanganyabho ngunakwiishoya namwene nkupinga na bhalabhonji bhaishoyanje na kweli jila.<verse eid="JHN 17:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 17:20"/>“Bhungwaajujilanga nngabha bhanganya pebho, ikabhe bhowe shibhakulupalilanje kwa ligongo lya lilobhe lyabhonji. <verse eid="JHN 17:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 17:21"/>Ngunaajuga nkupinga bhowe bhabhanganje shindu shimo. Atati! Ngunaajuga bhabhanganje nkati jetu, malinga mmwe Atati shinni nkati jangu, na nne nkati jenu. Ngunaajuga bhabhanganje shindu shimo nkupinga shilambolyo shikulupalile kuti mmwe ni nndumile. <verse eid="JHN 17:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 17:22"/>Nne naapelenje ukonjelo malinga gumwaambele gula, nkupinga bhabhanganje shindu shimo malinga shituli uwe. <verse eid="JHN 17:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 17:23"/>Nne ndame nkati jabhonji, na mmwe nkati jangu nne, nkupinga bhamalilanje kubha shindu shimope, nkupinga shilambolyo shimanye kuti mmwe ni nndumile, mmwe nnakwaapinganga bhanganyabho malinga shinkumbinga nne.”<verse eid="JHN 17:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 17:24"/>“Atati! Shingupinga bhummbele bhala bhabhanganje pamo na nne popowe pushindame, nkupinga bhagubhonanje Ukonjelo gwangu gummbele, pabha nshinkumbinga shilambolyo shikanabhe panganywa. <verse eid="JHN 17:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 17:25"/>Atati mmambone! Shilambolyo shikakummanya, ikabhe nne nimmanyi, bhanganyabha bhamumanyinji kuti mmwe ni nndumile. <verse eid="JHN 17:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 17:26"/>Njitenda lina lyenu limanyishe ku bhanganyabho, na shimbunde kutenda nneyo, nkupinga kumbinga kwenu, kubhe mmitima jabhonji, na nne namwene mme mmunda jabhonji.”<verse eid="JHN 17:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JHN 18"/>
  <para style="s">Kukamulwa kwa a Yeshu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 18:1"/>A Yeshu bhakabheleketeje genego, gubhajabhwile na bhaajiganywa bhabho gubhapite kung'ambu lushi lwa Kedoloni. Kweneko jashinkupagwa bhushitani, a Yeshu gubhajinjile mwenemo na bhaajiganywa bhabho. <verse eid="JHN 18:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 18:2"/>A Yuda bhaatendebhushe a Yeshu bhapamanyi penepo, pabha a Yeshu bhatendaga kwenda kweneko papagwinji na bhaajiganywa bhabho. <verse eid="JHN 18:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 18:3"/>Bhai, a Yuda gubhaishe kubhushitani kula bhali bhalongene na likundi likulungwa lya manjola na bhalinda kukoposhela kwa bhakulungwanji bhaabhishila na Ashimapalishayo, bhajigelenje yenje na ikomanilo. <verse eid="JHN 18:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 18:4"/>Bhai a Yeshu bhalinkugamanya gowe gapinga kwaakoposhela, gubhakoposhele nikwaabhuyanga, “Junkunoleyanga gani?”<verse eid="JHN 18:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 18:5"/>Nabhalabhonji gubhaajangwilenje, “A Yeshu Bhanashaleti!” A Yeshu gubhaalugulilenje, “Nne ni nne.” A Yuda bhaatendebhwishe bhala, na bhalabho pubhaliji bhajimi nabhonji.<verse eid="JHN 18:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 18:6"/>Bhai, a Yeshu bhakaalugulilanjeje kuti, “Nne ni nne” gubhanokolenenje kubhuja nnyuma gubhaagwilenje pai. <verse eid="JHN 18:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 18:7"/>A Yeshu gubhaabhushiyenje kabhili, “Junkunnoleyanga gani?” Gubhaajangwilenje, “A Yeshu Bhanashaleti!”<verse eid="JHN 18:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 18:8"/>A Yeshu gubhaalugulilenje, “Nimmalanjilenje kuti, Nne ni nne. Bhai monaga nkunoleyanga nne, mwaalekanje bhanganyabha bhaijendanganile.” <verse eid="JHN 18:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 18:9"/>Bhashinkubheleketa genego nkupinga gatimilile malobhe gubhabhelekete kuti, “Bhummbele bhala nangaang'obhiya nkali jumo.”<verse eid="JHN 18:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 18:10"/>Bhai, a Shimoni Petili bhashinkukola upanga, gubhaguolomwele nikunkata lishikio lya kunkono nnilo, lika ntumishi jwa bhakulungwa bhaabhishila. Jwene ntumishijo pashemwaga Malikushi. <verse eid="JHN 18:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 18:11"/>Bhai, a Yeshu gubhaabhalanjile a Petili, “Mmujenago upanga gwenu nnigonelo lyakwe. Bhuli, ngunapapile shikombe sha mboteko shibhambele Atati?”<verse eid="JHN 18:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">A Yeshu Bhanapelekwa ku Bhakulungwa Bhabhishila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 18:12"/>Bhai likundi lya manjola lila na nkulungwa jwabhonji jula na bhalinda bha Bhayaudi bhala gubhaakamwilenje a Yeshu, gubhaatabhilenje. <verse eid="JHN 18:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 18:13"/>Gubhatandubhenje kwapeleka kwa a Anashi, akwebhabho a Kayapa, bhaliji Bhakulungwa Bhabhishila shene shakasho. <verse eid="JHN 18:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 18:14"/>A Kayapa ni bhebhala bhaalugulilenje Bhayaudi kuti mbaya mundu jumo awe kwa ligongo lya bhandunji.<verse eid="JHN 18:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">A Petili Bhanakana Kwaamanya a Yeshu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:69-70">Matei 26:69-70</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:66-68">Maliko 14:66-68</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:55-57">Luka 22:55-57</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 18:15"/>A Shimoni Petili na nkujiganywa juna gubhaakagwilenje a Yeshu. Jwene nkujiganywajo atendaga manyika na Bhakulungwa Bhabhishila, kwa nneyo gwajinjile palukumbi lwa Bhakulungwa Bhabhishila lubhajinjile a Yeshu. <verse eid="JHN 18:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 18:16"/>Ikabheje a Petili pubhajimi palanga, tome na nnango. Bhai, bhaajiganywa bhana bhamanyishe na Bhakulungwa Bhabhishila bhala gubhakopweshe palanga nikunguluka na jwankongwe nninda jwa pannango, akwaajinjiyaga a Petili nkati. <verse eid="JHN 18:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 18:17"/>Bhai bhakongwe bhalinda bha nnango bhala gubhaabhushiye a Petili, “Bhuli, mmwe nkumbi gumo gwa bhaajiganywa bha bhene bhandubha?” A Petili gubhashite, “Nngabha nne!”<verse eid="JHN 18:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 18:18"/>Bhatumwa na bhalinda bhala bhashinkukumbanyanga moto gwa jota pabha jishinkupagwa mmbepo, gubhatemingene nkujota moto. Na bhalabho a Petili gubhajimi pamo nabhonji nkujota moto.<verse eid="JHN 18:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Bhakulungwa Bhabhishila Bhanakwaabhuya a Yeshu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:59-66">Matei 26:59-66</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:55-64">Maliko 14:55-64</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:66-71">Luka 22:66-71</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 18:19"/>Bhai Bhakulungwa Bhabhishila gubhaabhushiye a Yeshu ga bhaajiganywa bhabho na ga majiganyo gabho. <verse eid="JHN 18:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 18:20"/>A Yeshu gubhaajangwile, “Nne mobha gowe natendaga bheleketa pa lugwinjili lwa bhandu gwangali nng'iyo na papagwinji natendaga jiganya nshinagogi na ku likanisha, pubhaimanangaga Bhayaudi bhowe, wala nangabheleketa shoshowe kwa nng'iyo. <verse eid="JHN 18:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 18:21"/>Pakuti nnaamuya nne? Mwaabhuyanje bhapilikenenje bhala nndi inaalugulilenje. Bhanganyabho bhagamanyinji gunaalugulilenje.”<verse eid="JHN 18:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 18:22"/>Bhai bhakamaliyeje bheleketa nneyo, bhalinda bhamo bhaajimi tome gubhaakomile lipapa a Yeshu bhalinkuti, “Mmwe nnakwaajangula bhuli nneyo, bhakulungwa bhaabhishila?”<verse eid="JHN 18:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 18:23"/>A Yeshu gubhaajangwile, “Monaga njibheleketa gangali ga mmbone, mmalanjile gwangali gwa mmbone gwakwe, monaga gumelekete ga mmbone, shinkungomela nndi?”<verse eid="JHN 18:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 18:24"/>Bhai, a Anashi gubhaapeleshe a Yeshu kwa a Kayapa bhakulungwa bhaabhishila, bhali bhatabhwilwe.<verse eid="JHN 18:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">A Petili Bhanakana Kabhili Kwaamanya a Yeshu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:71-75">Matei 26:71-75</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:69-72">Maliko 14:69-72</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:58-62">Luka 22:58-62</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 18:25"/>A Shimoni Petili gubhajimi penepo, nkujota moto. Bhai, gubhaabhushiyenje, “Bhuli, nkali mmwe nngabha nkumbi gumo gwa bhaajiganywa bhabho?” Nabhalabho gubhakanile bhalinkuti, “Nngabha nne!” <verse eid="JHN 18:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 18:26"/>Ntumishi jumo jwa bhakulungwa bhaabhishila, nnongo nnjakwe akatilwe lishikio na a Petili jula, akwaabhuyaga, “Bhuli, nne nangammona mmwe kubhushitani nni pamo na bhenebho?”<verse eid="JHN 18:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 18:27"/>A Petili gubhakanile kabhili, na shangu lipongo gwakongobhele.<verse eid="JHN 18:27"/></para>
  <para style="s">A Yeshu kwa a Pilato</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Matei 27:1-2</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">11-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:1-5">Maliko 15:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1-5">Luka 23:1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 18:28"/>Kungai gubhaashoshiyenje a Yeshu kwa a Kayapa, gubhaapelekenje kwa a mpalume bha Shilumi bhashemwaga a Pilato. Puyaliji tome kumashelo, ikabheje ashaayenenji bhangajinjilanga nnukumbi mula, nkupinga bhanakolanje yambi nikwaibhililanga kulya Pashaka. <verse eid="JHN 18:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 18:29"/>Bhai, a Pilato a Mpalume bha Shilumi bhala, nigubhakopweshe palanga gubhaabhushiyenje, “Bhalebhile nndi bhene bhandubha?”<verse eid="JHN 18:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 18:30"/>Gubhaajangwilenje, “Kaliji bhangalebha, ngutukaapelesheje kunngwenu mmwe.”<verse eid="JHN 18:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 18:31"/>A Pilato gubhaalugulilenje, “Ayaga mwaatolanje mwashaayenenji nkaaukumulanje malinga shalia jenunji.” Bhai Bhayaudi gubhaajangwilenje, “Uwe tukapinjikwa kunng'ukumula mundu jojowe kuwa.” <verse eid="JHN 18:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 18:32"/>Ishinkutendeka nneyo nkupinga gatimilile malobhe gubhabhelekete a Yeshu bhalilanguya shiwo shashi shishibhawe.<verse eid="JHN 18:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 18:33"/>Bhai, a Pilato gubhajinjile kabhili nnukumbi lukulu lushemwa Pulaitolio, gubhaashemile a Yeshu nikwaabhuya, “Bhuli! Mmwe Mmakulungwa bha Bhayaudi?”<verse eid="JHN 18:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 18:34"/>A Yeshu gubhaajangwile, “Bhuli! Genego malobhe genu mmayene, eu nshibhalanjilwa na bhandunji, gangu nne?”<verse eid="JHN 18:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 18:35"/>A Pilato gubhaajangwile, “Ama! Bhuli nne Nnyaudi? Bhashilambo ajenunji na bhakulungwa bhaabhishila bhenu bhanjienabhonji kwangu nne. Nntendile nndi?”<verse eid="JHN 18:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 18:36"/>A Yeshu gubhajangwile, “Upalume gwangu nngabha gwa pa shilambolyo. Monaga upalume gwangu ukaliji gwa pa shilambolyo pano, ashimanjola bhangu bhakangomanilenje nkupinga ngunakamulwe na Bhayaudi. Ikabheje upalume gwangu nngabha gwa pepano.”<verse eid="JHN 18:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 18:37"/>Penepo a Pilato gubhaabhushiye, “Bhai, Mmwe mmapalume?” A Yeshu gubhajangwile, “Mmwe mmelekete kuti, nne mpalume. Nne njibhelekwa kwa ligongo lya genego na genego ni gung'ishile pa shilambolyo, nkupinga ngong'ondele kweli kubhandunji. Jojowe akwete kweli anambilikanishiya nne.”<verse eid="JHN 18:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 18:38"/>A Pilato bhakwaabhuyaga, “Kweli ni nndi?”</para>
  <para style="s" vid="JHN 18:38">A Yeshu Bhanaukumulwa Kuwa</para>
  <para style="r" vid="JHN 18:38">(<ref loc="MAT 27:15-31">Matei 27:15-31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:6-20">Maliko 15:6-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">Luka 23:13-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:38">A Pilato bhakabheleketeje genego gubhaajendelenje Bhayaudi kabhili, gubhaalugulilenje “Nne ngakushibhona shoshowe shibhalebhile bhenebha. <verse eid="JHN 18:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 18:39"/>Ikabheje nkwetenje nnkubho gwa kuti nne ning'ugulilanje nkutabhwa jumo mobha ga Pashaka. Bhuli, nnapinganga ning'ugulilanje A mpalume bha Bhayaudi?”<verse eid="JHN 18:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 18:40"/>Penepo gubhajobhelenje, “Ng'oo! Nngabha bhenebha ikabhe a Bhalabha!” A Bhalabha bhashinkutabhwa kwa ligongo lya ujambashi.<verse eid="JHN 18:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JHN 19"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 19:1"/>Bhai, a Pilato gubhaatolile a Yeshu gubhaakomile mishapilo. <verse eid="JHN 19:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 19:2"/>Na bhalabhonji ashimanjola nkwaalembula, gubhaeleyenje ulemba gwa mibha, gubhaawashiyenje a Yeshu muntwe mbuti ulemba gwa shipalume, gubhaawashiyenje na nngubho ja langi ja shambalau. <verse eid="JHN 19:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 19:3"/>Gubhaajendelenje, bhalinkutinji “Tunakunkomaya a mpalume bha Bhayaudi!” Gubhaakomilenje mapapa mmatukwa.<verse eid="JHN 19:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 19:4"/>Kungai a Pilato gubhakopweshe kabhili palanga, gubhaalugulilenje, “Nnolanje, ngunakwiya nabho kabhili kwenu mmanganya mmumanyanje kuti nne, nangashibhona shoshowe shibhalebhile.” <verse eid="JHN 19:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 19:5"/>Bhai, a Yeshu gubhakopweshe palanga bhawete ulemba gwa mibha na nngubho ja langi ja shambalau. A Pilato gubhaalugulilenje bhandunji bhala, “Nnolanje! Abha apano.”<verse eid="JHN 19:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 19:6"/>Bhai, Bhakulungwa bhaabhishila na bhalinda bhakaabhonanjeje a Yeshu gubhautiyenje lilobhe bhalinkutinji, “Mwaabhambe munshalabha! Mwaabhambe munshalabha!” A Pilato gubhaalugulilenje, “Bhai, mwaatolanje mwaashayenenji nkaabhambanje munshalabha, pabha nne ngakushibhona shibhalebhile.”<verse eid="JHN 19:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 19:7"/>Bhayaudi gubhaajangwilenje, “Uwe tukwete shalia ja kwaukumula, pabha bhashinkwiitenda kuti Mwana jwa a Nnungu.”<verse eid="JHN 19:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 19:8"/>Bhai a Pilato bhakapilikaneje gene malobhego gubhapundile jogopa. <verse eid="JHN 19:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 19:9"/>Bhai, gubhajinjile kabhili nnukumbi lukulu lushemwa Pulaitolio, gubhaabhushiye a Yeshu, “Mmwe kunkoposhele kwai?” Ikabheje a Yeshu bhangaajangula shindu shoshowe. <verse eid="JHN 19:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 19:10"/>Bhai a Pilato gubhaalugulile “Nkaapinga kubheleketa na nne? Bhuli nkaakumumanya kuti nne njikola ukulungwa gwa kunngopola na gwa kummamba munshalabha?”<verse eid="JHN 19:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 19:11"/>A Yeshu gubhaajangwile, “Mmwe ngunkakweteje upalume gogowe kwangu nne gwangali pegwa na a Nnungu. Kwa nneyo jwene angamwiye kwenu mmwejo, ashikola shambi shikulungwa.”<verse eid="JHN 19:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 19:12"/>Tandubhila penepo a Pilato gubhaloleye shanabhuli shibhaagopole, ikabheje Bhayaudi gubhajobhelenje bhalinkutinji, “Mwaagopolaga bhenebha, mmwe mwangali shilongani na a Kaishali a mpalume bhakulu bha Loma, kila mundu akwiitenda mpalume anakwaatendebhuka a Kaishali!”<verse eid="JHN 19:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 19:13"/>Bhai a Pilato, bhakapilikaneje gene malobhego, gubhakopweshe nabho a Yeshu palanga, gubhatemi pashitengu sha ukumu, pashemwaga “lupenu lwa maganga” eu kwa Shiebhulania, “Gabhasha.”<verse eid="JHN 19:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 19:14"/>Puyaliji mui malanga ga shaa shita nnei, lyubha lya kolokoya Pashaka. A Pilato gubhaalugulilenje Bhayaudi, “Mwaalolanje! A mpalume bhenunji!”<verse eid="JHN 19:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 19:15"/>Bhai, bhanganyabho gubhajobhelenje, “Mwaashoye! Mwashoye! Bhabhambwe munshalabha!” A Pilato gubhaabhushiyenje, “Bhuli naabhambe munshalabha a mpalume bhenunji?” Bhakulungwanji bhaabhishila gubhajangwilenje, “Uwe twangali a mpalume ikabhe a Kaishali!”<verse eid="JHN 19:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 19:16"/>Penepo a Pilato gubhaakamwiyenje a Yeshu nkupinga bhaabhambe munshalabha, na bhalabhonji gubhaaposhelenje.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="JHN 19:16">A Yeshu Bhanaakomelwa Munshalabha</para>
  <para style="r" vid="JHN 19:16">(<ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Matei 27:32-44</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Maliko 15:21-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Luka 23:26-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:16">Bhai, gubhaatolilenje a Yeshu. <verse eid="JHN 19:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 19:17"/>Na bhalabho gubhakopweshe palanga akuno bhajigele nshalabha gwabho, kuloya mmbali pashemwaga “Shibhanga sha Ntwe” kwa Shiebhulania Goligota. <verse eid="JHN 19:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 19:18"/>Penepo nipubhaabhambilenje munshalabha a Yeshu na bhandu bhananji bhabhili, jumo nkono gwabho gwa nnilo, na juna nkono nshinda gwabho na a Yeshu pakati pakati. <verse eid="JHN 19:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 19:19"/>Na bhalabho a Pilato gubhajandishe mmbila panani nshalabha, jijandikwe nnei, “A YESHU BHANASHALETI, A MPALUME BHA BHAYAUDI.” <verse eid="JHN 19:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 19:20"/>Bhai Bhayaudi bhabhagwinji gubhashomilenje jene mmbilajo, pabha pubhaabhambilenje munshalabha a Yeshu, pupaaliji tome na shilambo. Na jene mmbilajo pujajandikwe kwa Shiebhulania na Shilatini na Shigiliki. <verse eid="JHN 19:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 19:21"/>Bhai, bhakulungwanji bha bhaabhishila na Bhayaudi gubhaalugulilenje a Pilato, “Nnajandishe. ‘A mpalume bha Bhayaudi,’ ikabhe bhashinkubheleketa bhayene kuti, ‘Nne mpalume jwa Bhayaudi.’ ”<verse eid="JHN 19:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 19:22"/>A Pilato gubhajangwile, “Gunyandishe, nigajandishe!”<verse eid="JHN 19:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 19:23"/>Ashimanjola bhala bhakaabhambanjeje a Yeshu munshalabha, gubhatolilenje nngubho yabho, gubhagebhenyenje maungu nsheshe, malinga shibhalinginji. Gubhatolilenje na kanshu jabho, jenejo pujaliji ja lukwa. <verse eid="JHN 19:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 19:24"/>Bhai, gubhalugulilenenje, “Tunajipapule, ikabhe tutende shikoma jibhe jika gani.” Genego gashinkutendeka nkupinga gatimilile Majandiko ga Ukonjelo ga taya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 19:24">“Bhashinkugabhananga nngubho yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 19:24">Na nngubho jangu gubhaagulenje kwa shikoma.”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="JHN 19:24">Bhai nneyo, ni shibhatendilenje ashimanjola bhala.<verse eid="JHN 19:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 19:25"/>Tome na nshalabha gwa a Yeshu bhashinkujimangana anyinabhabho, na a Malia akulu bhabho anyinabhabho akongobhabho a Kileopashi, na a Malia Magidalena. <verse eid="JHN 19:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 19:26"/>Bhai, a Yeshu bhakaabhoneje anyinabhabho na nkujiganywa jubhampinjile jula ajimi patome, gubhaalugulile anyinabhabho, “A Mama! Munnole, mwanagwenu.” <verse eid="JHN 19:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 19:27"/>Kungai gubhaannugulile nkujiganywa jula. “Mwaalole, anyina bhenu.” Kutandubhila penepo, bhaajiganywa bhala gubhaatolile anyina bhabho a Yeshu bhakatame kunngwabho.<verse eid="JHN 19:27"/></para>
  <para style="s">A Yeshu Bhanawa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Matei 27:45-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Maliko 15:33-41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Luka 23:44-49</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 19:28"/>Kungai, a Yeshu akuno bhalikumumanya kuti gowe gamalile, nkupinga Majandiko ga Ukonjelo gatimilile, gubhashite, “Njikola njota.” <verse eid="JHN 19:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 19:29"/>Penepo jashinkupagwa bhakuli jigumbeywe divai ja shashama. Bhai, gubhashubhikenje shiponji mmakuli ja divai ja shashama jila, gubhatabhilenje nnubhalabhala lwa nkongo ushemwa ishopo, gubhaabhishilenje pa kang'wa. <verse eid="JHN 19:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 19:30"/>Bhai a Yeshu bhakapapileje divai ja shashama jila, gubhashite, “Gamalile!” Kungai gubhakotime nntwe, gubhamalile.<verse eid="JHN 19:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">A Yeshu Bhanaomwa Lipanga Mmbalati</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 19:31"/>Bhai pabha pulyaaliji lyubha lya kolokoya kwa Lyubha lya Pumulila. Kwa nneyo ikapinjikwaga iilu ilepeshe munshalabha Lyubha lya Pumulila, pabha lyene lyubhalyo pulyaaliji likulungwa, Bhayaudi gubhaajujilenje a Pilato bhakaatemanje makongono bhakomelenjwe munshalabha bhala nkupinga bhawanganje shangu, na iilu yabhonji ishoywe mmishalabha. <verse eid="JHN 19:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 19:32"/>Bhai, ashimanjola gubhapite kuntemanga makongono mundu jwa nntai na jwa bhili, bhakomelwenje munshalabha pamo na a Yeshu bhala. <verse eid="JHN 19:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 19:33"/>Ikabheje bhakaishilanjeje a Yeshu, gubhaaimenje bhali bhawile, kwa nneyo bhangaatemanga makongono. <verse eid="JHN 19:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 19:34"/>Ikabheje linjola jumo gwabhaomile lipanga lya mmbalati, bhai gujikopweshe minyai na mashi. <verse eid="JHN 19:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 19:35"/>Kwa nneyo, jwene agabhweni genego ni akong'ondela, nkupinga na mmanganyanji nkulupalilanje. Na gene gabheleketego ni ga kweli, numbe amumanyi kuti anabheleketa ga kweli. <verse eid="JHN 19:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 19:36"/>Pabha genega gashinkutendeka nkupinga Majandiko ga Ukonjelo gatimilile ga taya kuti, “Lyakwa nkali liupa lyabho limo shilitemanywe.” <verse eid="JHN 19:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 19:37"/>Na majandiko gana gakuti, “Shibhannolanje jubhanng'omilenje lipanga jula.”<verse eid="JHN 19:37"/></para>
  <para style="s">A Yeshu Bhanashikwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Matei 27:57-61</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Maliko 15:42-47</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Luka 23:50-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 19:38"/>Gakapiteje genego, a Yoshepu bha ku Alimataya, gubhaajujile a Pilato bhatole shiilu sha a Yeshu. A Yoshepu pubhaliji bhaajiganywa bha a Yeshu, ikabheje kwa nng'iyo, pabha bhatendaga kwaajogopanga ashikalongolele bha Shiyaudi. Bhai, a Pilato gubhajitishiye. Kwa nneyo a Yoshepu gubhapite shoya shiilu sha a Yeshu. <verse eid="JHN 19:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 19:39"/>Na bhalabho a Nikodemo bhene bhaajendele a Yeshu shilo gwa ntai bhala, gubhapite na a Yoshepu bhali bhajigele mauta ga nunjila, gaengenywe na manemane na lubhani kilo makumi gatatu. <verse eid="JHN 19:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 19:40"/>Bhai, gubhatolilenje shiilu sha a Yeshu shila, gubhailijililenje shanda shammbone sha kitani bhali bhatajilenje mauta malinga pugwaliji nkubho gwa Bhayaudi nkushika. <verse eid="JHN 19:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 19:41"/>Pubhabhambilwe munshalabha a Yeshu pala, jashinkupagwa bhushitani na nkati jakwe lyashinkupagwa likabhuli lya ambi likanabhe shikwa mundu jojowe. <verse eid="JHN 19:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 19:42"/>Pabha Bhayaudi pubhalinginji nkukolokoya ga Lyubha lya Pumulila, na likabhulilyo pulyaaliji pa tome, bhai gubhaabhishilenje a Yeshu mwenemo.<verse eid="JHN 19:42"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JHN 20"/>
  <para style="s">Kuyuka kwa a Yeshu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:1-8">Matei 28:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:1-8">Maliko 16:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Luka 24:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 20:1"/>Lyambape Jumapili kuli na lubhindu a Malia Magidalena gubhapite kulikabhuli, gubhalibhweni liganga lila lishoshiywe pannango gwa likabhuli. <verse eid="JHN 20:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 20:2"/>12 Bhai, gubhabhujile lubhilo kubhaaliji a Shimoni Petili na bhaajiganywa bhaanonyelaga a Yeshu bhala, nikwaabhalanjilanga, “Bhashikwaashoyanga Bhakulungwa nnikabhuli mula, wala tukakukumanya kubhaabhishilenje.”<verse eid="JHN 20:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 20:3"/>Bhai a Petili na nkujiganywa juna jula, gubhapitengene kulikabhuli. <verse eid="JHN 20:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 20:4"/>Gubhapitengene lubhilo bhowe bhanabhili, ikabheje nkujiganywa juna jula ashinkubhutuka kwaapunda a Petili, gwalongolele kuika kulikabhuli. <verse eid="JHN 20:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 20:5"/>Gwakotime kuulumila nnikabhuli, gwajibhweni shanda, ikabheje jwangajinjila nkati. <verse eid="JHN 20:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 20:6"/>Bhai gubhaishe na a Shimoni Petili, gubhajinjile nnikabhuli, mwenemo gubhajibhweni shanda, <verse eid="JHN 20:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 20:7"/>na shitambaa shibhailijilwe a Yeshu ku ntwe. Shene shitambaasho shikaliji pamo na shanda jila, ikabhe shashinkuiligwa kunyenje pa jikape. <verse eid="JHN 20:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 20:8"/>Kungai bhaajiganywa bhalongolele kuika kulikabhuli bhala, na bhalabho gubhajinjile nkati, gubhalolile nigubhakulupalile. <verse eid="JHN 20:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 20:9"/>Pabha bhakagamanyinjiji Majandiko ga Ukonjelo gatayaga kuti, yashinkupinjikwa a Yeshu bhawaga, bhayushe. <verse eid="JHN 20:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 20:10"/>Bhai, bhaajiganywa bhala gubhabhujengenenje kwenda kunngwabhonji.<verse eid="JHN 20:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">A Yeshu Bhanakwaakoposhela a Malia bha ku Magidala</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:9-10">Matei 28:9-10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:9-11">Maliko 16:9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 20:11"/>Ikabheje a Malia Magidalena pubhajimi palanga likabhuli, bhaliguta. Akuno bhali nkuguta gubhakotime kuulumilla nnikabhuli, <verse eid="JHN 20:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 20:12"/>gubhaabhweninji ashimalaika bhabhili bhawetenje nngubho yanawe, bhali bhatemingene pubhagoneshwe a Yeshu pala, jumo kugwaloshiye ntwe na juna kugaliji makongono. <verse eid="JHN 20:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 20:13"/>Ashimalaika bhala, bhakwaabhuyangaga, “Mama, pakuti nnaguta?” Bhalabho gubhaajangwilenje, “Pabha bhashikwaashoyanga Bhakulungwa bhangu na wala ngakukumanya kubhaabhishilenje!”<verse eid="JHN 20:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 20:14"/>Bhakabheleketeje genego gubhatendebhwishe nnyuma, gubhaabhweni a Yeshu bhajimi, ikabheje bhangaamanya kuti ni a Yeshu. <verse eid="JHN 20:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 20:15"/>A Yeshu bhakwaabhuyaga, “A Mama, kwa nndi nnaguta? Junkunnoleya gani?” A Malia bhaliganishiya kuti pana bhaalima bhushitani, gubhaalugulile, “Mmakulungwa, monaga mmwe mwaatolile, mmalanjile kumwaabhishile, ngaatole.”<verse eid="JHN 20:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 20:16"/>A Yeshu gubhaalugulile, “A Malia Magidalena!” Nabhalabho a Malia gubhatendebhwishe, gubhaalugulile kwa Shiebhulania, “Labhoni!” Malombolelo gakwe, “Mmaajiganya.”<verse eid="JHN 20:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 20:17"/>A Yeshu gubhaalugulile, “Nnangamule, pabha nganabhekwenda kwa Atati. Ikabheje nnjende kwa ashaalongo ajangu nkaabhalanjilanje, ngunakwenda kwa Atati bhali Ainabhenunji na mmanganyanji, na a Nnungu bhangu bhali na mmanganyanji a Nnungu bhenunji.”<verse eid="JHN 20:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 20:18"/>Kwa nneyo a Malia Magidalena, gubhapite kwaabhalanjilanga bhaajiganywa bhala ngani ja kuti, naabhweni Bhakulungwa na kuti bhashilugulilwa gene gowego.<verse eid="JHN 20:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">A Yeshu Bhanakwaakoposhelanga Bhaajiganywa Bhabho</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Matei 28:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Maliko 16:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Luka 24:36-49</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 20:19"/>Bhai puyaliji ligulo lya Jumapili, bhaajiganywa bha a Yeshu pubhalinginji pamo nnyumba, akuno bhaugelenje milango nkwajogopanga Bhayaudi. Bhai, gubhakoposhele a Yeshu gubhajimi pakati jabhonji, gubhaalugulilenje, “Ulele ubhe na mmanganyanji!” <verse eid="JHN 20:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 20:20"/>Bhakabheleketeje genego, gubhaalangwiyenje makono gabho na lubhalati lwabho. Bhai, bhaajiganywa bhala gubhainonyelenje ga kwaabhona Bhakulungwa. <verse eid="JHN 20:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 20:21"/>Bhai a Yeshu gubhaabhanjilenje kabhili, “Ulele ubhe na mmanganyanji! Malinga nne shibhandumile Atati, na nne ngunakuntumanga mmanganyanji.” <verse eid="JHN 20:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 20:22"/>Bhakabheleketeje genego, gubhaapepetelenje bhalinkuti, “Mposhelanje Mbumu jwa Ukonjelo. <verse eid="JHN 20:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 20:23"/>Mwaaleshelelangaga bhandunji yambi yabhonji, shibhaleshelelwanje, nkaaleshelelanje bhakaleshelelwanga.”<verse eid="JHN 20:23"/></para>
  <para style="s">A Yeshu na a Tomashi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 20:24"/>Ikabheje a Tomashi bhamo munkumbi gwa bhaajiganywa likumi limo na bhabhili bhala, bhashemwaga bhammba, bhakapaliji malanga gubhaishe a Yeshu. <verse eid="JHN 20:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 20:25"/>Bhai bhaajiganywa bhananji bhala gubhaalugulilenje, “Twaabhweni Bhakulungwa.” A Tomashi gubhashite, “Nne ngakulupalila kuti bhayushile, ngagabhone mabhabhule ga mishumali jibhakomelwe mmakono gabho na nyinjiye ngowe yangu mmbalati mubhaomilwe lipanga.”<verse eid="JHN 20:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 20:26"/>Bhai, lyubha lya nane, bhaajiganywa bhala pubhalinginji pamo kabhili nnyumba mula, na bhalabho a Tomashi bhaapali. Milango jili jiugelwe, ikabheje a Yeshu gubhaishe, gubhajimi pakati pakati jabhonji, gubhashite, “Ulele ubhe na mmanganyanji!” <verse eid="JHN 20:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 20:27"/>Kungai gubhaalugulile a Tomashi, “Nnjienasho shikowe shenu ntomaye mmakono gangu, nnjienago na nkono gwenu mmishe mmbalati yangu. Nnabhe mundu jwangakulupalila, ikabhe nkulupalile!”<verse eid="JHN 20:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 20:28"/>A Tomashi gubhaajangwile, “Mmakulungwa bhangu na a Nnungu bhangu!”<verse eid="JHN 20:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 20:29"/>A Yeshu gubhaabhalanjile, “Nkulupalile kuti nyushile, pabha mmweni. Mbaya bhaakulupalilanga gwangali kwiibhona.”<verse eid="JHN 20:29"/></para>
  <para style="s">Gatumbililwe Nshitabhu Shino</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 20:30"/>Bhai ipali ilangulo yaigwinji ibhatendile a Yeshu pubhaliji na bhaajiganywa bhabho yangajandikwa nshitabhumuno. <verse eid="JHN 20:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 20:31"/>Ikabheje yenei ishijandikwa Mmajandiko ga Ukonjelo kuti, nkupinga nkulupalilanje kuti a Yeshu ni a Kilishitu, Mwana jwa a Nnungu, na nkulupalilangaga nkolanje gumi kwa mashili ga lina lyabho.<verse eid="JHN 20:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JHN 21"/>
  <para style="s">A Yeshu Bhanabhoneka ku Bhaajiganywa Shabha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 21:1"/>Gakapiteje genego, a Yeshu gubhaakoposhelenje kabhili bhaajiganywa bhabho kunyenje litanda lya Tibheliya, puyaliji nnei. <verse eid="JHN 21:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 21:2"/>A Shimoni Petili na a Tomashi bhashemwaga Bhammba na a Natanaeli bha ku Kana ja Galilaya na bhana bhabhili bha a Shebhedayo na bhaajiganywa bhabho bhananji bhabhili, bhowe pubhalinginji pamo. <verse eid="JHN 21:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 21:3"/>A Shimoni Petili gubhaalugulilenje ajabhonji, “Ngunakwenda kutanda yamaki.” Nabhalabhonji gubhaajangwilenje, “Na uwe shitunkagule.” Bhai, gubhajabhwilenje, gubhakwelilenje muntumbwi, ikabheje shene shilosho bhangapatanga shindu. <verse eid="JHN 21:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 21:4"/>Lyambape, a Yeshu gubhajimi nnyenje litanda, ikabheje bhaajiganywa bhangaamanyanga kuti bhenabho a Yeshu. <verse eid="JHN 21:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 21:5"/>Bhai, a Yeshu gubhaabhushiyenje, “Ashibhanangu, mpatilenje shamaki jojowe?” Gubhaajangwilenje, “Nng'oo.”<verse eid="JHN 21:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 21:6"/>A Yeshu gubhaalugulilenje, “Ntejelanje lyau lyenunji nkono nnilo gwa ntumbwi gwenunji shimpatanje yamaki.” Bhai gubhatejelenje lyau lyabhonji, ikabheje gubhalepelenje kuuta kabhili kwa ligongo lya shuluka yamaki.<verse eid="JHN 21:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 21:7"/>Bhai nkujiganywa apingwaga na a Yeshu jula, gwabhabhalanjile a Petili, “Bhenebha Bhakulungwa!” A Shimoni Petili bhakapilikaneje kuti Bhakulungwa, gubhaitabhile nngubho jabho pabha bhakaweteje ukoto, gubhaitumbushiye mmashi. <verse eid="JHN 21:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 21:8"/>Ikabheje bhaajiganywa bhananji bhala gubhabhujilengene kunyenje litanda na ntumbwi gula, akuno bhaliutanga lyau ligumbele yamaki, pabha yaliji tome kulitaka, pubhalinginji malinga meta makumi kumi kukoposhela kunyenje litanda. <verse eid="JHN 21:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 21:9"/>Bhai bhakaikanjeje kulitaka, gubhagubhweninji moto gwa makala na pantundu jakwe ilijokwa yamaki na nkate. <verse eid="JHN 21:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 21:10"/>A Yeshu gubhaalugulilenje, “Njianayonji yamaki ishoko intandilenje.”<verse eid="JHN 21:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 21:11"/>Bhai, a Shimoni Petili gubhakwelile muntumbwi mula, gubhautile lyau lila mpaka kulitaka, ligumbele yamaki yaikulungwa makumi kumi na nng'ano na itatu. Nkali yashulwishe nneyoyo, lyau lila lyangapapuka. <verse eid="JHN 21:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 21:12"/>A Yeshu gubhaabhalanjilenje, “Nnjiyangane kunnabhukanje.” Jwakwa nkali jumo alinjile kwaabhuya, “Mmwe agani?” Pabha bhaamanyinji kuti Bhakulungwa. <verse eid="JHN 21:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 21:13"/>A Yeshu gubhaishe, gubhatolile nkate, gubhaapelenje, gubhatendile nneyo peyo na yamaki ila.<verse eid="JHN 21:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 21:14"/>Gwenegu pugwaliji gwatatu a Yeshu kwiilanguya ku bhaajiganywa bhabho bhakayusheje.<verse eid="JHN 21:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">A Yeshu na a Petili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 21:15"/>Kungai bhakalyanganjeje, a Yeshu bhakwaabhuyaga a Shimoni Petili, “A Shimoni, bhanabhabho a Yowana! Bhuli, nnimbinga nne kupunda bhanganyanjibha?” Nabhalabho gubhajangwile, “Elo, Mmakulungwa, mmumanyi kuti nne ngulikumpinga.” A Yeshu gubhaabhanjile, “Nniye ngondolo yangu.”<verse eid="JHN 21:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 21:16"/>A Yeshu gubhaabhalanjile gwabhili, “A Shimoni, bhanabhabho a Yowana! Bhuli, nnimbinga?” A Petili gubhaajangwile, “Elo, Mmakulungwa, mmumanyi kuti nne ngulikumpinga.” A Yeshu gubhaabhalanjile, “Nshunje ngondolo yangu.”<verse eid="JHN 21:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 21:17"/>A Yeshu bhakwaabhuyaga a Petili gwatatu, “A Shimoni, bhanabhabho a Yowana! Bhuli nnimbinga?” Penepo a Petili gubhainjishe pabha bhashinkubhuywa gwatatu kuti, “Nnimbinga?” Gubhaajangwile, “Mmakulungwa, mmwe nngamanyi gowe, mmumannyi kuti nne ngulikumpinga.” A Yeshu gubhaabhalanjile, “Nniye ngondolo yangu!” <verse eid="JHN 21:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 21:18"/>Gubhashite, “Kweli ngunakummalanjila, pumwaliji mmashanda mwayobhelele kwiitabha nshipi gwenu nikwenda kokowe kunkupinga. Ikabheje pushinkongopale shinngoloye makono genu, na mundu juna shantabhe nikumpeleka kunkaapinga kwenda.” <verse eid="JHN 21:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 21:19"/>Kwa bheleketa nneyo, bhashinkulanguya shanabhuli a Petili pushibhawe nikwaakuya a Nnungu. Kungai gubhabhaalanjile, “Nngagule.”<verse eid="JHN 21:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">A Yeshu na Bhaajiganywa Bhana Bhala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 21:20"/>A Petili gubhatendebhwishe, gubhaabhweni bhaajiganywa bhapinjilwe na a Yeshu bhala bhalikagula. Bhene bhaajiganywabha nibhaatemi tome na a Yeshu bhalilyanganga shalya, nikwaabhuya, “Mmakulungwa gani apinga kuntendebhuka?” <verse eid="JHN 21:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 21:21"/>Bhai, a Petili bhakaabhoneje bhaajiganywabho, bhakwaabhuyaga a Yeshu, “Mmakulungwa na abha bhuli?”<verse eid="JHN 21:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 21:22"/>A Yeshu gubhaajangwile, “Monaga nne ngunapinga bhenebha bhanawe mpaka pushimuje, mmwe nkupinjila nndi? Mmwe nngagule nne.”<verse eid="JHN 21:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 21:23"/>Bhai, jene nganijo gujishumile munkumbi gwabhonji mula, kuti bhene bhaajiganywabho bhakawa. Ikabheje a Yeshu bhaangalugulila kuti bhaajiganywabho bhakawa, ikabhe, “Mbingaga bhenebha bhanawe, mmwe nkupinjila nndi?”<verse eid="JHN 21:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 21:24"/>Bhenebha ni bhaajiganywa bhakong'ondele yenei nikwiijandika. Na uwe tumumanyi kuti gubhabhelekete gala ga kweli.<verse eid="JHN 21:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mpelo gwa Shitabhu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 21:25"/>Ipali indu ina yaigwinji ibhatendile a Yeshu, monaga ikajandikwe yowe shimo shimo, punguganishiya kuti, nkali shilambolyo shikanatoshe kwa itabhu yowe ikajandikwe.<verse eid="JHN 21:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 21"/>
</usx>
